    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Moonlit Night Parade of Demons Order is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2026-08-05 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe yokai of legend, who assemble beneath the moon, will set the Hundred Demons' Parade into motion! Kirito, Asuna, Koharu, and Sachi command the parade in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe Moonlit Night Parade of Demons Order is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Racing Firewheel] Kirito\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nEarth Ripper Burst\nSkill Name\nEarth Ripper\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→Slash→\nEarth\n→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n37\nBreak Gauge\n74\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2020% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5600% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Earth element damage increases x 0.5% the number of poison stacks when the player is inflicted with the poison status ailment./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +100%, when equipping no Eiji Skill Records in the same set.\n・While Full Burst state/[Ruinous Earth 4/Buff] Earth element damage +75% for 20 sec.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Fox Spirit Under the Moon] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWind Viper\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n28\nSkill Effect\n2500% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Wind Force 4/Buff] Wind element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +20% for 20 sec.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Thrust Boost 3/Buff] Adds a buff where thrust elemental weakness damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Wind element damage +50%.\nLLv50: Wind element damage +50%.\nLLv100: While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 100%.\nLLv250: Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Demon Night Parade] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nEarth Shave\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n31\nSkill Effect\n2470% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nEarth damage +50% when using earth skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise earth damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Shrine of Phantoms] Sachi\nSkill Name\nEnhance HP/Phantom/Hold the Front\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2275\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance HP 4] Max HP increase 15%./[Phantom 3]When equipping 3 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%/[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n\"[Demon Night Parade] Koharu\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter August 5, 2026 (Wed) maintenance - August 31, 2026 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
