    "snippet": "Le 1er août, c'est l'anniversaire de Yui ! Nous organisons diverses campagnes dans SWORD ART ONLINE : Integral Factor pour célébrer l'anniversaire de Yui ! Célébrons tous ensemble cette merveilleuse journée !  Explorez le donjon avec Yui Un événement consacré à l'exploration de donjons avec Yui ! Obtenez l'avatar Pure White Dress conçu pour ressembler...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nAugust 1 is Yui's birthday! Lots of campaigns are being held! You've gotta check out this announcement!\nNOTICES\n2026-08-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAugust 1 is Yui's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor to celebrate Yui's birthday!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nExplore the Dungeon with Yui\nAn event all about dungeon-crawling with Yui!\nGet the Pure White Dress avatar designed to look like Yui's outfit, as well as limited-edition Chat Stamp!\nPeriod\nAugust 1, 2026 (Sat) 0:00 - Before August 13, 2026 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nYui's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Yui!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nYui's Birthday Order is here!\nDuration\nAugust 1, 2026 (Sat) 0:00 - August 10, 2026 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of Yui have been placed in four in-game locations!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nAugust 1, 2026 (Sat) 0:00 - August 10, 2026 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArcana Gem Gift\nLog in on the day of Yui's birthday to get a gift of 250 Arcana Gems!\nTime Limit\nAvailable until August 1, 2026 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
