    "snippet": "Maîtriser un, c’est tout apprendre ! L'Ordre des Avatars de l'Esprit Samouraï est de retour ! Obtenez des avatars dans 4 couleurs élégantes !  [Images d'avatar] - Durée 31 juillet 2026 16h00 - 28 août 2026 15h59 (JST/UTC+9) - Offre 1 commande de 150 gemmes arcanes 11 commande de 1 500 gemmes arcanes [Avatar apparaissant] Icône de l'article Nom de l'article TypeSamura...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nTo master one is to learn all! Samurai Spirit Avatar Order is back!\nShop\n2026-07-31 16:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo master one is to learn all!\nSamurai Spirit Avatar\nOrder is back!\nGet avatars in 4 stylish colors!\n[Avatar Images]\n- Duration\nJul 31, 2026 16:00 - Aug 28, 2026 15:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 150 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 1,500 Arcana Gems\n[Appearing Avatar]\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nSamurai Hero Top A\nTop Avatar/Male Only\nSamurai Hero Top B\nTop Avatar/Male Only\nSamurai Hero Top C\nTop Avatar/Male Only\nSamurai Hero Top D\nTop Avatar/Male Only\nSamurai Bloom Top A\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nSamurai Bloom Top B\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nSamurai Bloom Top C\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nSamurai Bloom Top D\nTop Avatar/Female Only\nSamurai Hero Bottoms A\nBottom Avatar/Male Only\nSamurai Hero Bottoms B\nBottom Avatar/Male Only\nSamurai Hero Bottoms C\nBottom Avatar/Male Only\nSamurai Hero Bottoms D\nBottom Avatar/Male Only\nSamurai Bloom Bottoms A\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSamurai Bloom Bottoms B\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSamurai Bloom Bottoms C\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSamurai Bloom Bottoms D\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nSamurai Hachigane A\nAccessory Avatar\nSamurai Hachigane B\nAccessory Avatar\nSamurai Hachigane C\nAccessory Avatar\nSamurai Hachigane D\nAccessory Avatar\nSamurai Osode A\nAccessory Avatar\nSamurai Osode B\nAccessory Avatar\nSamurai Osode C\nAccessory Avatar\nSamurai Osode D\nAccessory Avatar\nSamurai Horns A\nAccessory Avatar\nSamurai Horns B\nAccessory Avatar\nSamurai Horns C\nAccessory Avatar\nSamurai Horns D\nAccessory Avatar\nSamurai Waist Tie A\nAccessory Avatar\nSamurai Waist Tie B\nAccessory Avatar\nSamurai Waist Tie C\nAccessory Avatar\nSamurai Waist Tie D\nAccessory Avatar\n- Important\n* Your partner can also equip female avatars and accessories.\n* Some of the avatars available in this Order have equip conditions that depend on the equipped character's gender.\n* Kirito's and Asuna's faces and hairstyles are not included in this Order.\n* All avatars, both female and male, are available in the Order regardless of your own character's gender.\n* Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
