    "news_category": "Shop",
    "snippet": "Le 29 juin 2026 marque le jour où s’est produit l’incident qui a mis en mouvement l’Arc d’Alicisation. Pour commémorer ce jour spécial où la réalité rattrape l'arc de l'histoire, nous organiserons l'Éclair d'épées qui illumine l'ordre du monde souterrain ! Kirito, Alice, Eugeo et Asuna sont là comme nouveaux ★4...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Flash of Swords That Illuminates the Underworld Order is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2026-07-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nJune 29, 2026 marks the day when the incident that set the Alicization Arc in motion occurred.\nTo commemorate this special day when reality catches up with the story arc, we will be holding the Flash of Swords That Illuminates the Underworld Order!\nKirito, Alice, Eugeo, and Asuna are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sky-Splitting Roar] Kirito\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nIce Shear Burst\nSkill Name\nIce Shear\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→Slash→\nWater\n→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n78\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2400% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +100%./[Bonus] Water element damage increases x 0.5% the number of frostbite stacks when the player is inflicted with the frostbite status ailment.\n・While Full Burst state/[Ruinous Water 4/Buff] Water element damage +75% for 20 sec.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Fragrant Olive's Light] Alice\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Shine Conversion\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2200\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Shine Conversion 5] Dark element's damage to enemies -15% and holy element's damage to enemies +30%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nEffect duration is extended.\nThe higher the Limit Break level, the more Link Level increases when attacking with Link Sword Skills.\nWhen Activated: Attack +500 when using Link Sword Skills.\nLLv100: Skill Power is added +100%.\nLLv250: Holy element damage +20%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Blade of Blue Oath] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHatchet Water\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n88\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n2790% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWater damage +50% when using water skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise water damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[White Wings Take Flight] Asuna\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHoly Torrent Burst\nSkill Name\nHoly Torrent\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→Thrust→\nHoly\n→\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n92\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2100% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Shine Force 4/Buff] Holy element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 150%./[Bonus] Critical rate +1000%.\n・While Full Burst state/[Bonus] Holy element damage +75%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Sky-Splitting Roar] Kirito\" and \"[Blade of Blue Oath] Eugeo\" are\nSword Skills with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJuly 1, 2026 (Wed) 0:00 - July 31, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
