    "snippet": "Avis destiné aux utilisateurs se connectant à \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".  La maintenance que nous avons mise en œuvre à partir du 24/06 2026 à 13h00 a été achevée le 24/06 2026 à 17h00 (JST/UTC+9). Voici les nouvelles mises à jour.  ▼Événements nouvellement implémentés et nouveaux Chapitre 2 Mise à jour Aincrad 92F L'écho de l'événement Start Dash 92F...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(6/24)\nMAINT.\n2026-06-24 13:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 6/24, 2026, 13:00, was completed on 6/24, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 Aincrad 92F Update\nThe 92F Start Dash Event\nEchoes of Survival: Echoes of Aincrad Opening Celebration\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nWe have sent out the reward of \"600 Arcana Gems\" for the viewer-participation event held during the official live stream on 6/18, 2026.\nReceive by: Until 7/1, 2026, 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n6/24, 2026 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 Aincrad 92F Update\nThe 92F Start Dash Event\nEchoes of Survival: Echoes of Aincrad Opening Celebration\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 6/24 Maintenance\nRanking Event \"Guild of Guilds\" Season 71\n[Holiday Campaign] Multiple Rounds: 5x Experience Subquest Campaign\n[Returning] Bride's Dress is with a Smile\n[Returning] Surprise Wedding\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
