    "snippet": "Alice, Asuna, Eugeo et Klein sont là avec de nouveaux records de compétences ★4 ! L'« Ordre du Bazar Vénitien » est là ! Obtenez un nouveau record de compétence ★4 garanti à l'étape 5 ! Le taux d'abandon total de 6 % n'inclut pas le record de compétence ★4 garanti, et les nouveaux records de compétence ★4 présentent des records de compétence avec des taux d'abandon élevés !  ...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Venetian Bazaar Order is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2026-05-27 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAlice, Asuna, Eugeo and Klein are here with new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nVenetian Bazaar Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Aura of Ducats] Alice\nSkill Name\nIron-Fisted Punishment/Reinforced Strike\nAttack\n57\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2275\nSkill Effect\n[Iron-Fisted Punishment 4] Attack +500 when attacking with blunt element./[Reinforced Strike 3] Adds a buff where blunt elemental weakness damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 30 sec when using Switch. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nSkill's power is added +150% when used in switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Merchant of Joy & Jewels] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nAqua Thrust\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n47\nSkill Effect\n2800% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Aqua Force 4/Buff] Water element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +20% for 20 sec.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Thrust Boost 3/Buff] Adds a buff where thrust elemental weakness damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Water element damage +50%.\nLLv50: Water element damage +50%.\nLLv100: While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 100%.\nLLv250: Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Antique Buyer] Eugeo\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nPhoton Double Down Burst\nSkill Name\nPhoton Double Down\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nHoly\n→Blunt→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n96\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2100% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Holy Element Enhance4/Buff] Holy element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5800% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 250%./[Bonus] Holy element damage increases x 0.5% the number of Debility stacks when the player is inflicted with the Debility status ailment./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Masterpiece Marketplace] Klein\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nLightning Roll\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n42\nSkill Effect\n2360% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nHoly damage +50% when using holy skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Holy damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Merchant of Joy & Jewels] Asuna\" and \"[Masterpiece Marketplace] Klein\" are\nSword Skills with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter May 27, 2026 (Wed) maintenance - Before June 24, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
