    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] \"100% Awakening Lv1→2 Success Campaign\" is here!\nCampaign\n2026-05-27 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nThe\n\"100% Awakening Lv1→2 Success Campaign\"\nis here!\nCampaign Contents\nRaise your Skill Record's\nAwakening Level from 1 to 2 without fail during\nthe Campaign.\nCampaign Duration\nAfter May 27, 2026 (Wed) maintenance - Before June 3, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease see here for more on Skill Record Awakening.\nGo to Notice List",
