    "snippet": "On fête l'anniversaire de Yuuki ! La « Commande ★4 Yuuki garantie gratuite une fois par jour » est ici, où vous avez la garantie d'un record de compétence ★4 Yuuki ! C'est une commande spéciale où vous pourrez profiter de Yuuki et de toutes ses différentes expressions !  - Période du 23 mai 2026 (samedi) 4h00 au 1er juin 2026 (lun) 3h59 (JST/UTC+9) 【Certains ★4 ...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"★4 Yuuki Guaranteed Free Once Daily Order\" is here! A free Order consisting only of ★4 Yuuki!\nShop\n2026-05-23 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCelebrating Yuuki's birthday!\nThe \"★4 Yuuki Guaranteed Free Once Daily Order\" is here, where you're guaranteed a ★4 Yuuki Skill Record!\nIt's a special Order where you can enjoy Yuuki and all her different expressions!\n- Period\nMay 23, 2026 (Sat) 4:00 - June 1, 2026 (Mon) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Turning Point of Destiny] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWind Whirlpool\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n132\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n2250% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Royal Authority] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow Pierce\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n1610% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[A Summer Together] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWhistle Shower\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n105\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n1970% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Bleed/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Bleed (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bonus] Raises 3 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
