    "full_details": "Notices\n[Happy Birthday, Yuuki!] The Yuuki Birthday Login Bonus is here! Receive up to a total of 1,000 Arcana Gems!\nEVENT\n2026-05-23 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nMay 23 is Yuuki's birthday!\nTo celebrate Yuuki's birthday, we're holding the Yuuki Birthday Login Bonus!\nThis is a special login bonus where you can get\n100 Arcana Gems each day\nby logging in for a total of\nup to 1,000 Arcana Gems\nover 10 days!\nPeriod\nMay 23, 2026 (Sat) 4:00 - June 2, 2026 (Tue) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nReward Details\nNumber of Days Logged In\nReward\nIcon\nDay1\nArcana Gems×100\nDay2\nArcana Gems×100\nDay3\nArcana Gems×100\nDay4\nArcana Gems×100\nDay5\nArcana Gems×100\nDay6\nArcana Gems×100\nDay7\nArcana Gems×100\nDay8\nArcana Gems×100\nDay9\nArcana Gems×100\nDay10\nArcana Gems×100\nImportant\nLogin Bonuses can be claimed after completing the 1F main quest.\nDaily distribution time will be from 4:00 AM to 3:59 AM of the next day. (JST/UTC+9)\nPlease note that the distribution date does not switch when the date changes.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
