    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(5/20)\nMAINT.\n2026-05-20 13:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 5/20, 2026, 13:00, was completed on 5/20, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nRanking Event \"Guild of Guilds\" Season 71\nUnderground Labyrinth Bonus Time Campaign\nKobold Lord Boss Rush　Added rewards and high difficulty\nMultiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n5/20, 2026 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nRanking Event \"Guild of Guilds\" Season 71\nUnderground Labyrinth Bonus Time Campaign\nKobold Lord Boss Rush　Added rewards and high difficulty\nMultiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 5/20 Maintenance\nMultiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
