    "news_date": 1778832000,
    "news_category": "Shop",
    "snippet": "Tous les records de compétences ★4 sont Koharu ou Sanya ! La commande originale d'héroïne SAOIF : Bâtisseurs de demain est là, où vous avez la garantie d'un record de compétence Koharu ou Sanya ★4 pour 11 commandes ! Il s'agit d'un Ordre plein du charme dégagé par deux des principaux personnages originaux de SWORD ART ONLINE : Integral Factor !  Alors...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe SAOIF Original Heroine Order is here! Only ★4 Skill Records of Koharu and Sanya! One ★4 Koharu or Sanya Skill Record Guaranteed!\nShop\n2026-05-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAll ★4 Skill Records are\nKoharu\nor\nSanya\n!\nThe SAOIF Original Heroine Order: Builders of Tomorrow is here, where you're guaranteed a ★4 Koharu or Sanya Skill Record per 11 Orders!\nThis is an Order full of the charm exuded by two of SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor's leading original characters!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Time for a Challenge] Koharu\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nRapid Scratch Burst\nSkill Name\nRapid Scratch\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nSlash\nElement\nSlash\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→Slash→Slash→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n18.0\nSkill Cool Time\n36.0\nSwitch Gauge\n88\nSwitch Gauge\n88\nBreak Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n88\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2200% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5260% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +1000 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Increases attack against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +1% for every Stack 1./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping 2 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[The Call of Blood] Sanya\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Out of Sorts\nAttack\n49\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Out of Sorts 4] Defense -30% and during the buff effect for increased max HP, the attack and damage -99% when using normal attack.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Sorcery by Hand] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nAir Stamp\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n39\nSkill Effect\n1700% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Force 5/Buff(PT)] Wind element damage +20% for you and your party for 5 sec./[Combination 3/Buff(PT)] When the target is hit using the Switch, switch damage multiples +200% for you and your party for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Sound of Divine Spirits] Sanya\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nInk Rush Burst\nSkill Name\nInk Rush\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→Slash→\nDark\n→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n50\nSwitch Gauge\n50\nBreak Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n72\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2030% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4800% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Critical damage +150% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Japanese Bride] Koharu\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Charging Loss/Break the Dam\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Charging Loss 1] Defense -30% and, when HP is under 50%, damage -1000% to enemies weak to thrusting.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Break the Dam 3] Break gauge amount +30% at enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Beaming Stars & Smiles] Sanya\nSkill Name\nSuper Enhance Heal/Play it by Ear\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n44\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Super Enhance Heal] Effect of healing items and field objects +100%./[Play it by Ear 5] Attack +25% when HP is above 50%, and defense +15% when HP is under 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n- Duration\nMay 15, 2026 (Fri) 17:00 - May 29, 2026 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
