    "snippet": "[5/9 0:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] Les récompenses de classement ont été distribuées. Veuillez les récupérer dans la boîte actuelle.  Pour plus de détails sur les récompenses, voir « Récompenses de classement » ci-dessous.  ----------------------------- L'événement de classement de pêche « Concours de pêche du début de l'été 2026 » est actuellement en cours. Dans le cadre du \"Début 2026...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[5/9 0:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] Fishing Ranking Event, \"2026 Early Summer Fishing Competition\" is here!\nEVENT\n2026-05-09 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[5/9 0:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nRanking Rewards have been distributed. Please collect them from the present box.\nFor more details about the rewards, see \"Ranking Rewards\" below.\n-----------------------------\nFishing Ranking Event \"2026 Early Summer Fishing Competition\" is on now.\nIn the \"2026 Early Summer Fishing Competition\", you fight for the best rank based on your catch scores.\nThe Lucky Starfish, and Burger Turtle selected from user submissions and appear on this Event Map!\nCatch them to get a\nhigh score\n!\nRanking Period\nStarts after the April 22, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 7, 2026 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nEvent Period\nStarts after the April 22, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 13, 2026 (Wed) maintenance\nThe \"On Board: Day\" and \"On Board: Night\" event maps will also be available during this period.\nTo check your current ranking or score, go to Menu > Community > Ranking > 2026 Early Summer Fishing Competition ranking banner.\nRewards\nPlace at the top of the rankings to get limited-edition Fishing Competition records, rare fishing bait, and\nMemoria Niter L\n, a Skill Record Limit Break material, as a present!\nExchange for up to 1,000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 15\n\"Medal of Combat Arts\"\n, as well as other items such as\n\"Core Metal\"\nand \"Release Crystal\" at the \"Early Summer Fishing Competition Trader\".\nEach fish likes different bait.\nTry different things and challenge the event.\nEarly Summer Fishing Competition Trader Period\nStarts after the April 22, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 27, 2026 (Wed) maintenance\nRecord\nYou will also be able to receive a record via achievement rewards by finishing in the top ranking.\nRecord Acquisition\nAchievement Rewards\nES Fishing King 2026\nRevive Crystal×1\nES Fishing Elite 2026\nRevive Crystal×1\nES Fishing Mania 2026\nRevive Crystal×1\nEvent Locations\nRankings will be based on fish caught on the \"On Board: Day\" and \"On Board: Night\" event maps, as well as the 22nd Floor's \"Serene Shore\" and \"Peaceful Forest Path\" during both day and night.\nHead to the On Board: Day and On Board: Night event maps by talking to the Boarding Guide NPC at the Teleport Gate Plaza.\nThere are Guide NPCs that can take you to and from the ships in both On Board: Day and On Board: Night.\nYou can return to Teleport Gate Plaza by talking to the Disembarkment Guide.\nGo to the \"Serene Shore\" or \"Peaceful Forest Path\" on the 22F by talking to \"Nishida\" in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\".\nTalk to the \"Night Map Guide\" NPC on the \"Serene Shore\" to go to the night map.\nFishing Spot\nRecommended Fishing Lv\nOn Board: Day\n1～15\nOn Board: Night\n16～\nSerene Shore (Day)\n1～10\nPeaceful Forest Path (Day)\n11～15\nSerene Shore (Night)\n16～20\nPeaceful Forest Path (Night)\n21～\nRanking Reward\nRanking\nRewards\nAmount\n#1\nRecord:ES Fishing King 2026\n1\nRecord:ES Fishing Elite 2026\n1\nRecord:ES Fishing Mania 2026\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n30\nRelease Crystal (L)\n20\n#2～#20\nRecord:ES Fishing Elite 2026\n1\nRecord:ES Fishing Mania 2026\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n5\nRelease Crystal (L)\n3\n#21～#100\nRecord:ES Fishing Mania 2026\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n20\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n20\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n20\nMemoria Niter L\n1\nRelease Crystal (L)\n1\n#101～#300\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n15\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n15\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n15\nMemoria Niter M\n3\n#301～#500\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n5\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n5\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n5\nMemoria Niter M\n1\n#501～#10000\nMemoria Niter S\n1\nRanking rewards will be distributed from May 9, 2026 (Sat) 0:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nReward Acceptance Period: Until May 27, 2026 (Wed) maintenance\nImportant\nItems with record names will be removed on May 27, 2026 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
