    "full_details": "Notices\nGet Agil Stamps! \"[Fri-Sun Only] Treasure Hunt with Agil\" is on now!\nEVENT\n2026-04-17 03:59:59\n（JST/GMT+9）\n\"Agil\" will join as your partner!\nGet special \"\nAgil Stamp\n\".\nRewards\nGet Agil Coins as challenge rewards and exchange them for \"\nAgil Stamps\n\" at the exclusive Trader!\nGet other rewards like enhancement materials and \"Revive Crystals\".\nAs of September 13, 2023, sixteen new Agil stamps are available!\nThese\nAgil stamps\nare in-game chat stamps, and have been implemented with the following designs.\nThree Stamps Hiroki Yasumoto (Agil's Voice Actor) Helped Create\nTwenty-Three Stamps from the \"SAO Integral Factor 100% Agil\" LINE Stickers\nTwenty-Two Stamps from the \"SAO Integral Factor 100% Agil 2\" LINE Stickers\nLiven up your conversations with cute caricatures of Agil!\n* More may be added in the future.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Agil\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to take on this challenge.\nPeriod\nEvery Friday 4:00 to Monday 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nAgil Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nAgil Stamp 1\nAgil Stamp 2\nAgil Stamp 3\nAgil Stamp 4\nAgil Stamp 5\nAgil Stamp 6\nAgil Stamp 7\nAgil Stamp 8\nAgil Stamp 9\nAgil Stamp 10\nAgil Stamp 11\nAgil Stamp 12\nAgil Stamp 13\nAgil Stamp 14\nAgil Stamp 15\nAgil Stamp 16\nAgil Stamp 17\nAgil Stamp 18\nAgil Stamp 19\nAgil Stamp 20\nAgil Stamp 21\nAgil Stamp 22\nAgil Stamp 23\nAgil Stamp 24\nAgil Stamp 25\nAgil Stamp 26\nAgil Stamp 27\nAgil Stamp 28\nAgil Stamp 29\nAgil Stamp 30\nAgil Stamp 31\nAgil Stamp 32\nAgil Stamp 33\n[NEW!]\nAgil Stamp 34\n[NEW!]\nAgil Stamp 35\n[NEW!]\nAgil Stamp 36\n[NEW!]\nAgil Stamp 37\n[NEW!]\nAgil Stamp 38\n[NEW!]\nAgil Stamp 39\n[NEW!]\nAgil Stamp 40\n[NEW!]\nAgil Stamp 41\n[NEW!]\nAgil Stamp 42\n[NEW!]\nAgil Stamp 43\n[NEW!]\nAgil Stamp 44\n[NEW!]\nAgil Stamp 45\n[NEW!]\nAgil Stamp 46\n[NEW!]\nAgil Stamp 47\n[NEW!]\nAgil Stamp 48\n[NEW!]\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nAgil Coin\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nRestorative Potion\n10\nCompleted within 3 minutes\nRestorative Potion\n10\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nImportant\nThe dungeon will update every Friday at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9) and can be cleared once until Monday at 3:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe challenge rewards will also reset every Friday at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nThis is a solo event that you can challenge with \"Agil\" as your partner.\nThe content and schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
