    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Bewitching Ephemeral Moonlight Flower Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2026-04-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nArgo and Kirito brandish blades that exude demonic energy in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nBewitching Ephemeral Moonlight Flower Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sealed Magic Released] Argo\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nShadow Fang Burst\nSkill Name\nShadow Fang\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Slash→(\nDark\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n54\nSwitch Gauge\n54\nBreak Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n88\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1990% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Bleed/Status Ailments] Inflict Bleed (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5500% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Increases attack against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +1% for every Stack 1./[Bonus] Dark element damage increases x 0.5% the number of Curse stacks when the player is inflicted with the Curse status ailment.\n* Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Black Flame Unleashed] Kirito\nSkill Name\nEnhance Bleed Aim/Bloody Blow/Bisect\nAttack\n57\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Bleed Aim 5] Chance of bleed UP./[Bloody Blow 5] Attack +30% against bleeding enemies.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bisect 5] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +30%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nEffect duration is extended.\nThe higher the Limit Break level, the more Link Level increases when attacking with Link Sword Skills.\nWhen Activated: Attack +500 when using Link Sword Skills.\nLLv100: Skill Power is added +100%.\nLLv250: Dark element damage +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nAfter the April 15, 2026 (Wed) maintenance - May 17, 2026 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
