    "news_date": 1775660400,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "Le 9 avril, c'est l'anniversaire d'Alice ! Nous organisons diverses campagnes dans SWORD ART ONLINE Integral Factor pour célébrer l'anniversaire d'Alice ! Célébrons tous ensemble cette merveilleuse journée !  Pour plus de détails, consultez les annonces de chaque événement et commande. Veuillez également noter que les périodes d'événements sont différentes pour...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nApril 9 is Alice's birthday! Tons of events and Orders! You've gotta check out this announcement!\nEVENT\n2026-04-09 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nApril 9 is Alice's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in SWORD ART ONLINE Integral Factor to celebrate Alice's birthday!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nFor more details, check the announcements for each event and Order.\nAlso, please note that event periods are different for each.\n* There are some events and Orders that have yet to begin at the time of this announcement's posting.\nRaising Assisting Character Campaign for Alice and Eugeo\nWe're holding a campaign where you can get Alice and Eugeo chat stamps, items that increase your Friendship, and more!\nPeriod\nApril 3, 2026 (Fri) 4:00 - April 17, 2026 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Battle Rush\nSerious battles with Alice and Eugeo?!\nAlice's armor avatar, the Golden Yellow Knight Armor, is available as a reward!\nIf you don't have it yet, don't miss the comeback!\nPeriod\nStarts after the April 8, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 30, 2026 (Thu) maintenance.\nAlice's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Alice!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nAlice's Birthday Order is here!\nDuration\nApril 9, 2026 (Thu) 0:00 - April 18, 2026 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Alice or Eugeo Guaranteed Free Once Daily Order\nA free Order that guarantees a ★4 Alice or Eugeo is here to celebrate Alice and Eugeo's birthdays!\nIt's available once per day during the event period, so don't forget!\nPeriod\nApril 9, 2026 (Thu) 4:00 - April 18, 2026 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of Alice have been placed in four in-game locations!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nApril 9, 2026 (Thu) 0:00 - April 18, 2026 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArcana Gem Gift\nLog in on the day of Alice's birthday to get a gift of 250 Arcana Gems!\nTime Limit\nAvailable until April 9, 2026 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
