    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(3/31)\nMAINT.\n2026-03-30 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 3/31, 2026, 13:00, was completed on 3/31, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 14th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\nAdded [Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt\" Event rewards\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdjusted the progression of the 1F main quest\n* Since some of the affected quests have been marked as completed, we have sent the completion rewards to the gift boxes of the affected players.\n▼Compensation\nCompensation has been sent out for the issue where items were lost, which was fixed on 3/26.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼Official Live Stream Rewards\nWe have sent out rewards for correct answers to the quiz corner on the official livestream on 3/27, 2026.\nArcana Gems×600\nMemoria Niter L×10\nReceive by: Until 4/8, 2026, 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\n▼New Events\n▼Added Event rewards\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n3/31, 2026 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 14th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\nAdded [Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt\" Event rewards\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 3/31 Maintenance\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Core Metal+++ Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Guild Support Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
