    "full_details": "Notices\nSpecial Map and new Emotes now underway! \"Prayer of the Great Tree\" is here!\nEVENT\n2026-03-29 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nA Mysterious Winged Guide has descended to both the Teleport Gate Plaza and Arboris Island (24F).\nWhere would those wings of hers guide us to?\nPeriod\nMarch 29, 2026 (Sun) 0:00 - Before the April 8, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nLimited-Time Map\nTalk to the Meditation Forest Guide NPC at the Teleport Gate Plaza or in Arboris Island (24F) to go there.\n* You will not be able to go there with an Assisting Character.\nLimited-Time Emotes\nDuring the event, you'll be able to use the special Kneel emote for a limited time.\nThe limited-time Kneel emote will be located at the end of the list that appears after tapping the emote icon.\nKneel\nCharacter Panel\nPanels featuring illustrations of Yuuki have been placed in three in-game areas, for a total of eight panels!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nChat Stamp\nYuuki Limited-edition Stamp giveaway!\nBe sure to check your Present Box!\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nItems for Acquisition\nMother's Rosary\nMemory Stamp 366\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
