    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Leafa's Limit Break Dojo\" on now! Get heaps of Memoria Niter S for limit breaking your Skill Records!\nEVENT\n2026-03-27 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary!\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\nChallenge Leafa at the \"Memoria Dojo\" and get heaps of \"Memoria Niter S\", the material for limit breaking Skill Records!\nThe \"\nLeafa's Limit Break Dojo\n\" will begin.\nYou can also challenge the extremely difficult \"\nSerious Match  Memoria Dojo\n\" with a recommended Total Power of 250,000.\nRewards\nGet tons of the Skill Record limit breaking material\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom rewards.\n\"Memoria Dojo\" can be cleared once per day.\n\"\nSerious Match  Memoria Dojo\n\" can be also cleared once per day.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"Leafa\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nMarch 27, 2026 (Fri) 4:00 - April 3, 2026 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nRegular Dungeon\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n200\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n300\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n400\nMemoria Niter S\n4\n500\nMemoria Niter S\n4\n600\nMemoria Niter S\n6\n700\nMemoria Niter S\n6\n800\nMemoria Niter S\n10\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nRewards\nAmount\nWin against Leafa (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nCol\n20000\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRecord Frame L\n10\nCompleted within 3 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nMemoria Niter S\n2\nSerious Match\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n200\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n300\nMemoria Niter S\n2\n400\nMemoria Niter S\n4\n500\nMemoria Niter S\n4\n600\nMemoria Niter S\n6\n700\nMemoria Niter S\n6\n800\nMemoria Niter S\n10\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nRewards\nAmount\nWin against Leafa (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nCol\n20000\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRecord Frame L\n10\nCompleted within 7 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nMemoria Niter S\n2\nImportant\nThe number of times you can clear it will be reset daily at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nKoharu will not join for Serious Match  Memoria Dojo.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
