    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] The Core Metal+++ Increased Drop Rate Campaign is here! Now is your chance to transform the Rosso Integral Series and higher, or the Underground Labyrinth Shield!\nCampaign\n2026-03-25 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary!\nThe Core Metal+++ Increased Drop Rate Campaign is here!\nCore Metal+++ drop rate increased for All Out Battle [The Skull Reaper] and [Aincrad]!\n\"Core Metal+++\" is used as a production material for the \"Stone+++\" needed to transform the \"Rosso\" Integral Series and higher, as well as the shield that can be produced with materials from the Underground Labyrinth!\nUse this chance to enjoy the All Out Battle!\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the March 25, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the March 31, 2026 (Tue) maintenance.\nApplicable dungeons\n・75F All Out Battle [The Skull Reaper]\n・100F All Out Battle [Aincrad]\n* Drop rates for Core Metal+++ are set to be higher in the All Out Battle [Aincrad].\nRosso Integral Series (Required Level 161)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nRosso Forneus\n1H Sword\n1862\nRosso Dominion\n1H Rapier\n1827\nRosso Albatross\n1H Club\n1862\nRosso Twilight\n2H Axe\n2167\nRosso Greed\n2H Spear\n2127\nRosso Sigrun\nBow\n2087\nRosso Rhapsody\nDagger\n1827\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nYasha Integral Series (Required Level 181)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nAstaroth\n1H Sword\n2076\nPrincipality\n1H Rapier\n2037\nPorcupine\n1H Club\n2076\nMonsoon\n2H Axe\n2429\nEnvy\n2H Spear\n2384\nReginleifr\nBow\n2339\nOratorio\nDagger\n2037\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nGaou Integral Series (Required Level 201)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nGaou Astaroth\n1H Sword\n2290\nGaou Principality\n1H Rapier\n2247\nGaou Porcupine\n1H Club\n2290\nGaou Monsoon\n2H Axe\n2690\nGaou Envy\n2H Spear\n2641\nGaou Reginleifr\nBow\n2591\nGaou Oratorio\nDagger\n2247\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nMachina Integral Series (Required Level 221)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nOtius\n1H Sword\n2504\nVirtue\n1H Rapier\n2457\nMudskipper\n1H Club\n2504\nEl Nino\n2H Axe\n2952\nLust\n2H Spear\n2898\nTanngnidr\nBow\n2843\nCadenza\nDagger\n2457\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nGale Integral Series (Required Level 241)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nGale Otius\n1H Sword\n2718\nGale Virtue\n1H Rapier\n2667\nGale Mudskipper\n1H Club\n2718\nGale El Nino\n2H Axe\n3213\nGale Lust\n2H Spear\n3154\nGale Tanngnidr\nBow\n3095\nGale Cadenza\nDagger\n2667\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nRex Integral Series (Required Level 261)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nPhenex\n1H Sword\n3039\nCherubim\n1H Rapier\n2982\nFalcon\n1H Club\n3039\nHurricane\n2H Axe\n3584\nIra\n2H Spear\n3518\nSveid\nBow\n3452\nMinuet\nDagger\n2982\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nLava Integral Series (Required Level 281)\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nAttack\nLava Pheonix\n1H Sword\n3210\nLava Cherubim\n1H Rapier\n3150\nLava Falcon\n1H Club\n3210\nLava Hurricane\n2H Axe\n3802\nLava Ira\n2H Spear\n3732\nLava Sveid\nBow\n3662\nLava Minuet\nDagger\n3150\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★3 rarity, Lv. 60.\nFermat (Required Level 101)\nItem Icon\nHP\nDefense\n3525\n280\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nNox Fermat (Required Level 121)\nItem Icon\nHP\nDefense\n5775\n430\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv.100.\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
