    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] The \"Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2026-03-13 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary!\nBlunt/Wind and Blunt/Earth Sword Skills, and more! Specially Selected ★4 Skill Records are part of this lineup!\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nThe \"\nWorldwide 8 Year Anniversary Selection Order\n\" is on now!\n- Duration\nMarch 13, 2026 (Fri) 17:00 - April 3, 2026 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Orders for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Secret Autumn Bonfire] Leafa\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nRock Double Down Burst\nSkill Name\nRock Double Down\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→\nEarth\n→Blunt→\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n96\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2530% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Earth Element Enhance4/Buff] Earth element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n6200% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%./[Bonus] Earth element damage increases x 0.5% the number of poison stacks when the player is inflicted with the poison status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Smiling Scythe Wielder] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nDemolishing Wind\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1730% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[PT Enhance Blunt 4/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +30% for your party for 20 sec./[Bolt Breaker 4/Buff (PT)] Break gauge amount +20% for you and your party for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Blazing Shipwreck] Klein\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nRefuge Storm\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n92\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n2360% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[The Axe's Shockwave] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nRock Ravage\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n116\nBreak Gauge\n54\nSkill Effect\n2790% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhanced Vitality 4/Buff] Max HP +0.2% per stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nEarth damage +50% when using earth skills.\nAttack +1500 while increased max HP buffs are in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Higher Than All the Rest] Kirito\nSkill Name\nCrushing Impact/Mallet Blow/Thrust protect\nAttack\n61\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Crushing Impact 3] Attack +800 when attacking with blunt element./[Mallet Blow 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +30% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark)./[Thrust protect 3] Reduce damage from 12% thrust element monster.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Summer Festival Night] Alice\nSkill Name\nEnhance Blunt/Thrust Protect/Gale Blade\nAttack\n63\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Blunt 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +24%./[Thrust protect 4] Reduce damage from 15% thrust element monster./[Gale Blade 4] Deals +20% Wind element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
