    "snippet": "Sword Art Online fête ses 8 ans dans le monde entier ! La « Campagne d'augmentation du taux d'obtention des pierres de protection » est arrivée !  Pendant une durée limitée, chaque étage du Labyrinthe Souterrain bénéficiera d'un taux d'obtention de pierres de protection accru ! Le nombre d'objets obtenus pour les morceaux de pierre de protection sera également...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Underground Labyrinth] Now's your chance to produce and evolve the Integral Series Shield! The \"Protection Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" is here! [Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary]\nCampaign\n2026-03-11 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary!\nThe \"Protection Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" is here!\nFor a limited time, every floor of the Underground Labyrinth will have an increased drop rate for\nProtection Stones\n!\nThe number of drops for\nProtection Stone Pieces\nwill also increase!\nAnd lastly, all bosses in every floor will have increased\nAppearance Rates\n,\nStaying Time\nand Chance to Obtain!\nUse this chance to challenge the Underground Labyrinth, and do your best to produce and evolve the Integral Series Shield!\nThe \"\nSkill Releaser Campaign\n\" is also currently active in the Underground Labyrinth!\nIf you need tons of Skill Releasers, do not miss this chance to participate!\nFloor\nItems affected\nUnderground Labyrinth B2F\nCockatrice Protection Stone\nCockatrice Protection Stone Piece\nUnderground Labyrinth B3F\nCrimson King Protection Stone\nCrimson King Protection Stone Piece\nUnderground Labyrinth B4F\nCannibal Protection Stone\nCannibal Protection Stone Piece\nUnderground Labyrinth B5F\nSpit Spider Protection Stone\nSpit Spider Protection Stone Piece\nUnderground Labyrinth B6F\nGreen Flame Protection Stone\nGreen Flame Protection Stone Piece\nUnderground Labyrinth B7F\nEnraged Eyes Protection Stone\nEnraged Eyes Protection Stone Piece\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the March 11, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the March 25, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Underground Labyrinth Guide\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\" to challenge it.\nIn order to participate, you must clear the 100F Main Quest through the end.\nAbout Underground Labyrinth\nThe Underground Labyrinth is a special location where you can fight enemies on the same field with players outside of your party and guild members.\nOther players can attack monsters currently being fought.\nAll monsters will attack players near them.\nYou can obtain Skill Releasers in all floors of the Underground Labyrinth.\nSkill Releasers are items that increase the damage of certain sword skills.\nA very valuable shield can be produced using Protection Stones that drop from the bosses from the Underground Labyrinth B2F.\nFrom the Underground Labyrinth B3F, you can enjoy a special scenario and receive Arcana Gems and Skill Releasers.\nThey were certain he had disappeared...\nAfter the 100th Floor Incident, a new Underground Labyrinth suddenly appears in the Blackiron Palace.\nScouts bring back two things from the unknown dungeon: the new Skill Releaser power and a message from a mysterious supporter of the Assault Team.\nIn order to unravel the mysteries of the Underground Labyrinth and obtain greater power, the Assault Team forms a scouting team.\nWith the man everyone was certain had disappeared, your group takes on the Underground Labyrinth!\nFermat (Required Level 101)\nItem Icon\nHP\nDefense\n3525\n280\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\n★3 Fermat can be produced with either of the following methods.\n・Cockatrice Protection Stone x2 and Distinctive Rock x200\n・Crimson King Protection Stone x2 and Sacred Underworld Water x200\n・Cannibal Protection Stone x2 and Lost Flower x200\nNox Fermat (Required Level 121)\nItem Icon\nHP\nDefense\n5775\n430\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv.100.\n★3 Nox Fermat can be produced with either of the following methods.\n・Spit Spider Protection Stone x2 and Sinister Skeleton Crystal x200\n・Green Flame Protection Stone x2 and Pale Grass x200\n・Enraged Eyes Protection Stone x2 and Damp Purple Mushroom x200\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
