    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(3/11)\nMAINT.\n2026-03-10 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 3/11, 2026, 13:00, was completed on 3/11, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 69 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault\"\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Protection Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Skill Releaser Campaign\" begins\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 5x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n3/11, 2026 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 69 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to [Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"White Day Assault\"\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Protection Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Skill Releaser Campaign\" begins\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 5x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 3/11 Maintenance\n\"Ordinal Scale Avatar Order\"\n\"Ordinal Scale Immortal Fragments\"\nThe 13th \"Squad Jumble\"\n\"Koharu Birthday Festival Defense Battle\"\n\"Koharu Masterpiece Showcase\"\n\"Happy Dungeon with Koharu\"\n\"Flower Fest\"\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Silica's Heapin' 50M EXP Event\"\n[Worldwide 8 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 8x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
