    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Free Once Daily 100% ★4 Koharu Order\" is here! A free Order consisting only of ★4 Koharu!\nShop\n2026-02-23 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nCelebrating Koharu's birthday!\nThe \"Free Once Daily 100% ★4 Koharu Order\" is here, where you're guaranteed a ★4 Koharu Skill Record!\nIt's a special Order where you can enjoy Koharu and all her different expressions!\n- Period\nFebruary 23, 2026 (Mon) 4:00 - March 4, 2026 (Wed) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[A World Together] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nWind Spin\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n2640% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Force 4/Buff] Wind element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Sleep Res. 4/Buff] Sleep resist +80% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Wind element damage +50%.\nLLv100：Attack +100% against enemy with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Angel-Like Partner] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nShadow Converge\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n24\nSkill Effect\n2170% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Treasure in the Tropics] Koharu\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nTerror Summer Burst\nSkill Name\nTerror Summer\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nHoly\n→Slash→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n55\nSwitch Gauge\n55\nBreak Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n76\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2350% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] Inflict Frostbite (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5700% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Increases attack against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +1% for every Stack 1./[Bonus] Holy element damage increases x 0.5% the number of Debility stacks when the player is inflicted with the Debility status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[New Year's Resolution] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nPetal Gong\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n68\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n2060% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nEarth damage +50% when using earth skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise earth damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Approaching Crimson Demon] Koharu\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nProminence Fall Burst\nSkill Name\nProminence Fall\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Blunt→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n80\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1860% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4390% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark)./[Bonus] Fire element damage increases x 0.5% the number of burn stacks when the player is inflicted with the burn status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
