    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Happy Dungeon with Koharu\" Koharu Birthday Festival is here! Get the Koharu stamp and Arcana Gems!\nEVENT\n2026-02-23 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKoharu Birthday Festival!\nThe \"Happy Dungeon with Koharu\" is on now!\n\"Happy Dungeon with Koharu\" is here! Get the Koharu stamp and Arcana Gems in celebration of her birthday!\nRewards\n\"Arcana Gems\"\nand a\nlimited-edition \"Koharu\" stamp\nare available as rewards.\nClear the dungeon every day during the event to\nget up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\".\nWhat's more, this dungeon will be open for longer than normal Happy Dungeons, and you can get up to 3,000,000 Col from it!\nThis event is a Raising Dungeon.\nPeriod\nFebruary 23, 2026 (Mon) 4:00 - Before the March 11, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Happy Dungeon with Koharu\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\n* Please note that NPCs will look different from those in regular Happy Dungeons.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nChat Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nItems for Acquisition\nPreparing for Guests\nMemory Stamp 364\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nArcana Gems\n50\n200\nArcana Gems\n50\n300\nArcana Gems\n50\n400\nArcana Gems\n50\n500\nArcana Gems\n50\n600\nArcana Gems\n50\n700\nArcana Gems\n50\n800\nArcana Gems\n50\n900\nSaleable Col Bag\n5\n1000\nSaleable Col Bag\n5\n1100\nSaleable Col Bag\n5\n1200\nSaleable Col Bag\n5\n1300\nSaleable Col Bag\n5\n1400\nSaleable Col Bag\n5\n1500\nLife Potion\n10\n1600\nLife Potion\n10\n1700\nLife Potion\n10\n* A Sellable Col Bag can be sold for 100,000 Col at the merchant.\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nMemory Stamp 364\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gem\n50\nCompleted within 1 minutes\nArcana Gem\n50\n- Important\nCleared dungeons will be reset the following day at 4:00am (JST/UTC+9) and can be re-attempted after that.\nThis event will be a solo dungeon.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
