    "snippet": "Avis destiné aux utilisateurs se connectant à \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\". La « Campagne Arcana Gem Super Boost » commence ! Ne laissez pas passer cette chance d'obtenir des tonnes de gemmes arcanes supplémentaires !   -Durée de la campagne 23 février 2026 (lundi) 0h00 - Avant la maintenance du 25 février 2026 (mercredi) (JST/UTC+9) -Campagne Con...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" is here! Get up to 2,000 extra Arcana Gems!\nCampaign\n2026-02-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\n\"\nArcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\n\" begins!\nDon't pass up this chance to get\ntons of\nextra Arcana Gems!\n-Campaign Duration\nFebruary 23, 2026 (Mon) 0:00 - Before the February 25, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n-Campaign Contents\nProduct Name\nArcana Gems\nArcana Gem A\nTotal: 250\n（60\n+190 extra Gems\n）\nArcana Gem B\nTotal: 300\nArcana Gem C\nTotal: 680\nArcana Gem D\nTotal: 1,500\n（1,280\n+220 extra Gems\n）\nArcana Gem E\nTotal: 2,700\nArcana Gem F\nTotal: 5,000\n（4,200\n+800 extra Gems\n）\nArcana Gem G\nTotal: 10,800\n（8,800\n+2,000 extra Gems\n）\n-Important\nExtra Arcana Gems are only available once per bundle.\nGo to Notice List"
