    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Ordinal Scale Avatar Order\" is back! One ★4 avatar guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2026-02-18 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Sword Art Online Ordinal Scale movie-themed avatars are here!\nThe \"\nOrdinal Scale Avatar Order\n\" is back!\nOne ★4 avatar guaranteed per 11 Orders!\n【Avatar Images】\n【Appearing Avatar】\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\n★4\nOS Avenger Battle Coat Top\nTop Avatar/Male Only\n★4\nOS Big Guy Battle Coat Top\nTop Avatar/Male Only\n★4\nOS Blacksmith Battle Dress Top\nTop Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nOS Dragon Tamer Battle Dress Top\nTop Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nOS Sniper Battle Dress Top\nTop Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nOS Wind Fairy Battle Dress Top\nTop Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nOS Diva Dress Set\nFull Body Avatar/Female Only\n★4\nOS Battle Sword A\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nOS Battle Sword B\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nOS Battle Rapier\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nOS Battle Mace\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nOS Battle Axe\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nOS Battle Shield\nWeapon Avatar\n★4\nOS Battle Dagger\nWeapon Avatar\nOS Avenger Battle Coat Bottoms\nBottom Avatar/Male Only\nOS Big Guy Battle Coat Bottoms\nBottom Avatar/Male Only\nOS Blacksmith Battle Dress Bottoms\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nOS Dragon Tamer Dress Bottoms\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nOS Sniper Battle Dress Bottoms\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nOS Wind Fairy Battle Dress Bottoms\nBottom Avatar/Female Only\nAugma IF: A\nAccessory Avatar\nAugma IF: B\nAccessory Avatar\nAugma IF: C\nAccessory Avatar\nAugma IF: D\nAccessory Avatar\nDiva Hair Ornament\nAccessory Avatar/Female Only\n- Duration\nStarts after the February 18, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the March 11, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Offers\n1 Order for 150 Arcana Gems\n11 Orders for 1,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nWeapon avatars will only display when they match with the weapon type you have equipped.\nShield avatars are in included in the weapon avatar category.\nSome of the avatars available in this Order have equip conditions that depend on the equipped character's gender.\nAll avatars, both female and male, are available in the Order regardless of your own character's gender.\nKoharu can also equip female avatars and accessories.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
