    "news_date": 1769587200,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "L'événement scénario \"Bitter Chocolate Road\" est de retour !  L’enthousiasme était dans l’air dans la Ville des Commencements. Une nouvelle quête avec une bataille pour le chocolat venait de commencer. Le but final ? Le chocolat ultime !  Leafa : J'adore ce genre d'événements festifs ! Yuuki : Faire des bonbons pour quelqu'un d'autre, ça semble être...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe scenario event \"Bitter Chocolate Road\" is back! Get a ★4 Kirito Skill Record, Valentine's Avatars, stamps, and more!\nEVENT\n2026-01-28 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"Bitter Chocolate Road\" is back!\nExcitement was in the air in the Town of Beginnings.\nA new quest with a battle for chocolate had just begun.\nThe end goal? The ultimate chocolate!\nLeafa: I love these kinds of festive events!\nYuuki: Making sweets for someone else sounds like it'd be so much fun!\nSachi: Sorry to drag you two into this, but I'm fighting too!\nAsuna: We can't get the materials for making the chocolate ourselves?\nLisbeth: I'm sure we'll be able to manage.\nKoharu: Let's do this and enjoy Valentine's to the max!\nThe girls gathered in the plaza are all set to enjoy the event to the fullest, but...\nThere's no way to sugar-coat it, this battle won't be easy, even on Valentine's Day!\nRewards\nProceed through the quest and defeat the Chocolattherium and Chocolatier Heart Seeker.\nYou'll earn items you can use to trade for or produce a ★4 Kirito Skill Record, Valentine's Avatars, Stamps, and more!\nDuring the event, Chocolattherium will appear in the fields of every floor.\nGet up to 1,000\nArcana Gems\nfrom the entire event.\nFor this returning event, acquisition status of Trader Rewards from last time will be reset, allowing players to acquire these rewards once more.\nSkill Record\n★4[Gentle Chocola]Kirito\nSkill Name\nEnhance Heal\nAttack\n34\nDefense\n53\nHP\n1225\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Heal 4] Effect of healing items and field objects +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChat Stamps\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nItems for Acquisition\nLove\nMemory Stamp 8\nHappy Valentine!\nMemory Stamp 9\nI didn't do this for you!\nMemory Stamp 10\nHeart throb\nMemory Stamp 11\nAvatar Images\nEvent-limited recovery item\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nFriendship Chocolate\nRecover 500 HP of the party members who are in the same field\nTrade \"Cacaua Piece\" for special items.\nYou can trade with the Trader NPC \"Schroth\" at the Teleport Gate Plaza after you've cleared the scenario quest.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nModern Chocolate Bottoms B\n500\n1\nLovely Chocolate Bottoms B\n500\n2\nModern Chocolate Corsage B\n400\n2\nLovely Chocolate Ribbon B\n400\n2\nMemory Stamp 8\n200\n1\nMemory Stamp 9\n200\n1\nMemory Stamp 10\n200\n1\nMemory Stamp 11\n200\n1\n★4[Gentle Chocola]Kirito\n300\n5\nChocolate Tablet\n25\n20\nValentine's Avatars & Items Available for Production\nItem Name\nNecessary Items for Production\nNecessary Col for Production\nModern Chocolate Top B\nChocolate Tablet　×30\nRed Fruit　×15\n10,000\nLovely Chocolate Top B\nChocolate Tablet　×30\nRed Fruit　×15\n10,000\nModern Chocolate Hat B\nChocolate Tablet　×20\nRed Fruit　×10\n8,000\nLovely Chocolate Hat B\nChocolate Tablet　×20\nRed Fruit　×10\n8,000\nFriendship Chocolate\nChocolate Tablet　×3\nRed Fruit　×3\n500\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Claude\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to start the scenario quest.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the January 28, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the February 25, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the January 28, 2026 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the March 4, 2026 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nMonster\nChocolattherium\nDetails\nAppears in the fields of every floor and certain quests during the event period.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nThrust Element\n(* Quests only)\nChocolatier Heart Seeker\nDetails\nAppears in certain quests.\nWeaknesses change depending on the quest partner.\nWeakness\n???\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf the ★4 Skill Records you acquire as rewards for this event have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Memoria Niter L\".\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nThe limited-edition items may be traded or produced up until the March 4, 2026 (Wed) maintenance begins.\nYou can get Chocolate Tablets in exchange for Cacaua Pieces, from some event quest rewards, or as drops from the Chocolatier Heart Seeker.\nObtain Red Fruits in exchange for Cacaua Pieces or as drops from some existing monsters.\nTo avoid producing duplicate avatars, please check your inventory before production.\nThe Chocolattherium appearing on each floor will be removed during maintenance on February 25, 2026 (Wed).\nThis event does not support Story Replay.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2026-01-27T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2026-02-24T19:00:00+00:00"
