    "full_details": "Notices\nAvailable trade limit for \"Medal of Combat Arts Trader\" resets on 2/1, 2026 (Sun)!\nNOTICES\n2026-01-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nThe available trade limit for the Medal of Combat Arts Trader will reset on 2/1, 2026 (Sun) 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nCollect \"Medal of Combat Arts\" and get a variety of items at the Trader!\nWe've prepared \"Core Metal\", \"Armament Stones\", and \"Release Crystal\" that are needed to acquire proficiency skills!\nAbout Medal of Combat Arts.\nParticipate in the events and gather Medal of Combat Arts!\nYou can get some Medals of Combat Arts from different in-game events.\n\"Medal of Combat Arts\" Trader\nFind the Trader by going to Menu → Items → Enhance/Trade → Trade Limited Items and tapping the Trade Medal of Combat Arts banner.\nYou can also check by going to NPC Trader → Trade Limited Items and tapping the Trade Medal of Combat Arts banner.\nMerchant District/NPC\"Trader\"\nMedal of Combat Arts Trader Lineup\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nPermanent Lineup\nCore Metal\n100\n2\nSticky Thing Armament Stone\n50\n1\nCrossgigas Armament Stone\n47\n1\nAsura Armament Stone\n44\n1\nOne-Eyed Beast Armament Stone\n36\n1\nHalf Beast Armament Stone\n33\n1\nBlazing Armament Stone\n30\n1\nAmber Chaos Crystal\n40\n1\nCrimson Chaos Crystal\n30\n1\nRelease Crystal (L)\n5\n20\nRelease Crystal (M)×2\n1\n50\nMartial Arts Text×5\n1\n20\nAwakening Star×5\n3\n10\nGreat Red Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n3\n5\nExp Crystal L\n3\n1\nExp Crystal M×5\n2\n1\nMemoria Niter L\n50\n1\nMemoria Niter M×10\n50\n1\nMemoria Niter S×20\n50\n1\nRevive Crystal×3\n1\n20\nLimited-Time Only Lineup\n★3[Strong Belief] Koharu\n32\n1\n★4[Moment of Victory] Yuuki\n50\n1\nGhost Mask A\n7\n1\nGhost Mask B\n7\n1\nGhost Mask C\n7\n1\nGhost Mask D\n7\n1\nGhost Mask E\n7\n1\nGhost Mask F\n7\n1\nGhost Mask G\n7\n1\nGhost Mask H\n7\n1\nGhost Costume Top and Bottom\n35\n1\n★3[Silica's Partner] Lisbeth\n26\n1\n★3[Asuna's Partner] Yuuki\n26\n1\n★3[Leafa's Partner] Sinon\n26\n1\n★3[Dashing Sword-Point] Yuuki\n26\n1\n★3[Fishing Boy] Kirito\n26\n1\n★3[Happy Companion] Asuna\n26\n1\n★3[Fishing Master] Nishida\n26\n1\nMahi-Mahi Sword\n24\n1\nHalfbeak Rapier\n24\n1\nPorcupinefish Hammer\n24\n1\nSawshark Lance\n24\n1\nTuna Axe\n24\n1\nSaury Dagger\n24\n1\nAngelfish Bow\n24\n1\n★4[Returning Seaman] Agil\n44\n1\nBridal Tuxedo\n35\n1\nBridal Dress\n35\n1\nBridal Pin\n1\n1\nBridal Tiara\n4\n1\nBridal Bracelet\n1\n1\nBridal Necklace\n1\n1\nCalming Swimsuit Top\n26\n1\nPassion Bikini Top\n26\n1\nCalming Swimsuit Bottoms\n15\n1\nPassion Wrap Skirt Bottoms\n15\n1\nPassion Bikini Bottoms\n15\n1\nCalming Straw Hat\n7\n1\nPassion Elegant Hat\n7\n1\nCalming Sunglass\n3\n1\nPassion Sunglass\n3\n1\n★3[Silent Archer] Sinon\n26\n1\n★3[Summer Clothes] Lisbeth\n26\n1\nAvatar Images\n▼Weapon Avatar\nIcon\nEquipment Name\nEquipment Type\nMahi-Mahi Sword\n1H Sword\nHalfbeak Rapier\n1H Rapier\nPorcupinefish Hammer\n1H Club\nSawshark Lance\n2H Spear\nTuna Axe\n2H Axe\nSaury Dagger\nDagger\nAngelfish Bow\nBow\nImportant\nThere are some limited-time items in the Medal of Combat Arts Trader that will update once every 3 months.\nThe trade limit will reset on the 1st of every month at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe next lineup update is planned for 4/1, 2026 (Wed) 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nDepending on the event, \"Medals of Combat Arts\" may not be available as a reward.\nThe schedule and lineup may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
