    "full_details": "Notices\n[That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime] Collab Order Vol. 3 is here! Rimuru joins the party! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2026-01-21 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nRimuru of That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime is added, with one new ★4 Skill Record!\nSinon, Leafa, and Yui are dressed in That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime character outfits in these new ★4 Skill Records!\n\"\nThat Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime Collab Order VOL. 3\n\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Floating Castle's Ultimate Ability] Rimuru\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nStarburst Stream\nSkill Name\nStarburst Stream\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nSlash\nElement\nSlash\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nFire\n→\nWind\n→(Slash)\nSkill Cool Time\n20.0\nSkill Cool Time\n40.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n62\nBreak Gauge\n124\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (16x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (16x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Critical rate +500%./[Bonus] When HP is under 25%, Critical damage +100%./[Bonus] Switch gauge amount +50% when hitting buffed enemies.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Holy Knight Shooter] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nDead End Rainbow\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n58\nSkill Effect\n2720% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Shine Force 4/Buff] Holy element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +20% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Holy element damage +50%.\nLLv100：The lower your own HP, attack increases.(max 200%)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Sylph Nightmare] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nGreedy Drain\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n92\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n2490% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Labyrinth Fairy] Yui\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Enhance Attack/High Battle Healing\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Spirit Unity 3] + 5 increase to Awakening rate./[Enhance Attack 3] Attack +12%./[High Battle Healing 3] Recovers a max of 1.2% HP per 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSwitch Boost\n[When Rush Activates] boost to your own switch guage.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n\"[Floating Castle's Ultimate Ability] Rimuru\" and \"[Holy Knight Shooter] Sinon\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nAfter the January 21, 2026 (Wed) maintenance - January 30, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nCertain characters do not have voice effects when obtaining their Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
