    "snippet": "Avis destiné aux utilisateurs se connectant à \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".  La maintenance que nous avons mise en œuvre à partir du 15/01/2026 à 13h00 a été achevée le 15/01/2026 à 17h00 (JST/UTC+9). Voici les nouvelles mises à jour.  ▼Événements nouvellement implémentés et nouveaux Ajout de récompenses, de quêtes de difficulté élevée et de scénarios secondaires pour...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(1/15)\nMAINT.\n2026-01-15 13:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 1/15, 2026, 13:00, was completed on 1/15, 2026, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nAdded rewards, high difficulty and side scenario quests to \"That Time I Got Teleported to SAO\"\n\"TenSura Collab Happy Dungeon\" begins\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 67 begins\n\"Wonder Animal Assault 2026\" begins\nAdded \"Flame Stallion Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime Collab Order VOL. 2\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where the Squad Jumble \"Watch\" feature could not be disabled until the battle ended\nFixed an issue where, if a Charge Skill was synced to a Connect Skill, Charge Skills in other connectors would not activate correctly\nFixed an issue where, for certain monsters' special area attacks, the attack warning indicator did not align with the actual hit area\nFixed an issue where equipment purchases sometimes failed\nAdjusted Koharu's behavior as she she sits down in a chair\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n1/15, 2026 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nAdded rewards, high difficulty and side scenario quests to \"That Time I Got Teleported to SAO\"\n\"TenSura Collab Happy Dungeon\" begins\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 67 begins\n\"Wonder Animal Assault 2026\" begins\nAdded \"Flame Stallion Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 1/15 Maintenance\n\"New Year's Grab Bag 2026 Order\"\n\"Wandering Traveler Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\n©RK/K/SP ©BNEI © T,F,K/TSP\nGo to Notice List"
