    "full_details": "Notices\n[That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime] Collab Panel Missions are here! There are two Panel Missions! Get these collab Skill Records and Memory Stamps!\nCampaign\n2026-01-07 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate the SAOIF x That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime collaboration, \"TenSura Collab Celebration Panel Mission\" are here!\nEvery cleared mission listed on a panel unlocks another panel. Clear 9 missions to get the Complete Reward: ★4[A Slime Here Too]Rimuru!\nEach cleared mission gets you rewards, limited-edition collab stamps, and other collab-specific items useful for raids!\nThere are two Panel Missions in total!\nThe first starts after the January 7, 2026 (Wed) maintenance, and the second stars after the January 15 (Thu) maintenance.\n* The second will not be displayed until you complete the first.\nPeriod\nThe first: After the January 7, 2026 (Wed) maintenance - January 30, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe second: After the January 15, 2026 (Thu) maintenance - January 30, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n* This Reward is available until January 30, 2026 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nChat Stamps\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nItems for Acquisition\nRimuru 2\nTenSura Collab Stamp 2\nRimuru 4\nTenSura Collab Stamp 4\nVeldora 2\nTenSura Collab Stamp 7\nSouei\nTenSura Collab Stamp 11\nHakurou\nTenSura Collab Stamp 12\nHinata\nTenSura Collab Stamp 16\nLuminus\nTenSura Collab Stamp 17\nGreat Sage 1\nTenSura Collab Stamp 19\nGreat Sage 2\nTenSura Collab Stamp 20\nMission Details\nTenSura Collab Panel Mission 1\nMission\nRewards\nAmount\nLog in\nHi-potion\n100\nEnhance an equipment 1 time\nTenSura Collab Stamp 2\n1\nChange your equipment\nTenSura Collab Stamp 11\n1\nEnhance a Skill Record 1 time\nRevive Crystal\n100\nClear the collab quests through the end\nSlime Gummy\n30\nEquip a Collab Skill Record\nTenSura Collab Stamp 12\n1\nClear Sword Art Labyrinth 10 times\nTenSura Collab Stamp 16\n1\nCreate a Party\nTenSura Collab Stamp 4\n1\nUse Chat or Stamp\nTenSura Collab Stamp 19\n1\nComplete Reward\nAmount\n[A Slime Here Too] Rimuru\n1\nTenSura Collab Panel Mission 2\nMission\nRewards\nAmount\nClear Shion's quest\nShion's Cooking\n10\nClear Shuna's quest\nHi-potion\n200\nClear Benimaru's quest\nMartial Arts Text\n30\nClear Milim's quest\nExp Crystal M\n20\nClear Diablo's quest\nSlime Gummy\n30\nObtain a total of 500 Stellar Gold Coins\nSaleable Col Bag\n25\nClear the Daily Dungeon 1 time\nTenSura Collab Stamp 20\n1\nDo an Assisting Character interaction quest 3 times\nTenSura Collab Stamp 7\n1\nMake a listing at the Market\nTenSura Collab Stamp 17\n1\n* A Sellable Col Bag can be sold for 100,000 Col at the merchant.\nComplete Reward\nAmount\n[A Slime Here Too] Rimuru\n1\nImportant\nIf the ★4 Skill Records you acquire as rewards for this event have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Record Kit M\".\n\"Hi-potion\", \"Shion's Cooking\" and \"Slime Gummy\" will be deleted on January 30, 2026 (Fri) at 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
