    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Exciting New Year Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2026-01-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAlice, Sinon, Lisbeth and Kirito spend their New Year's thinking about their New Year's resolutions in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nExciting New Year Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[New Day's Guidance] Alice\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWater Bump Burst\nSkill Name\nWater Bump\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Slash→\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nBreak Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n114\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2460% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n6000% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Water element's damage rises by the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set x 9%./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +100%, when equipping no Eiji Skill Records in the same set.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Radiant Hatsumode] Sinon\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nHoly Rain Burst\nSkill Name\nHoly Rain\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nHoly\n→Thrust→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n76\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2350% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Target Location/Arc/Mid]/[Shine Force 4/Buff] Holy element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +20% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5700% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Target Location/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] The lower your own HP, attack increases.(max 200%)/[Bonus] Holy element damage increases x 0.5% the number of Debility stacks when the player is inflicted with the Debility status ailment./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Lanterns Along the Path] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nStone Roll\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n42\nSkill Effect\n2060% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nEarth damage +50% when using earth skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise earth damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[New Year's Technique] Kirito\nSkill Name\nFive Sharp Weapons/Duet\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Five Sharp Weapons 3] Attack +800 when attacking with thrust element./[Duet 2] Switch gauge amount +10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nEffect duration is extended.\nThe higher the Limit Break level, the more Link Level increases when attacking with Link Sword Skills.\nWhen Activated: Attack +500 when using Link Sword Skills.\nLLv100: Skill Power is added +100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[New Day's Guidance] Alice\" and \"[Radiant Hatsumode] Sinon\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nJanuary 1, 2026 (Thu) 0:00 - January 31, 2026 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
