    "full_details": "Notices\nScenario event \"The Way of the Swordsmen\" is back! Get event-limited Weapon Avatars, Memory Stamps, a ★4 Sinon Skill Record, and more!\nEVENT\n2025-12-28 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"The Way of the Swordsmen\" is back!\nKirito has summoned your group to take on the quest to obtain the legendary Eternal Sword.\nRewards\nGet event-limited Weapon Avatars, Memory Stamps, the ★4[This Is for You] Sinon Skill Record, and more!\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Star\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medal of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 200\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\n\"Star Fragment\" may drop on certain difficulty levels!\nFor this returning event, acquisition status of Total Score Rewards, Challenge Rewards and Trader Rewards from last time will be reset, allowing players to acquire these rewards once more.\nSkill Record\n★4[This Is for You] Sinon\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Crisis Heal\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2275\nSkill Effect\n●[Advance Trooper 2] Attack +200./●[Crisis Heal 4] Recovers HP 200 every 3 sec when HP is under 20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nDiscussion with Leafa\nWeapon Avatar\nIcon\nEquipment Name\nEquipment Type\n？？？\n1H Sword\nEvent-limited recovery item\nIcon\nItem Name\nEffect\nBubble Gum\nInstantly recovers 2000 HP,\nand then gradually recovers 200 HP at a time over 30 sec.\nTrade \"Crude Phosphorescent Ore\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n★4[This Is for You] Sinon\n400\n1\nMemory Stamp 226\nUse to obtain the \"Discussion with Leafa\" stamp.\n100\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n300\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nMemoria Niter S\n500\n5\nTrade \"Crude Golden Glowing Ore\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\n★4[This Is for You] Sinon\n400\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n300\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n25\nMemoria Niter S\n500\n5\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Starting Point\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\" and \"Gaining Ground\", difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nThe score earned in \"Extreme\" difficulty is not added to the \"Total Score Reward\", but you will receive rewards based on your score.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score\nStarting Point\nBasic Clear Bonus:74P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n80\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:170P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n200\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:420P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n480\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:1680P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n1800\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus:1000P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n1120\n\"Gaining Ground\"\nYou can get a high score in the\n\"Gaining Ground\"\ndifficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the\n\"Gaining Ground\"\none time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nHigh difficulty\n\"Extreme\"\nThe\n\"Extreme\"\ndifficulty has a Recommended Total Power of 140,000. The Boss monster has weaknesses that are different from those on other difficulty levels.\nThe score earned in\n\"Extreme\"\ndifficulty is not added to the \"Total Score Reward\", but you will receive rewards based on your score.\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join Gaining Ground and Extreme difficulty Quick Parties.\nGaining Ground: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nExtreme: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\n★4[This Is for You] Sinon×7\nArcana Gems×600\nMemoria Niter S×160\nMedal of Combat Arts×9\nAwakening Star×35\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\nSpecial items that can be received from \"Extreme\" Score Rewards\nMemoria Niter S×20\nMedal of Combat Arts×5\nAwakening Star×15\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nSearch for the Legendary Sword\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Crude Phosphorescent Ores in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nUnity of Heart & Sword\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Crude Phosphorescent Ores in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nSo freakin' cool!\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Crude Golden Glowing Ores in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"The Way of the Swordsmen Event\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 4 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nDecember 28, 2025 (Sun) 0:00 - Before the January 21, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTrader Period\nDecember 28, 2025 (Sun) 0:00 - Before the January 28, 2026 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nGustav the Burglary Titan\nDetails\nYou can perform breaks.\nOn \"Extreme\" difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nWater Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Extreme\" difficulty\nSlash Element\nEarth Element\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Frostbite\" and \"Stun\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\nFor details on the effects of \"Status Ailments\", please check in-game via \"Menu\" > \"System\" > \"Help\" > \"Buff, Debuff, and Status Ailments\".\nAlternatively, please refer to the\n\"Status Ailments\"\nsection of the Play Guide.\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nAfter you clear the Gaining Ground dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nIf the ★4 Skill Records you acquire as rewards for this event have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Record Kit M\".\nIf you have previously played the \"The Way of the Swordsmen\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nAchievements and achievement progress\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\n\"Crude Phosphorescent Ore\", \"Crude Golden Glowing Ore\", and \"Bubble Gum\" will be deleted on January 28, 2026 (Wed) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nThis event does not support Story Replay.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
