    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"End of the Year Grab Bag 2025 Order\" is here! Two ★4 Skill Records guaranteed! 25% ★4 Skill Record Rate!\nShop\n2025-12-27 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe \"End of the Year Grab Bag 2025 Order\" containing a selection of heroes journeying through Aincrad features an incredible\n2 guaranteed ★4 Skill Records\n!\nThe\n25% total drop rate\ndoes not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record!\nAvailable up to 10 times per player!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Revival Strike] Kirito\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nStarburst Stream\nSkill Name\nStarburst Stream\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nSlash\nElement\nSlash\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nFire\n→\nWind\n→(Slash)\nSkill Cool Time\n20.0\nSkill Cool Time\n40.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n62\nBreak Gauge\n124\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (16x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (16x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping no Heathcliff Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Critical rate +500%./[Bonus] When HP is under 25%, Critical damage +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Flash of Fury] Asuna\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nThrust\nElement\nThrust\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nWind\n→\nDark\n→Thrust\nSkill Cool Time\n18.0\nSkill Cool Time\n36.0\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nBreak Gauge\n49\nBreak Gauge\n98\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec./[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 150%./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping 2 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Critical damage +100% when your own HP is above 75%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +50%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Stone Rampart] Heathcliff\nSkill Name\nVital Assention/Sacred Blade Protection/Blockade/Forbidden Gate/Reduced Battle Wounds\nAttack\n44\nDefense\n20\nHP\n2200\nSkill Effect\n[Vital Assention 4] Defense +450./[Sacred Blade Protection] Defense rises 5% x the number of Heathcliff Skill Records in the same set./[Blockade1] All elemental damage decreases by 100% x the number of Asuna Skill Records in the same set (Non-elemental included)./[Forbidden Gate 1] Hit rate decreases by 50% x the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Reduced Battle Wounds 5] Reduces damage from slash, thrust, and blunt element monsters and status ailment damage by 5%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Dazzling Night Stage] Yuna\nSkill Name\nThrust protect/Song of Pursuit\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Thrust protect 4] Reduce damage from 15% thrust element monster./[Song of Pursuit 4] (Invalid when equipped by Partner) When the target is hit using the Switch, adds a buff that recovers your HP (3%/3 sec) for 30 sec.Also, it adds additional effects depending on Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 3 or more of Yuna's Skill Records: Adds a buff (PT Enhance Blunt 4) that increases damage done to enemies weak to blunt by +30%.When equipping 4 or more of Yuna's Skill Records: Adds a buff (PT Enhance Thrust 4) that increases damage done to enemies weak to thrust by +30%.When equipping 5 or more of Yuna's Skill Records: Adds a buff (PT Enhance Slash 4) that increases damage done to enemies weak to slash by +30%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Nighttime Crawl] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nPhantom Swatter\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n82\nBreak Gauge\n38\nSkill Effect\n2170% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Bleed/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Leafa's Skill Records in the same set, Bleed (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Anticlimax 4/Buff] The greater your remaining HP ratio, attack increases (Stack 9) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[The All-Reaping Blade] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nBurrowing Water\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n112\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n2110% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Frostbite (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Stigma/Debuff] Increases damage taken by enemies for 18 sec (Stack 9) +0.5% for every Stack 1.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Duration\nDecember 27, 2025 (Sat) 17:00 - January 3, 2026 (Sat) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Orders for 5,000 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nThis can only be purchased 10 times per account.\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nCertain characters do not have voice effects when obtaining their Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
