    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Avatar Party (Winter)\" is back! One Weapon Avatar is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2025-12-17 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe\nAvatar Party (Winter)\nis back with winter Avatars and Weapon Avatars!\nOne Weapon Avatar guaranteed per 11 Orders!\n* The Weapon Avatar Fimbul is available with and without effects for each weapon!\n【Weapon Avatar Images】\n【Other Avatars in the Lineup】\nNew Year Dress Avatar\nSetsubun Avatar\nChocolate Avatar\n- Duration\nAfter the December 17, 2025 (Wed) maintenance - February 28, 2026 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 150 Arcana Gems\n11 Orders for 1,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nThe arrow part of the Best Wishes Hamayumi is an accessory. It does not fly.\nWeapon avatars will only display when they match with the weapon type you have equipped.\nShield avatars are in included in the weapon avatar category.\nSome of the avatars available in this Order have equip conditions that depend on the equipped character's gender.\nAll avatars, both female and male, are available in the Order regardless of your own character's gender.\nKoharu can also equip female avatars and accessories.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
