    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Wandering Traveler Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-12-17 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nWandering the world at will! New ★4 Kirito, Sinon, Koharu, and Lisbeth Skill Records are here!\nThe \"\nWandering Traveler Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Wind-Summoning Speed] Kirito\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Earth Conversion/Stagehand\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Earth Conversion 5] Wind element's damage to enemies -15% and earth element's damage to enemies +30%./[Stagehand 4] When equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nEffect duration is extended.\nThe higher the Limit Break level, the more Link Level increases when attacking with Link Sword Skills.\nWhen Activated: Attack +500 when using Link Sword Skills.\nLLv100: Skill Power  is added +100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Wind-Guided Strike] Sinon\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nEarth Pressure Burst\nSkill Name\nEarth Pressure\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→\nEarth\n→Thrust→\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n53\nSwitch Gauge\n53\nBreak Gauge\n53\nBreak Gauge\n106\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2420% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Earth Element Enhance4/Buff] Earth element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 1/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +15% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5900% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] The lower your own HP, attack increases.(max 200%)/[Bonus] Earth element's damage rises by the number of Sinon Skill Records in the same set x 9%./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +100%, when equipping no Eiji Skill Records in the same set.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Wind-Wrapped Might] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nRock Fall\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n39\nSkill Effect\n2820% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Element Weak 4/Debuff] Earth element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec./[Enhance Thrust 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +20% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Earth element damage +50%.\nLLv100：Attack +100% against debuffed enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Wind-Cleaving Vajra] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nCrag Stamp\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n39\nSkill Effect\n2340% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)/[Enhance Blunt 2/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +20% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nLink Skill\nLink Level increases by attacking during Link State.\nSkill Power increases by Link Level x 4%.\n*Counts as a Link Skill only when using a compatible weapon type.\nWhen Activated: Earth element damage +50%.\nLLv100：Attack +100% against enemies with the debuff (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Wind-Guided Strike] Sinon\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the December 17, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 15, 2026 (Thu) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
