    "snippet": "Avis destiné aux utilisateurs se connectant à \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\". La maintenance sera en vigueur aux dates ci-dessous.  ▼Dates de maintenance programmées le 28 novembre 2025, de 11h00 à 17h00 (provisoire)(JST/UTC+9) ▼Événements nouvellement implémentés et nouveaux Au moment où vous synchronisez, la bataille évolue ! Les \"Link Skill\" sont h...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(11/28)\nMAINT.\n2025-11-27 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n11/28, 2025 11:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe moment you sync, the battle evolves! \"Link Skill\" are here\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 89F\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Holiday Campaign! Panel Mission\" begins\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Silica's Heapin' 50M EXP Event\" begins\nAdded \"Violet Glider Hunt\" Event rewards\nNew Order begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 11/28 Maintenance\n\"Whisper of Maple Leaves Order\"\n\"Peerless Hero Order\"\n\"Six Goddesses Descend Underworld Order\"\n\"Aincrad Day: Free Once Daily 11x Order\"\n[Aincrad Day] \"LafCof Assault 2025\"\n[Aincrad Day] \"2025 Fall Fishing Competition\"\n[Aincrad Day] \"Core Metal+++ Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\nThe 10th \"Squad Jumble\"\n\"Ring Production Campaign\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
