    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Six Goddesses Descend Underworld Order\" is back! One returning ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2025-11-16 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOriginal goddess accounts from \"\nSword Art Online Last Recollection\n\" for Lisbeth, Silica, Yuuki, Asuna, Sinon, and Leafa are here as returning Skill Records!\nThe \"\nSix Goddesses Descend Underworld Order\n\" is back! Get one returning ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for returning ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne returning ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n* The Step Number from the previous \"Six Goddesses Descend Underworld Order\" will not be carried over. (Players will start from Step 1.)\n【Returning ★4 Skill Record】\n★4[Hammer of Fiery Dust] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nProminence Clash\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n31\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n1870% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Stigma/Debuff] Increases damage taken by enemies for 15 sec (Stack 5) +0.5% for every Stack 1.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nBoost 10 → 20 → 30 to your own switch guage when hitting with skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set, recover +4 → 12 → 20 SP when this skill direct hits.\n★4[Raging Storm] Silica\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nTempest Edge Burst\nSkill Name\nTempest Edge\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→Slash→\nWind\n→\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n60\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2010% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4740% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemy with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite).\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Resurrecting Clash] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Shine Conversion/Sword Goddess\nAttack\n62\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Shine Conversion 4] Dark element's damage to enemies -10% and holy element's damage to enemies +25%./[Sword Goddess1] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 1 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records: Attack +25%.When equipping 1 or more of Sinon's Skill Records: Max HP increase 10%.When equipping 1 or more of Silica's Skill Records: Skill's power is added +200% when used in switch.When equipping 1 or more of Asuna's Skill Records: Critical damage +30%.When equipping 1 or more of Leafa's Skill Records: Recovers a max of 1% HP per 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nDragon Qi\n[When Rush Activates] Recover all status ailments.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Proud Heart] Asuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nFenomeno Light Burst\nSkill Name\nFenomeno Light\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nHoly\n→Thrust→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n84\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1520% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Holy Element Enhance4/Buff] Holy element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4260% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Critical rate +1000%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Heavenly Dancing Light] Sinon\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nAnnihilation Photon Burst\nSkill Name\nAnnihilation Photon\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nHoly\n→Thrust→\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n35\nBreak Gauge\n70\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2030% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Wide]/[Holy Element Enhance4/Buff] Holy element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 1/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +15% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4780% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Wide]/[Bonus] The lower your own HP, attack increases.(max 200%)/[Bonus] Critical rate +300% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Breath of Abundance] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nValiant Nitrogen\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n60\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1780% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Recover 15% of max HP when defeating monsters with this skill.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n\"[Hammer of Fiery Dust] Lisbeth\", \"[Raging Storm] Silica\", \"[Heavenly Dancing Light] Sinon\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nNovember 16, 2025 (Sun) 0:00 - Before the November 28, 2025 (Fri) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne returning ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
