    "full_details": "Notices\n[Aincrad Day] Fireworks on the 100th floor! The Ruby Palace Celebration is here!\nEVENT\n2025-11-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAn Aincrad Day special event!\nThe Ruby Palace Celebration, where fireworks fly in the 100th floor's Heavenly Garden, is here!\nTo celebrate Aincrad Day on November 6, we'll be distributing 116 Fireworks. Please enjoy them in the 100th floor's Heavenly Garden!\n▼ Event Period / Fireworks Distribution Period\nStarts after the November 6, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the November 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\n▼Important\nIf you have not received your Fireworks during the distribution period, please try logging in again.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
