    "full_details": "Notices\n\"The Whisper of Maple Leaves Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2025-11-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAlice, Leafa, Silica, and Lisbeth are covered head to toe in autumn colors in these new ★4 Skill Records!\n\"\nThe Whisper of Maple Leaves Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Autumn Leaf Teahouse] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShadow Creep\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n41\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Secret Autumn Bonfire] Leafa\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nRock Double Down Burst\nSkill Name\nRock Double Down\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→\nEarth\n→Blunt→\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n96\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2530% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Earth Element Enhance4/Buff] Earth element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n6200% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%./[Bonus] Earth element damage increases x 0.5% the number of poison stacks when the player is inflicted with the poison status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Autumn-Colored Gift] Silica\nSkill Name\nPeak/Small Engravement\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Peak 3] Attack +40% when HP is above 80%./[Small Engravement] When equipping 3 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set and hitting with switch, adds debuff (Small Mark).(Invalid when equipped by Partner)The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Joyful Autumn Harvest] Lisbeth\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nRock Flip Burst\nSkill Name\nRock Flip\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→\nEarth\n→Blunt→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n25\nBreak Gauge\n50\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1990% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Element Enhance4/Buff] Earth element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5500% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark)./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%./[Bonus] Earth element damage increases x 0.5% the number of poison stacks when the player is inflicted with the poison status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Autumn Leaf Teahouse] Alice\" and \"[Secret Autumn Bonfire] Leafa\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nNovember 1, 2025 (Sat) 0:00 - Before the November 28, 2025 (Fri) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
