    "full_details": "Notices\n[30 Million Downloads Celebration] Two ★4 Skill Records guaranteed! 25% ★4 Skill Record Rate! The 30 Million Downloads Celebration Thank You Campaign Grab Bag Order is here!\nShop\n2025-10-25 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThank you for playing Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\nThanks to all of your support, Sword Art Online Integral Factor has surpassed 30 million downloads worldwide!\nTo celebrate the occasion, we are holding the\n30 Million Downloads Celebration Thank You Campaign Grab Bag Order\n!\nTwo ★4 Skill Records Guaranteed!\n！\nThe\n25% total drop rate\ndoes not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record!\nAvailable up to 10 times per player!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Battle of Life and Death] Kirito\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nStarburst Stream\nSkill Name\nStarburst Stream\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nSlash\nElement\nSlash\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nFire\n→\nWind\n→Slash\nSkill Cool Time\n20.0\nSkill Cool Time\n40.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n62\nBreak Gauge\n124\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (16x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (16x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping no Heathcliff Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Critical rate +500%./[Bonus] When HP is under 25%, Critical damage +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Time for a Challenge] Koharu\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nRapid Scratch Burst\nSkill Name\nRapid Scratch\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nSlash\nElement\nSlash\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→Slash→Slash→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n18.0\nSkill Cool Time\n36.0\nSwitch Gauge\n88\nSwitch Gauge\n88\nBreak Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n88\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2200% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5260% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +1000 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Increases attack against enemies with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite). +1% for every Stack 1./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping 2 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Instant Sword Flash] Yuuki\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nSlash\nElement\nSlash\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nWater\n→\nHoly\n→Slash\nSkill Cool Time\n20.0\nSkill Cool Time\n40.0\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n56\nBreak Gauge\n112\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping no Kirito Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Critical rate +500%./[Bonus] Critical damage +100% when your own HP is above 75%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +50%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Warrior's Aura] Agil\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWind Scrap Burst\nSkill Name\nWind Scrap\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→\nWind\n→Blunt→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nBreak Gauge\n51\nBreak Gauge\n102\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1680% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4620% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%./[Bonus] Wind element damage increases x 0.5% the number of bleed stacks when the player is inflicted with the bleed status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Whirlwind of Blades] Mito\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHydro Swatter\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n82\nBreak Gauge\n38\nSkill Effect\n2320% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/[Anticlimax 4/Buff] The greater your remaining HP ratio, attack increases (Stack 3) for 20 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Agil's Skill Records in the same set, Frostbite (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Anticlimax 4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, the greater your remaining HP ratio, attack increases (Stack 9) for 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Smooth Cover Fire] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nGale Plasma\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n2190% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nOctober 25, 2025 (Sat) 0:00 - October 31, 2025 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Orders for 5,000 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nThis can only be purchased 10 times per account.\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nCertain characters do not have voice effects when obtaining their Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
