    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Asuna's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Asuna!\nShop\n2025-09-30 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Asuna's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Creation & Rebirth] Asuna\n(Accele Skill)\" and \"\n[Flash of Fury] Asuna\n(Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nAsuna's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Asuna guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Asuna\" is guaranteed!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Creation & Rebirth] Asuna\nSkill Name\nCombination/Prosper/Hold the Front/Frontal Attack\nAttack\n60\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n●[Combination 3] Skill's power is added +75% when used in switch./[Prosper 5] Attack +25% when HP is above 50%/[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Frontal Attack 5] Aggro increase -50% when attack hits.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Flash of Fury] Asuna\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nThrust\nElement\nThrust\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nWind\n→\nDark\n→Thrust\nSkill Cool Time\n18.0\nSkill Cool Time\n36.0\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nBreak Gauge\n49\nBreak Gauge\n98\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec./[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 150%./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping 2 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Critical damage +100% when your own HP is above 75%.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +50%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Flash of Fury] Asuna\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nSeptember 30, 2025 (Tue) 0:00 - October 9, 2025 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Asuna\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Asuna\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
