    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(9/3)\nMAINT.\n2025-09-02 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 9/3, 2025, 14:00, was completed on 9/3, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt\" begins\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 7x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\nAdded \"ghost? Assault 2025\" Event rewards\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n\"Full Burst Step-Up Order\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nThe Guild Room will be changed to the usual theme.\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where the item icon for \"Dragonian Pugilist Ingot\" did not match the effect described in its item description\nFixed an issue where \"Dragonian Pugilist Ingot\" was not auto-locked when produced\nFixed an issue with the 61F subquest \"Kokone Just Can't Give Up\", where the Sub-Quest NPC shortcut feature did not operate correctly\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n9/3, 2025 14:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt\" begins\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Multiple Rounds: 7x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n[Worldwide 7.5 Year Anniversary] \"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\nAdded \"ghost? Assault 2025\" Event rewards\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 9/3 Maintenance\n\"Smiling Summer Night Festival Order\"\n\"Summer Beach Attire Avatars Order\"\n\"Guild Support Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
