    "snippet": "Au cours de cette campagne, obtenez 2x plus d'expérience dans les quêtes de personnages à plusieurs tours ! C'est votre chance d'élever facilement votre niveau de joueur !  Début de l'événement Acceptez la quête de personnage sur le babillard du quartier marchand.  Conditions de participation Terminez la quête principale 1F jusqu'à la fin de la campagne...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" is here!\nCampaign\n2025-08-14 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nDuring this campaign, get\n2x\nthe experience in Multiple Rounds Character Quests!\nThis is your chance to easily raise your player level!\nEvent Start\nAccept the Character Quest from the Bulletin Board in the Merchant District.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 1F Main Quest through the end\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the August 14, 2025 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the August 20, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nImportant\nDoes not include First-time Character Quests.\nThe EXP displayed in the Quest Details is the x2 value.\nx2 EXP not included when a monster is defeated.\nIf the event finishes while you are in the middle of the Character Quest, you will gain the normal amount of EXP.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
