    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(8/14)\nMAINT.\n2025-08-13 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 8/14, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 8/14, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 7th \"Squad Jumble\" Event Restart\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 62 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Carnival Beast Hunt\"\nAdded \"Agil Summer Festival 2025\" Event rewards\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where the Boarding Guide did not appear at the Beach (Night)\nFixed an issue where \"Some attacks will remove buffs from the players\" was not listed in the \"Boss Details\" for the \"Chaos Showdown 255 - Dark Black Overseer\"\nThis was a display-only issue and does not affect the monster's settings.\nFixed the following skill name (No changes to the effect)\n[Rocked by the Waves] Leafa: [Martial Artist 4] ⇒ [Martial Artist 3]\n[Humorous Principal] Kibaou: [Resentment 3] ⇒ [Resentment]\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n▼Scheduled Maintenance dates\n8/14, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 7th \"Squad Jumble\" Event Restart\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 62 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Carnival Beast Hunt\"\nAdded \"Agil Summer Festival 2025\" Event rewards\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n▼Ending Soon! Available until the start of the 8/14 Maintenance\n\"Fatal Battle: Legion Butterfly\"\n\"Explore the Dungeon with Yui\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
