    "snippet": "Kirito, Asuna, Sinon et Agil sont des guerriers défendant une ville dans le désert dans ces nouveaux records de compétences ★4 ! L'« Ordre des Lames de Sable » est là ! Obtenez un nouveau record de compétence ★4 garanti à l'étape 5 ! Le taux d'abandon total de 6 % n'inclut pas le record de compétence ★4 garanti, et les nouveaux records de compétence ★4 sont présentés Sk...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Sand Blade Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2025-07-16 17:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Asuna, Sinon, and Agil are warriors defending a city in the desert in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nSand Blade Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Scorching Sand Explorer] Kirito\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFlame Shear Burst\nSkill Name\nFlame Shear\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→Slash→\nFire\n→\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n78\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2460% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n6000% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Leafa's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +100%./[Bonus] Fire element damage increases x 0.5% the number of burn stacks when the player is inflicted with the burn status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Sandstorm Sword Dance] Asuna\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Halo\nAttack\n57\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Halo 3] Defense -30% and during the buff effect for increased max HP the hit rate -30%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nDeals +5% Holy element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Archer of the Mirage] Sinon\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nDark Meteoroid Burst\nSkill Name\nDark Meteoroid\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Thrust→\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n28\nBreak Gauge\n56\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2060% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 1/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +15% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5700% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Bonus] The lower your own HP, attack increases.(max 200%)/[Bonus] Dark element damage increases x 0.5% the number of Curse stacks when the player is inflicted with the Curse status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Pioneer of the Wasteland] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWhirl Shine\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n156\nBreak Gauge\n66\nSkill Effect\n2490% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Wide]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nHoly damage +50% when using Holy skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Holy damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Scorching Sand Explorer] Kirito\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the July 16, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends August 12, 2025 (Tue) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
