    "snippet": "Avis destiné aux utilisateurs se connectant à \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".  La maintenance que nous avons mise en œuvre à partir du 9/7 2025 à 13h00 a été terminée le 9/7 2025 à 17h30. (JST/UTC+9) Nous enverrons des excuses pour la maintenance. 50 gemmes arcanes Disponibles jusqu'au : 16/07/2025 (mercredi) à 23h59 (JST/UTC+9...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Edited]Notice for maintenance(7/9)\nMAINT.\n2025-07-08 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 7/9, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 7/9, 2025, 17:30.(JST/UTC+9)\nWe will be sending out token of apology for the maintenance.\n50 Arcana Gems\nAvailable until:7/16/2025(Wed) at 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 7th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 61 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Wandering Elven Hunt\"\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n\"Silica's Heapin' 40M EXP Event\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\n\"Nomads Living on the Plains Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where the Adamas Snake Tiara could not be used at the Market\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n7/9, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe 7th \"Squad Jumble\" begins\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 61 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Wandering Elven Hunt\"\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n\"Silica's Heapin' 40M EXP Event\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" update\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 7/9 Maintenance\n\"Fairy Paradise Order\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Boss Rush VS Genie\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Guild Support Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
