    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Fairy Paradise Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2025-06-11 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAlice, Asuna, Sachi, and Silica are dressed as adorable fairies who dwell in the quiet forest in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nFairy Paradise Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nThe 6% total drop rate does not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record, and new ★4 Skill Records are featured Skill Records with high drop rates!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Spirit in the Green Breeze] Alice\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nDark Shudder Burst\nSkill Name\nDark Shudder\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→Slash→\nDark\n→\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n76\nSwitch Gauge\n76\nBreak Gauge\n58\nBreak Gauge\n116\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2460% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n6000% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +100%./[Bonus] Dark element damage increases x 0.5% the number of Curse stacks when the player is inflicted with the Curse status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Communion with All Creation] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nSquare Shadow\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n100\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Amid the Silence] Sachi\nSkill Name\nReinforced Stab/Alcor/Spears Support\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2275\nSkill Effect\n[Reinforced Stab 3] Adds a buff where thrust elemental weakness damage +1% per 1 Stack (Stack 3) for 30 sec when hitting with Switch. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)/[Alcor] When equipping 2 or more of Klein's Skill Records in the same set and hitting with switch, adds debuff (Death Mark).(Invalid when equipped by Partner)Increases damage to enemy by x1.1 for 12 sec./[Spears Support 1] Switch gauge amount +15%, when using 2H Spear.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Keep Silent] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nDark Spin\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n2170% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Spirit in the Green Breeze] Alice\", \"[Communion with All Creation] Asuna\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the June 11, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 9, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
