    "snippet": "Le 5 juin, c'est l'anniversaire d'Argo ! Nous organisons diverses campagnes dans SWORD ART ONLINE : Integral Factor pour célébrer l'anniversaire d'Argo ! Célébrons tous ensemble cette merveilleuse journée !  La coiffure d'Argo ajoutée À partir du 5 juin 2025 à minuit (jeudi) (JST/UTC+9), la coiffure d'Argo a été ajoutée à la coiffure du joueur...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nJune 5 is Argo's birthday! To celebrate, Argo's hairstyle has been added to player hairstyle choices! Lots of other campaigns are being held too!\nEVENT\n2025-06-05 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nJune 5 is Argo's birthday!\nWe're holding various campaigns in SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor to celebrate Argo's birthday!\nLet's all celebrate this wonderful day together!\nArgo's Hairstyle Added\nAs of midnight on June 5, 2025 (Thu) (JST/UTC+9), Argo's hairstyle has been added to player hairstyle choices!\nYou can now select Argo's hairstyle from Makeup or when creating a new character.\n* If this hairstyle does not appear on the list, please try rebooting the app.\nThis hairstyle is only for female characters.\nHappy Dungeon with Argo\nWe're holding an event where you can get an Argo chat stamp and up to 500 Arcana Gems!\nPlease see here for more details.\nPeriod\nMay 30, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - June 6, 2025 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArgo's Birthday Order\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Argo!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\nArgo's Birthday Order is here!\nPlease see here for more details.\nDuration\nJune 5, 2025 (Thu) 0:00 - June 14, 2025 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBirthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of Argo have been placed in four in-game locations!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nJune 5, 2025 (Thu) 0:00 - June 14, 2025 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nArcana Gem Gift\nLog in on the day of Argo's birthday to get a gift of 250 Arcana Gems!\nPlease see here for more details.\nTime Limit\nAvailable until June 5, 2025 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
