    "snippet": "L'événement de scénario « [Retour] Mariage surprise » est de retour !  [De retour] Mariage surprise Nous célébrons les mariées du mois de juin avec une quête de scénario sur le thème du mariage. Terminez cette quête de scénario avec les femmes de SWORD ART ONLINE : Integral Factor !  Récompenses Obtenez des gemmes Arcana et des timbres en édition limitée de Quest R...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"[Returning] Surprise Wedding\" is back! Get a Bridal Avatar!\nEVENT\n2025-06-04 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"[Returning] Surprise Wedding\" is back!\n[Returning] Surprise Wedding\nWe're celebrating June brides with a wedding-themed scenario quest.\nClear this scenario quest with the women of SWORD ART ONLINE: Integral Factor!\nRewards\nGet Arcana Gems and\nLimited-edition Stamps\nfrom Quest Rewards.\nCombined with the Score Rewards, you can get up to 500 \"Arcana Gems\".\nCollect \"Blooming Bouquets\" from Rewards and monster drops and exchange them for Bridal Avatars or useful items to enhance or transform equipment.\nFor this returning event, acquisition status of Total Score Rewards, Challenge Rewards and Trader Rewards from last time will be reset, allowing players to acquire these rewards once more.\nAvatar Images\nMemory Stamp\nLimited-edition Stamps are back.\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nAwww\nHappy\nCrush on me?\nYay!\nTrade \"Blooming Bouquet\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nBridal Dress（Female Only）\n800\n2\nBridal Tuxedo（Male Only）\n800\n1\nBridal Pin（For both Male/Female）\n300\n2\nBridal Bracelet（For both Male/Female）\n300\n2\nBridal Tiara（For both Male/Female）\n300\n2\nBridal Necklace（For both Male/Female）\n300\n2\nRefining Hammer+\n50\n80\nTrader\nSee each Trader NPC for more info, or go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the \"Trade Blooming Bouquet\" banner.\nHigh difficulty\n\"Special\"\nYou can clear the\n\"Special\"\n3 times per day.\nIn addition, item use is restricted while inside the dungeon and \"Revive Crystals\" can only be used up to 3 times.\nScore Rewards\nEntry\nInterior\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n300\nBlooming Bouquet\n5\n400\nBlooming Bouquet\n10\n600\nRecord Frame M\n10\n800\nRecord Frame M\n15\n1200\nBlooming Bouquet\n10\n1600\nBlooming Bouquet\n15\n2100\nRestorative Potion\n20\n2800\nRestorative Potion\n30\n3000\nBlooming Bouquet\n20\n4000\nBlooming Bouquet\n25\n3900\nCleansing Potion\n5\n5200\nCleansing Potion\n10\n5400\nRecord Frame M\n20\n7200\nRecord Frame M\n30\n6600\nBlooming Bouquet\n30\n8800\nBlooming Bouquet\n35\n7800\nArcana Gems\n50\n10400\nArcana Gems\n50\n9000\nRevive Crystal\n1\n12000\nRevive Crystal\n2\nー\nー\nー\n14000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\nDepth\nDANGER\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n500\nBlooming Bouquet\n15\n600\nBlooming Bouquet\n20\n1000\nRecord Frame L\n10\n1200\nRecord Frame L\n15\n2000\nBlooming Bouquet\n20\n2400\nBlooming Bouquet\n30\n3500\nRestorative Potion\n40\n4200\nRestorative Potion\n50\n5000\nArcana Gems\n50\n6000\nArcana Gems\n50\n6500\nRelease Crystal (S)\n1\n7800\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n9000\nRecord Frame L\n20\n10800\nRecord Frame L\n30\n11000\nBlooming Bouquet\n40\n13200\nBlooming Bouquet\n50\n13000\nArcana Gems\n50\n15600\nArcana Gems\n50\n15000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n18000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n10\n17500\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n21000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\nSpecial\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n1000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n3000\nSmall Gift\n1\n5000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n7000\nMemoria Niter S\n10\n11000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nCongratulations\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Blooming Bouquets in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×1\nToss Me the Bouquet\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Blooming Bouquets in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×2\nSurprise!\nLet's collect a total of 10000 Blooming Bouquets in the time period.\nMedal of Combat Arts×3\nHow to Participate\nOpen the List of Events from the Menu in the upper left corner of the screen, and tap the \"[Returning] Surprise Wedding\" banner.\n(Tapping the in-game banner will take you to the \"Church\" Event Map.)\nOnce you're at the \"Church\" Event Map, talk to the NPC \"Julie\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 4 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the June 4, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 25, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the June 4, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 2, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nRegret Mummy\nDetails\nA mummy wrapped head to toe in bandages.\nIt releases its deep-seated hatred at the player, inflicting them with Curse.\nIts scratch and poisonous mist can inflict Poison.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nWind Element\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nIf you have previously played the \"[Returning] Surprise Wedding\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nAchievements and achievement progress\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\n\"Blooming Bouquet\" will be deleted on July 2, 2025 (Wed) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nAfter you clear a Special difficulty dungeon three times, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nScenario quests cannot be attempted with an Assist Party.\nThis event does not support Story Replay.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
