    "full_details": "Notices\n250 Arcana Gems! An Lisbeth Birthday Present Campaign!\nCampaign\n2025-05-18 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nToday (5/18) is Lisbeth's birthday!\n250 Arcana Gems have been sent to your present box in celebration of Lisbeth's birthday on May 18.\nLet's all celebrate Lisbeth's birthday together!\n▼Receive by date (Arcana Gems)\n5/18 until 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n▼Notes\n・Please note that the schedule and the content of the present are subject to change without notice.\nGo to Notice List"
