    "full_details": "Notices\nApril 20 is LLENN's birthday! To celebrate, LLENN's hairstyle has been added to player hairstyle choices!\nUPDATE\n2025-04-20 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nApril 20 is LLENN's birthday!\nTo celebrate LLENN's birthday, LLENN's hairstyle has been added to player hairstyle choices as of April 20, 2025 (Sun) 0:00 (JST/UTC+9)!\nYou can now select LLENN's hairstyle from Makeup or when creating a new character.\n* If this hairstyle does not appear on the list, please try rebooting the app.\nThis hairstyle is only for female characters.\nBirthday Panels\nPanels featuring illustrations of LLENN have been placed in four in-game locations!\nTry taking a screenshot together with them if you come across one!\nPlacement Period\nApril 20, 2025 (Sun) 0:00 - April 29, 2025 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\n・The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
