    "snippet": "Le Raising Dungeon est là pour vous aider à stimuler la croissance du personnage ! \"Joyeux donjon avec Leafa\" est là ! Obtenez le tampon Leafa et les Arcana Gems pour célébrer l'anniversaire de ce personnage !  Récompenses Des « Arcana Gems » et un timbre « Leafa » en édition limitée sont disponibles en récompense. Terminez le donjon tous les jours pendant...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】\"Happy Dungeon with Leafa\" is here! Get the Leafa stamp and Arcana Gems!\nEVENT\n2025-04-18 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\n\"Happy Dungeon with Leafa\" is here! Get the Leafa stamp and Arcana Gems in celebration of this character's birthday!\nRewards\n\"Arcana Gems\"\nand a\nlimited-edition \"Leafa\" stamp\nare available as rewards.\nClear the dungeon every day during the event to\nget up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\".\nPeriod\nApril 18, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - April 25, 2025 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nWith My Beloved Sword\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nArcana Gem\n50\n200\nArcana Gem\n50\n300\nArcana Gem\n50\n400\nArcana Gem\n100\n500\nArcana Gem\n50\n600\nArcana Gem\n50\n700\nArcana Gem\n50\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nMemory Stamp 329\nUse to obtain the \"With My Beloved Sword\" stamp.\n1\nCompleted without any tumble\nArcana Gem\n50\nCompleted within 1 minutes\nArcana Gem\n50\nImportant\nCleared dungeons will be reset the following day at 4:00am (JST/UTC+9) and can be re-attempted after that.\nThis is a solo event that you can challenge with Leafa as your partner.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
