    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Alice's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Alice!\nShop\n2025-04-09 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Alice's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Unleashed Power] Alice\n(Full Burst Skill)\" and \"\n[Noble Will] Alice\n(Connect Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nAlice's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Alice guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Alice\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Unleashed Power] Alice\nSkill Name\nBloody Battle Slash/Earth Conversion\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Bloody Battle Slash 3] Attack +35% when attacking with slash element./[Earth Conversion 4] Wind element's damage to enemies -10% and earth element's damage to enemies +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Noble Will] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSand Whirlpool\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1690% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRaises 5 → 10 → 15 stacks for buffs that increase defense that are on yourself when hitting with skills.\n- Duration\nApril 9, 2025 (Wed) 0:00 - April 18, 2025 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Alice\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Alice\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
