    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"April Fools Selection 2025 Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2025-04-04 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne ★4 Skill Record from the April Fools Orders up until 2024 is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nThe \"\nApril Fools Selection 2025 Order\n\" is on now!\n- Duration\nApril 4, 2025 (Fri) 17:00 - April 13, 2025 (Sun) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sunlight Through the Trees] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nGeyser Shock\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n76\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1670% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Risk Taker 4/Buff] The lower your own HP, attack increases for 20 sec. (Stack 3) /[Risk Taker 4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, The lower your own HP, attack increases for 20 sec. (Stack 9)\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[A Wonderful Encounter] Sanya\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Halo\nAttack\n47\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Halo 3] Defense -30% and during the buff effect for increased max HP the hit rate -30%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[I'll Protect You!] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSharpened Light\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Fake Lady] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHydro Smite\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n59\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1670% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +2500 → 5000 → 7500 to enemies when using break.\n★4[Golden Flower Protection] Alice\nSkill Name\nFlash Blade/ Break Attack\nAttack\n45\nDefense\n54\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Flash Blade 4] Critical rate for normal attack's +35%./[Break Attack 4] Attack +35% to enemies when using break.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Pretty Holmes] Asuna\nSkill Name\nThere's a case! There's only one truth!\nAttack\n49\nDefense\n40\nHP\n1550\nSkill Effect\n[There's a case!] Critical damage +15%./[There's only one truth!] ATK +20% to enemy that has their weakness found.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
