    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3! Get ★4 Skill Records with backgrounds! The \"Brilliant Order\" is here!\nShop\n2025-03-24 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary!\nThe \"\nBrilliant Order\n\" is here, featuring ★4 Skill Records with seasonal backgrounds!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn all Steps, the\ntotal drop rate for ★4 Skill Records is 8.0%\n!\nAdditionally, on Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Battle of Life and Death] Kirito\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nStarburst Stream\nSkill Name\nStarburst Stream\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nSlash\nElement\nSlash\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nFire\n→\nWind\n→Slash\nSkill Cool Time\n20.0\nSkill Cool Time\n40.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n62\nBreak Gauge\n124\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (16x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (16x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping no Heathcliff Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Critical rate +500%./[Bonus] When HP is under 25%, Critical damage +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Pride of the Creator] Heathcliff\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Holy Sword Offensive/Blockade/Forbidden Gate/Remarkable Reaction\nAttack\n41\nDefense\n60\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Holy Sword Offensive] Attack rises 10% x the number of Heathcliff Skill Records in the same set./[Blockade1] All elemental damage decreases by 100% x the number of Asuna Skill Records in the same set (Non-elemental included)./[Forbidden Gate 1] Hit rate decreases by 50% x the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Remarkable Reaction] Evasion rate +16%. *It will not be activated with focus attack.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n* By Transforming \"★4[Pride of the Creator] Heathcliff\" to ★5, not only will you get the usual Memoria Niter L from Achievements, you can also get the \"Heathcliff Armor\" costume Avatar.\n★4[Wrapped In Happiness] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nNight Linear\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Peaceful New Year] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nRumbling Ice\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n94\nBreak Gauge\n47\nSkill Effect\n2790% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWater damage +50% when using water skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise water damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Sweeping Fantasy View] Sinon\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nAqua Impact Burst\nSkill Name\nAqua Impact\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Thrust→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n31\nBreak Gauge\n62\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1550% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Enhance Thrust 1/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to thrust +15% for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4260% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] The lower your own HP, attack increases.(max 200%)/[Bonus] Water element damage increases by number of frostbite stacks x 0.5% when the player is inflicted with the frostbite status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Sweet Summer Memories] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nLight Up Swing\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n29\nSkill Effect\n1520% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Attack +50% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark)./[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using holy skills.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nMarch 24, 2025 (Mon) 17:00 - Before the April 2, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n11 Order for 1,250 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP2\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP3\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nCertain characters do not have voice effects when obtaining their Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
