    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] The \"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" is on now! Exchange Bronze Floor Coins for up to 500 Arcana Gems and more!\nCampaign\n2025-03-19 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary!\nCollect the Bronze Floor Coins dropped by monsters on 13F and onward of the Labyrinth, then exchange what you've collected for tons of items!\nRewards\nThere are a variety of items at the Trader, including Awakening Stars, Medals of Combat Arts, and up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n.\nTrade \"Bronze Floor Coin\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×20\n20\n25\nMedal of Combat Arts\n60\n20\nAwakening Star\n15\n100\nGreat Red Jewel\n30\n20\nGreat Green Jewel\n30\n20\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n30\n20\nGreat Blue Jewel\n30\n20\nRelease Crystal (L)\n100\n2\nRelease Crystal (M)\n40\n4\nBronze Floor Coin Trader\nFor more info, go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the Bronze Floor Coin Trader banner.\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the March 19, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 2, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the March 19, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 9, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nImportant\nIn the 74F Labyrinth, monsters in the Labyrinth Dungeon drop Bronze Floor Coins.\nBronze Floor Coins do not drop from the monsters The Skull Reaper and An Incarnate of the Radius.\n\"Bronze Floor Coins\" will be removed on April 9, 2025 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
