    "news_category": "MAINT.",
    "snippet": "La maintenance que nous avons mise en œuvre à partir du 7 mars 2025 à 14h30 a été achevée le 7 mars 2025 à 15h00 (JST/UTC+9).  - Contenu de maintenance Correction d'un problème où \"Happy Dungeon with Koharu\" et \"Happy Dungeon with Agil\" partageaient une limite d'une partie par jour. Dans le cadre de ce correctif, le statut clair pour le 7 mars a été...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Edited]Notice for maintenance completed(3/7)\nMAINT.\n2025-03-07 15:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nMaintenance we have implemented from March 7, 2025 14:30, was completed on March 7, 2025 15:00(JST/UTC+9).\n- Maintenance Contents\nFixed an issue where \"Happy Dungeon with Koharu\" and \"Happy Dungeon with Agil\" shared a one-play limit per day.\nAs part of this fix, the clear status for March 7 has been reset, allowing you to challenge both dungeons again.\nAdditionally, we have extended the event period for each dungeon.\n・Happy Dungeon with Koharu: Until 3/14/2025 (Fri) at 3:59 AM (JST/UTC+9)\n・Happy Dungeon with Agil: 3/15/2025 (Sat) 3:59 AM (JST/UTC+9)\n- Apology for Issues & Maintenance Compensation Details\n50 Arcana Gems\n- Pick up period\nMarch 12, 2025 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nOnce again, we apologize for any inconvenience and trouble that this issue has caused.\nWe hope that you continue to enjoy Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\n--------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n- Scheduled maintenance dates\nMarch 7, 2025 14:30 to 15:30 (JST/UTC+9)\n* There may be changes with the date.\n- Maintenance Contents\nFixed an issue where \"Happy Dungeon with Koharu\" and \"Happy Dungeon with Agil\" shared a one-play limit per day.\nPlease note that the game can not be played during maintenance.\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\nGo to Notice List"
