    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary] \"Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary! Up to 440 Free Orders\" is here!\nShop\n2025-03-01 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 7 Year Anniversary!\n\"\nWorldwide 7 Year Anniversary! Up to 440 Free Orders\n\" is here! Get up to 440 Skill Records!\nDuring the \"\nWorldwide 7 Year Anniversary! Up to 440 Free Orders\n\", one free 11x Order will be available every day. Players can take advantage of this for up to 40 days!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Transcendent Swordsmanship] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nSquare Water\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n100\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n2550% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWater damage +50% when using water skills.\nAttack +1000 while increased critical damage buffs are in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[The Axe's Shockwave] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nRock Ravage\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n116\nBreak Gauge\n54\nSkill Effect\n2790% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhanced Vitality 4/Buff] Max HP +0.2% per stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nEarth damage +50% when using earth skills.\nAttack +1500 while increased max HP buffs are in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[The Spear's Assault] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nWind Charge\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n92\nBreak Gauge\n47\nSkill Effect\n2660% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Armor Decay 4/Debuff] Enemy's defense -0.5% per stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1500 against debuffed enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Innocent Detour] Alice\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nCrag Bump Burst\nSkill Name\nCrag Bump\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→Slash→\nEarth\n→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nBreak Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n114\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1520% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Earth Element Enhance4/Buff] Earth element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4260% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Earth element damage increases x 0.5% the number of poison stacks when the player is inflicted with the poison status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Wolf Town Mascot] Yuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nDemolishing Aqua\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1660% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Thrust Erosion Mark/Debuff] For thrust element enemies, the next attack the enemy receives will induce 2.5x damage. (Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Aqua Pile/Buff(PT)] Water element damage +1% for yourself and party per stack (Stack 3) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[ASAP Delivery] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nRaged Lightning\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1520% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using holy skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Holy element damage +50% → 100% → 150%.\n- Period\nMarch 1, 2025 (Sat) 4:00 - June 1, 2025 (Sun) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\nDuring this event, players will receive one free 11x Order per day for up to 40 days total.\nThere is no single Order.\nNew days begin at 4:00 am every day (JST/UTC+9).\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
