    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Ordinal Scale: Love and Hate's Reward Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2025-02-18 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Sinon, Yuna, and Eiji from Sword Art Online the Movie -Ordinal Scale- are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nOrdinal Scale: Love and Hate's Reward Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Relentless Advance] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nRock Bite\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n2250% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nEarth damage +50% when using earth skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise earth damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Smooth Cover Fire] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nGale Plasma\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n2190% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nWind damage +50% when using wind skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise wind damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Inspiring Song] Yuna\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nWater Asterisk Burst\nSkill Name\nWater Asterisk\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Blunt→\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n57\nSwitch Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n96\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1610% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Aqua Force 5/Buff (PT)] Water element damage +20% for you and your party for 5 sec./[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4430% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark, Slash Destruction Mark)./[Bonus] Water element damage increases by number of frostbite stacks x 0.5% when the player is inflicted with the frostbite status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Strayer Into Evil] Eiji\nSkill Name\nBlind Faith/Engrave\nAttack\n46\nDefense\n58\nHP\n2875\nSkill Effect\n[Blind Faith] Attack rises 7% x the number of Yuna Skill Records in the same set./[Engrave] When equipping no Kirito Skill Records in the same set and hitting with switch, adds debuff (Mark).(Invalid when equipped by Partner)The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nFebruary 18, 2025 (Tue) 0:00 - Before the March 12, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
