    "snippet": "Le « Grand Ordre » est là, et ★4 records de compétences font partie de cette programmation, y compris les records de compétences d'anniversaire !  À l’étape 1, vous pouvez obtenir 11 commandes pour 1 250 gemmes arcanes ! Sur toutes les étapes, le taux d'obtention total des enregistrements de compétences ★4 est de 8,0 % ! De plus, à l'étape 3, un enregistrement de compétence ★4 est garanti !  【Certains ★4 Sk...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Grand Order\" is here! ★4 birthday Skill Records are part of this lineup!\nShop\n2025-02-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe \"\nGrand Order\n\" is here, and ★4 Skill Records are part of this lineup, including birthday Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn all Steps, the\ntotal drop rate for ★4 Skill Records is 8.0%\n!\nAdditionally, on Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Our Wishes Combined] Asuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nThrust\nElement\nThrust\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→Thrust→Thrust→(\nDark\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n18.0\nSkill Cool Time\n36.0\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nBreak Gauge\n49\nBreak Gauge\n98\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec./[Peak Descent 3/Buff/Debuff] Own critical rate and critical damage rises 2% per stack for 20 sec (Stack 3).Triggers a debuff that raises the damage you take by 0.5% per stack (Stack 9).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 150%./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping 2 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Two Whirlwinds] Silica\nSkill Name\nEnhance HP/Flame Boost/Tailwind/Bisect\nAttack\n44\nDefense\n52\nHP\n2875\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance HP 3] Max HP +10%./[Flame Boost 4] Elemental damage other than fire dealt to enemies -50%, and fire element's damage to enemies +40%./[Tailwind 6] Switch gauge amount +15%, when equipping no Yui Skill Records in the same set.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bisect 4] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n*Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Traces of Thorn] Eugeo\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nResonate Ice Burst\nSkill Name\nResonate Ice\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Slash→\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n87\nSwitch Gauge\n87\nBreak Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n90\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2050% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4840% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Water element damage increases by number of frostbite stacks x 0.5% when the player is inflicted with the frostbite status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nFebruary 15, 2025 (Sat) 17:00 - February 24, 2025 (Mon) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n11 Order for 1,250 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP2\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP3\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
