    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(2/13)\nMAINT.\n2025-02-12 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 2/13, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 2/13, 2025, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 56 begins\n\"Chocolate Meiolania Hunt 2025\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nAdded 3 Chat Stamps.\nList of Added Chat Stamps\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed an issue where the guild icon in the guild room did not display correctly.\nFixed an issue where the switch gauge did not work correctly when attacking under certain conditions.\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n2/13, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 56 begins\n\"Chocolate Meiolania Hunt 2025\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 2/13 Maintenance\n\"96F Start Dash Event\"\nThe 4th \"Squad Jumble\"\n\"Boss Rush VS Nocte\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
