    "snippet": "Le Raising Dungeon est là pour vous aider à stimuler la croissance du personnage !  La « Campagne de création de personnages d'assistance pour Sachi », en cours ! Participez à la \"Campagne Raising Assisting Character\", où vous et vos personnages assistants pouvez gagner plus d'EXP que dans les donjons normaux. De plus, cette campagne donnera encore plus de ré...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n【Raising Dungeon】The \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign for Sachi\" is here! Build up your Assisting Characters with the dungeon and rewards!\nCampaign\n2025-02-07 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Raising Dungeon is here to help boost character growth!\nThe \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign for Sachi\", on now!\nTake on the \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign\", where you and your Assisting Characters can earn more EXP than in normal dungeons.\nPlus, this campaign will give even more rewards from now on!\nRewards\nPlayers can acquire present items and items to recover stamina for the assist function from Score and Challenge Rewards.\nAlso available are limited items including an Sachi Memory Stamp and the \"Special Gift for Sachi\", which is a present item that increases Friendship EXP for \"Sachi\".\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nSachi & Black Cat\nLimited Items\nEffect\nSpecial Gift for Sachi\nA gift for Sachi, to maybe get along better.\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Raising Assisting Character Campaign\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to take on the \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\".\nEvent Period\nFebruary 7, 2025 (Fri) 4:00 - February 14, 2025 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nMemory Stamp 315\nUse to obtain the \"Sachi & Black Cat\" stamp.\n1\n200\nSpecial Gift for Sachi\n5\n300\nRecord Kit M\n50\n400\nSmall Gift\n5\n500\nTasty Bread\n10\n600\nSpecial Gift for Sachi\n5\n700\nFresh Fish\n10\n800\nSmall Gift\n5\n900\nEnergy Fruit\n10\n1,000\nSpecial Gift for Sachi\n5\n1,100\nAsuna''s Handmade Seasoning\n10\n1,200\nSmall Gift\n5\n1,300\nBeautiful Flower\n10\n1,400\nGlittering Blue Butterfly\n10\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nRecord Kit M\n30\nCompleted without any tumble\nRecord Frame L\n30\nCompleted within Target Time (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nGolden Bells\n2\nImportant\nThe Assisting Character \"Sachi\" will be unlocked when you complete the 27F Main Quest.\nThe \"Special Gift for Sachi\" does not expire.\nThis \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" can be cleared once per day.\nThis \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" is updated daily at 4:00 am (JST/UTC+9). After this, the previous day's dungeon cannot be attempted.\nIt is possible to take characters other than \"Sachi\" as Assisting Characters into the \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\".\nThis \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" is a solo and Assist Party-only dungeon.\nNote: Players who challenge this \"Raising Assisting Character Dungeon\" solo will not earn any EXP for their Assisting Characters.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2025-02-06T19:00:00+00:00",
