    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" On Now!\nCampaign\n2025-01-29 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nDuring this campaign, get\n2x\nthe experience in Multiple Rounds Subquests!\nThis is your chance to easily raise your player level!\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the January 29, 2025 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the February 13, 2025 (Thu) maintenance.\nSubquests\nYou can accept requests from people with \"!\" marks. These are subquests.\nImportant\nDoes not include First-time Subquests.\nx2 EXP not included when a monster is defeated.\nIf the campaign ends before you turn in the subquest, you will gain the normal amount of EXP.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
