    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(1/15)\nMAINT.\n2025-01-14 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 1/15, 2025, 13:00, was completed on 1/15, 2025, 18:30(JST/UTC+9).\nWe will be sending out token of apology for the maintenance.\n50 Arcana Gems\nAvailable until:1/22/2025(Wed) at 23:59(JST/UTC+9)\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 55 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Wonder Animal Assault 2025\"\nAdded \"Kingly Snake Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Academic Achievement Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed a design issue with the guild room's winter theme\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n1/15, 2025 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 55 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Wonder Animal Assault 2025\"\nAdded \"Kingly Snake Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 1/15 Maintenance\n\"New Year's Grab Bag 2025 Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
