    "snippet": "[1/7 17:05 (JST/UTC+9) Edit] Nous avons confirmé un problème où certaines compétences présentées dans la bannière de cet ordre n'étaient pas affichées dans la programmation. La vente de cette commande a été temporairement suspendue le 28/12 (samedi) à 00h00 (JST/GMT+9), et la programmation a été corrigée lors de la maintenance du magasin effectuée pendant...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[1/7 17:05 (JST/UTC+9) Edit] The \"End of the Year Grab Bag 2024 Order\" is here! Two ★4 Skill Records guaranteed! 24% ★4 Skill Record Rate!\nShop\n2025-01-07 17:05:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[1/7 17:05 (JST/UTC+9) Edit]\nWe have confirmed an issue where some skills featured in the banner for this Order were not displayed in the lineup.\nThe sale of this Order was temporarily suspended on 12/28 (Sat) at 00:00 (JST/GMT+9), and the lineup was corrected during shop maintenance conducted during 12/28 (Sat) 02:48 - 03:10 (JST/GMT+9). The order has since been re-released.\nWe would like to let you know the compensation details regarding the incorrect display in this Order.\n- Compensation\nWe will be returning the Arcana Gems spent to customers who made purchases from this Order during 12/27 (Fri) 17:00 (JST/GMT+9) - 12/28 (Sat) 00:00 (JST/GMT+9) when the issue was occuring.\n- Date of response\nDuring our 1/8/2025 (Wed) maintenance\nWe sincerely apologize for the delay in providing this information.\nAdditionally, we apologize for the inconvenience caused at this time.\n--------------------\nAvailable up to 10 times per player!\nThe \"End of the Year Grab Bag 2024 Order\" containing a selection of heroes journeying through Aincrad features an incredible\n2 guaranteed ★4 Skill Records\n!\nThe\n24% total drop rate\ndoes not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Battle of Life and Death] Kirito\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nStarburst Stream\nSkill Name\nStarburst Stream\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nSlash\nElement\nSlash\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→\nFire\n→\nWind\n→Slash\nSkill Cool Time\n20.0\nSkill Cool Time\n40.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n62\nBreak Gauge\n124\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2290% damage (16x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Dyna Pile/Buff] Non-elemental damage +0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5510% damage (16x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Non-elemental damage +100%, when equipping no Heathcliff Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Critical rate +500%./[Bonus] When HP is under 25%, Critical damage +100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP35)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Empress of the Abyss] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWater Brush\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n24\nSkill Effect\n1810% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, the damage you receive decreases at 50%.(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using water skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Water element damage +50% → 100% → 150%.\n★4[Apprentice Sorceress] Silica\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Frostbite Blow\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Frostbite Blow 5] Attack against enemies with frostbite increases 30%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Colorful Shot] Argo\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nHoly Hash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n26\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Shining Knight's Pride] Diavel\nSkill Name\nOpposing Heart/Resonance of Ice/Small Engravement\nAttack\n39\nDefense\n70\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Opposing Heart 3] Attack +18% to the enemies that have a buff effect/[Resonance of Ice 4] Water element damage +30% to the enemies that have a buff effect./[Small Engravement] When equipping 3 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set and hitting with switch, adds debuff (Small Mark).(Invalid when equipped by Partner)The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Pride of the Creator] Heathcliff\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Holy Sword Offensive/Blockade/Forbidden Gate/Remarkable Reaction\nAttack\n41\nDefense\n60\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Holy Sword Offensive] Attack rises 10% x the number of Heathcliff Skill Records in the same set./[Blockade1] All elemental damage decreases by 100% x the number of Asuna Skill Records in the same set (Non-elemental included)./[Forbidden Gate 1] Hit rate decreases by 50% x the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Remarkable Reaction] Evasion rate +16%. *It will not be activated with focus attack.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n* By Transforming \"★4[Pride of the Creator] Heathcliff\" to ★5, not only will you get the usual Memoria Niter L from Achievements, you can also get the \"Heathcliff Armor\" costume Avatar.\n- Duration\nDecember 27, 2024 (Fri) 17:00 - Before the January 8, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 5,000 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nThis can only be purchased 10 times per account.\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
