    "snippet": "[1/2 0:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] Les récompenses de classement ont été distribuées. Veuillez les récupérer dans la boîte actuelle.  Pour plus de détails sur les récompenses, voir « Récompenses de classement » ci-dessous.  ----------------------------- L'événement de classement de pêche « Concours de pêche du Nouvel An 2024 » est en cours. Dans le \"Nouveau 2024...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[1/2 0:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] The Fishing Ranking Event \"2024 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition\" is on now! More fish can be caught at any time on 22F!\nEVENT\n2025-01-02 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[1/2 0:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nRanking Rewards have been distributed. Please collect them from the present box.\nFor more details about the rewards, see \"Ranking Rewards\" below.\n-----------------------------\nFishing Ranking Event \"2024 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition\" is on now.\nIn the \"2024 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition\", you fight for the best rank based on your catch scores.\nExpect\nhigh scores\nby fishing Party Bream exclusive to the Sunrise Ship Event Map!\nParty Bream\nWhat's more, you can now catch user-selected fish that appeared in past events at any time on 22F!\nThese can now be traded for items at the Fishing Trader.\nEight kinds of fish have been added!\n* We plan to continue adding more in the future.\nEvent Period\nSunrise Ship Event Map Period: Starts after the December 25, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 8, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nRanking Period: Starts after the December 25, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the December 31, 2024 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nTo check your current ranking or score, go to Menu > Community > Ranking > 2024 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition ranking banner.\nRewards\nPlace at the top of the rankings to get\nlimited-edition Fishing Competition records, rare fishing bait\n, and\nMemoria Niter L\n, a Skill Record Limit Break material, as a present!\nExchange for up to 1,000\nArcana Gems\n, up to 15\nMedals of Combat Arts\n, as well as other items such as\nCore Metals\nand Release Crystals at the 2024 New Year's Eve Fish Trader.\nEach fish likes different bait.\nTry different things and challenge the event.\n2024 New Year's Eve Fish Trader Period\nStarts after the December 25, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 22, 2025 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nRecord\nYou will also be able to receive a record via achievement rewards by finishing in the top ranking.\nRecord Acquisition\nAchievement Rewards\nNYE Fishing King 2024\nRevive Crystal×1\nNYE Fishing Elite 2024\nRevive Crystal×1\nNYE Fishing Mania 2024\nRevive Crystal×1\n* The item with your Record will be deleted on January 22, 2025 (Wed) at 13:59(JST/UTC+9).\nEvent Locations\nScores from fish caught on the \"Sunrise Ship\" Event Map (Beginner, Intermediate, and Advanced) as well as the day and night \"Serene Shore\" and \"Peaceful Forest Path\" on the 22F will be displayed in the rankings.\nHead to the \"Sunrise Ship\" Event Map by talking to the \"Boarding Guide\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\".\nGo to the \"Serene Shore\" or \"Peaceful Forest Path\" on the 22F by talking to \"Nishida\" in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\".\nTalk to the \"Night Map Guide\" NPC on the \"Serene Shore\" to go to the night map.\nEvent Map & 22F\nRecommended Fishing Lv\nSunrise Ship(Beginner)\n1～10\nSunrise Ship(Intermediate)\n11～20\nSunrise Ship(Advanced)\n21～\nSerene Shore\n1～10\nPeaceful Forest Path\n11～15\nSerene Shore (Night)\n16～20\nPeaceful Forest Path (Night)\n21～\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nRanking Reward\nRanking\nRewards\nAmount\n#1\nRecord:NYE Fishing King 2024\n1\nRecord:NYE Fishing Elite 2024\n1\nRecord:NYE Fishing Mania 2024\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n30\nRelease Crystal (L)\n20\n#2～#20\nRecord:NYE Fishing Elite 2024\n1\nRecord:NYE Fishing Mania 2024\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n30\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n30\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n30\nMemoria Niter L\n5\nRelease Crystal (L)\n3\n#21～#100\nRecord:NYE Fishing Mania 2024\n1\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n20\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n20\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n20\nMemoria Niter L\n1\nRelease Crystal (L)\n1\n#101～#300\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n15\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n15\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n15\nMemoria Niter M\n3\n#301～#500\nHigh Rare Aqua Worm\n5\nHigh Rare Corogia Cricket\n5\nHigh Rare Force Mackerel\n5\nMemoria Niter M\n1\n#501～#10000\nMemoria Niter S\n1\nRanking rewards will be distributed from January 2, 2025 (Thu) 0:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nReward Acceptance Period: Until January 22, 2025 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
