    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Twinkle Star Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-12-20 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Yuuki, Silica, and Sachi draped in cute dresses are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nTwinkle Star Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Charming Dress] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nPhoton Viper\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n84\nBreak Gauge\n28\nSkill Effect\n1870% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n・While Accele Skill is activated/[Bonus] Raises 3 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect 30 sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Happy Dress] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nEnhance Sleep Res./Small Engravement\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n44\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Sleep Res. 4] Sleep resistance +60%./[Small Engravement] When equipping 3 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set and hitting with switch, adds debuff (Small Mark).(Invalid when equipped by Partner)The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nExtra effect time 7.5 sec.\nFor each 1 equipped in the same set, switch damage during the chain state increases, and the effect time is extended.\n・Effect during Chain\nDamage done to enemies weak to thrusting +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Pretty Dress] Silica\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nLightning Cutter Burst\nSkill Name\nLightning Cutter\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→Slash→\nHoly\n→\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n37\nBreak Gauge\n74\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2010% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bleed/Status Ailments] Make it Bleed (Stack 3) for 30 sec./[Holy Element Enhance4/Buff] Holy element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4740% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Attack +150% against enemy with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite).\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Cute Dress] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nShadow Sweep\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n92\nBreak Gauge\n17\nSkill Effect\n2360% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nChain Skill\nActivates a chain state that turns all Chain Skills and sword skills with Limit Break +10 into Switch for a certain duration when a Super Chain is activated.\n・Super Chain effect (activates 1x)\nDark damage +50% when using dark skills.\nAttack +1000 while the buff to raise Dark element damage is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n\"[Pretty Dress] Silica\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nDecember 20, 2024 (Fri) 17:00 - January 21, 2025 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
