    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice Regarding Inquiries Received During the Winter Holidays\nIMPORTANT\n2024-12-20 10:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThank you for using the services and products of Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.\nThis is an announcement regarding inquiries received during the Winter Holidays from 2024 December 28 (Sat.) to 2025 January 5 (Sun.).\n■During this period, we expect a high volume of inquiries, so our response might take a bit longer than usual.\n■Inquiries requiring confirmation from management or the development team will be addressed after 2025 January 6 (Mon.) in the order they were received.\nWe sincerely apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and greatly appreciate your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
