    "snippet": "Campagne des Fêtes ! Récupérez les pièces de bronze abandonnées par les monstres au 13F et au-delà du Labyrinthe, puis échangez ce que vous avez collecté contre des tonnes d'objets !  Récompenses Il existe une variété d'objets chez le commerçant, notamment des étoiles d'éveil, des médailles des arts de combat et jusqu'à 500 « gemmes arcaniques ».  Commerce \"...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] The \"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" is on now! Exchange Bronze Floor Coins for up to 500 Arcana Gems and more!\nCampaign\n2024-12-18 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nCollect the Bronze Floor Coins dropped by monsters on 13F and onward of the Labyrinth, then exchange what you've collected for tons of items!\nRewards\nThere are a variety of items at the Trader, including Awakening Stars, Medals of Combat Arts, and up to 500\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n.\nTrade \"Bronze Floor Coin\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×20\n20\n25\nMedal of Combat Arts\n60\n20\nAwakening Star\n15\n100\nGreat Red Jewel\n30\n20\nGreat Green Jewel\n30\n20\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n30\n20\nGreat Blue Jewel\n30\n20\nRelease Crystal (L)\n100\n2\nRelease Crystal (M)\n40\n4\nBronze Floor Coin Trader\nFor more info, go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the Bronze Floor Coin Trader banner.\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the December 18, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 8, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader Period\nStarts after the December 18, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 15, 2025 (Wed) maintenance.\nImportant\nIn the 74F Labyrinth, monsters in the Labyrinth Dungeon drop Bronze Floor Coins.\nBronze Floor Coins do not drop from the monsters The Skull Reaper and An Incarnate of the Radius.\n\"Bronze Floor Coins\" will be removed on January 15, 2025 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2024-12-17T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2025-01-07T19:00:00+00:00"
