    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] ★4 Burst Guaranteed Free 11x Order is here!\nShop\n2024-11-29 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nSix days straight of free 11x Orders! One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nDifferent free Orders will be available daily: Burst, Awakening, MOD, Connect, Accele, and Full Burst!\nEvent period for various Orders\nOrder\nPeriod\n★4 Burst Guaranteed Free 11x Order\nAfter the November 29, 2024 (Fri) maintenance - November 30, 2024 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Awakening Guaranteed Free 11x Order\nNovember 30, 2024 (Sat) 4:00 - December 1, 2024 (Sun) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 MOD Guaranteed Free 11x Order\nDecember 1, 2024 (Sun) 4:00 - December 2, 2024 (Mon) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Connect Guaranteed Free 11x Order\nDecember 2, 2024 (Mon) 4:00 - December 3, 2024 (Tue) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Accele Guaranteed Free 11x Order\nDecember 3, 2024 (Tue) 4:00 - December 4, 2024 (Wed) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n★4 Full Burst Guaranteed Free 11x Order\nDecember 4, 2024 (Wed) 4:00 - December 5, 2024 (Thu) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n* Players can take advantage of these offers once per period.\nIntroducing the\n★4 Burst Guaranteed Free 11x Order\n!\n- Period\nAfter the November 29, 2024 (Fri) maintenance - November 30, 2024 (Sat) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Right-Hand Man in Black] Koharu\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nRapid Pebble Burst\nSkill Name\nRapid Pebbles\nSP Cost\n24\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nActivation Requirements\nEarth\n→\nEarth\n→Slash→\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n24\nSwitch Gauge\n24\nBreak Gauge\n22\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1090% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Poison/Status Ailments] It will Poison (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n3050% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 24 sec./[Poison/Status Ailments] Make it Poison (Stack 5) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Limitless Data] Argo\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nFlame Smite Burst\nSkill Name\nFlame Smite\nSP Cost\n26\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→Blunt→Blunt→\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n10.0\nSkill Cool Time\n20.0\nSwitch Gauge\n59\nSwitch Gauge\n59\nBreak Gauge\n37\nBreak Gauge\n74\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1000% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Tough 4/Buff] Flinch resistance +80% for 15 sec./[Analyze 4/Debuff] Chance to raise critical damage against enemies by 20% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n2400% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Critical rate +50%./[Analyze 4/Debuff] Critical damage +20% to enemies for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Ruler of the Blue Seas] Eugeo\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHydro Tempest Burst\nSkill Name\nHydro Tempest\nSP Cost\n26\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→Slash→Slash→\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n28.0\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nBreak Gauge\n22\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1050% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] Inflict Frostbite (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n2520% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 30 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] Inflict Frostbite (Stack 5) for 30 sec./[Bonus] Critical rate +50% while defense+ buff is effective.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Precious New Gear] Sachi\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nExtreme Mist Burst\nSkill Name\nExtreme Mist\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nThrust→\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Thrust\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n60\nSwitch Gauge\n60\nBreak Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n76\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1390% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Toukou 5/Buff] -50% damage taken for 4 sec.(Invalid when equipped by Partner)/▲[Bonus] Increase status ailment stacks by 3 on enemies when hitting bleeding enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n3890% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Bonus] Increases attack against bleeding enemies. +20 for every Stack 1./[Bonus] Increase status ailment stacks by 20 on enemies when hitting bleeding enemies.\n* Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP22)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
