    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(11/6)\nMAINT.\n2024-11-05 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 11/6, 2024, 12:00, was completed on 11/6, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 53 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Fatal Scythe Hunt\"\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nChanged the skill name \"Mother's Rosary Burst\" to \"Mother's Rosary\"\n* Affected Skill Records\n[Lightning Sword Flash] Yuuki\n[Our Wishes Combined] Asuna\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\n▼Added rewards and high difficulty\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n11/6, 2024 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 53 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Fatal Scythe Hunt\"\n\"Boss Ingot Increased Drop Rate Campaign\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 11/6 Maintenance\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
