    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Fashion Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2024-09-21 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne ★4 Skill Record of a character dressed in a variety of clothes, from hoodies to dresses to pajamas, is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nThe \"\nFashion Selection Order\n\" is here!\n- Duration\nSeptember 21, 2024 (Sat) 0:00 - September 30, 2024 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[On a Street at Night...] Kirito\nSkill Name\nVital Assention/Icy Blade\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Vital Assention 3] Defense +400./[Icy Blade 4] Deals +20% Water element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Cyber Scope] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nPebble Shoot\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n27\nBreak Gauge\n27\nSkill Effect\n1740% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using earth skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Earth element damage +50% → 100% → 150%.\n★4[Sunlight on the Beach] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nCross Splash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1330% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Lollipop Wolf] Leafa\nSkill Name\nIron-Fisted Punishment/Prosper/Mallet Blow\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Iron-Fisted Punishment 4] Attack +500 when attacking with blunt element./[Prosper 4] Attack +20% when HP is above 50%./[Mallet Blow 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +30% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Carefree Wolf Boy] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nGreedy Blaze\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n62\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n1760% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 4 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1500.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Refreshing Grape Soda] Koharu\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Aqua Boost/Stagehand\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Aqua Boost 4] Elemental damage other than water dealt to enemies -50%, and water element's damage to enemies +40%./[Stagehand 4] When equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Night Routine] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWind Thrust\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n37\nBreak Gauge\n23\nSkill Effect\n760% damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] Attack +800 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Fancy Bear] Yuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nWild Disruption\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n26\nSkill Effect\n1000% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bear Lover/Buff] Adds a buff that makes enemies like bears (no particular effect) for 30 sec./▲[Bonus] Critical rate +25% against enemies who like bears./[Bonus] Recover 5% of max HP when defeating monsters with this skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
