    "full_details": "Notices\nGet the Pure White Dress and a limited-edition stamp! \"Explore the Dungeon with Yui\" is here!\nEVENT\n2024-08-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n\"Explore the dungeon with Yui\" is here to celebrate Yui's birthday.\nYou can enjoy progressing through a dungeon with Yui in tow during this event. The dungeon found in this event is a Raising Dungeon that helps you and your Assisting Characters grow stronger.\nRewards\nGet the Pure White Dress avatar designed to look like Yui's outfit, as well as limited-edition Chat Stamp!\nPlayers can also acquire present items and items to recover stamina for the assist function from Score and Challenge Rewards.\nAvatar\nItem Name\nAvatar Images\nPure White Dress\nChat Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nItems for Acquisition\nLittle Witch\nMemory Stamp 291\nHow to Participate\nTalk to Yui in the Teleport Gate Plaza to take on \"Explore the dungeon with Yui.\"\nEvent Period\nAugust 1, 2023 (Thu) 0:00 - Before the August 15, 2023 (Thu) maintenance\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nScore Rewards\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n100\nMemory Stamp 291\n1\n200\nSpecial Gift for Kirito\n2\n300\nSpecial Gift for Asuna\n2\n400\nSmall Gift\n2\n500\nPure White Dress\n1\n600\nSpecial Gift for Kirito\n2\n700\nSpecial Gift for Asuna\n2\n800\nSmall Gift\n2\n900\nEnergy Fruit\n5\n1000\nSpecial Gift for Kirito\n2\n1100\nSpecial Gift for Asuna\n2\n1200\nSmall Gift\n2\n1300\nEnergy Fruit\n5\n1400\nBeautiful Flower\n10\n1500\nSmall Gift\n10\n1600\nAsuna''s Handmade Seasoning\n10\n1800\nGolden Bells\n10\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nDefeat all enemies\nRecord Kit M\n30\nCompleted without any tumble\nRecord Frame L\n30\nCompleted within Target Time (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nGolden Bells\n2\nImportant\nThis \"Explore the dungeon with Yui\" can be cleared once per day.\nThis \"Explore the dungeon with Yui\" is updated daily at 4:00 am (JST/UTC+9). After this, the previous day's dungeon cannot be attempted.\nThis \"Explore the dungeon with Yui\" is a solo and Assist Party-only dungeon.\nNote: Players who challenge this \"Explore the dungeon with Yui\" solo will not earn any EXP for their Assisting Characters.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
