    "snippet": "Dans \"Boss Rush VS Storm Griffin\", battez les monstres boss qui apparaissent les uns après les autres et obtenez de nombreux objets grâce aux récompenses et aux drops pour augmenter votre maîtrise des armes et acquérir des compétences de maîtrise !  Récompenses Obtenez jusqu'à 1000 \"Gemmes Arcanes\", jusqu'à 100 \"Étoiles d'Éveil\", jusqu'à 20 \"Médailles d'Art de Combat...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Boss Rush VS Storm Griffin\" Great Proficiency Items Event is here!\nEVENT\n2024-07-17 18:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nIn \"Boss Rush VS Storm Griffin\", defeat the boss monsters that appear one after another and get a lot of items from rewards and drops to increase your weapon proficiency and acquire proficiency skills!\nRewards\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 200\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\nIn addition to Boss Rush Plates, there's a chance that monsters will drop Martial Arts Texts and Release Crystals (S).\nGet rare items and lots of EXP by using Boost Mode to increase the Drop Rate and EXP obtained!\nSee here for more details on \"Boost Mode\".\nTrader Rewards\nGet your hands on \"Red Boss Rush Plates\" in the event and use them at the Trader to get \"Medals of Combat Arts\", as well as \"Release Crystals\" that you can use to learn proficiency skills!\nYou can also get lots of \"Release Crystals\" from Total Score Rewards.\n\"Blue Boss Rush Plates\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the July 24, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on July 31, 2024 (Wed).\nTrade \"Red Boss Rush Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n30\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n30\nRelease Crystal (L)\n100\n10\nRelease Crystal (M)\n50\n40\nMartial Arts Text\n30\n30\nTrade \"Blue Boss Rush Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n30\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nRelease Crystal (L)\n100\n5\nRelease Crystal (M)\n50\n30\nMartial Arts Text\n30\n25\nTrader Period\nRed Boss Rush Plate: Starts after the July 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 15, 2024 (Thu) maintenance.\nBlue Boss Rush Plate: Starts after the July 24, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 15, 2024 (Thu) maintenance.\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in  count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nClear bonus\nNormal\nAdvanced\nPremium\nBasic Clear Bonus\n199P\n1000P\n3540P\nSurvival Bonus\n1 person 1P\n1 person 10P\n1 person 10P\n\"\nPremium\n\"\nYou can get a high score in this bonus dungeon.\nIt can be cleared up to once per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nNote that the Quick Party participation requirement will be a Total Power of 40,000 or higher.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×700\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×35\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\nMartial Arts Text×135\nRelease Crystal (S)×200\nRelease Crystal (M)×85\nRelease Crystal (L)×20\nMemoria Niter S×70\nSpecial Bonus\nA Special Bonus will be in effect for the dungeon in this event.\nIf you clear the dungeon with compatible Skill Records equipped, you'll receive a large additional score bonus!\nList of Special Bonus Compatible Skill Records\nSkill Name\nEquipment Type\nSpecial Bonus\nNormal\nAdvanced\nPremium\nMin\nMax\nMin\nMax\nMin\nMax\n★4[New Era] Kirito\nAbility\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n★4[Together in This World] Asuna\n1H Rapier\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n★4[The Premier Knight] Alice\n1H Sword\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n★4[The Frozen Integrity Knight] Eugeo\nAbility\n30\n60\n150\n300\n540\n1080\n★4[Aiming for Your Heart] Asuna\n1H Rapier\n18\n36\n90\n180\n324\n648\n★4[Warrior of the Wok] Kirito\nAbility\n18\n36\n90\n180\n324\n648\n★3[Brave Fight] Kirito\nAbility\n6\n12\n30\n60\n108\n216\n★3[Golden Knight] Alice\nAbility\n6\n12\n30\n60\n108\n216\n★3[Icy Swordsman] Eugeo\nAbility\n6\n12\n30\n60\n108\n216\n★3[Mysterious Girl] Stilla\nAbility\n6\n12\n30\n60\n108\n216\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nThe Dance of Birds\nLet's collect a total of 1000 Red Boss Rush Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nStorm-Stirring Wings\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Red Boss Rush Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Boss Rush Event\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the July 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 7, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Maniac will be implemented after the July 24, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nVenom Cockatrice\nDetails\nOn Maniac difficulty, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nWind Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Maniac\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nFire Element\nResistance\n* Only \"Maniac\"difficulty\nThrust Element\nBlunt Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Bloodshed\" and \"Petrify\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\nValt the Violent Violet\nDetails\nSkill Breaks can be performed with skills that are both Thrust Element and Wind Element.\nFor the Maniac difficulty, Skill Breaks can be performed with skills that are both Slash Element and Fire Element.\nOn Maniac difficulty, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nWind Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Maniac\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nFire Element\nResistance\n* Only \"Maniac\"difficulty\nThrust Element\nBlunt Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Bloodshed\", \"Petrify\" and \"Curse\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\nThe Storm Griffin\nDetails\nOn Maniac difficulty, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nWind Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Maniac\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nFire Element\nResistance\n* Only \"Maniac\"difficulty\nThrust Element\nBlunt Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Bloodshed\", \"Petrify\" and \"Curse\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\"\n* Skill Break: By completely lowering the Skill Break Gauge, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all of its buff effects will be removed.\n* Status ailment \"Petrify\": Lose the ability to use actions or items, and take double the damage.\nThis will be removed after a certain amount of time or by taking damage.\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nAfter you clear the \"Premium\" dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nPlates will be deleted on August 15, 2024 (Thu) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
