    "snippet": "La \"Avatar Party (Summer)\" avec des avatars d'été et des avatars d'armes est arrivée !  Un avatar d'arme parfait pour l'été est garanti pour 11 commandes ! L'avatar d'arme est disponible avec et sans effets pour chaque arme !  [Images d'avatar Yukata] [Images d'avatar du festival] ...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nLive it up this summer with yukata and swimsuit avatars! Avatar Party (Summer) is here! One Weapon Avatar that's perfect for summer is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2024-07-03 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe \"\nAvatar Party (Summer)\n\" with summer Avatars and Weapon Avatars is here!\nOne Weapon Avatar that's perfect for summer is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nThe Weapon Avatar is available with and without effects for each weapon!\n[Yukata Avatar Images]\n[Festival Avatar Images]\n[Weapon Avatar Images]\n[Other Avatars in the Lineup]\nSwimsuit Avatar\nBright Marine Avatar\nAvatar Images\n- Duration\nStarts after the July 3, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 4, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Offers\n1 Order for 150 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 1,500 Arcana Gems\n- Avatar Shop\nSwimsuit Avatars and Bright Marine Avatars will also be available from the in-game Avatar Shop during the sales period.\nYou can obtain Avatar Coins by selling your avatars at the Avatar Shop.\n* Available via Item > Enhance/Trade > Avatar Shop (Sell) in the Menu.\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nWeapon avatars will only display when they match with the weapon type you have equipped.\nKoharu can also equip female avatars and accessories.\nSome of the avatars available in this Order have equip conditions that depend on the equipped character's gender.\nAll avatars, both female and male, are available in the Order regardless of your own character's gender.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
