    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(7/3)\nMAINT.\n2024-07-02 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 7/3, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 7/3, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"GGO Anime Rebroadcast Celebration Selfish Ossa Hunt\" begins\nAdded [Holiday Campaign] \"Successive Strike: Roaring Rocks\" Event rewards\n\"[Returning] Watermelon Panic!\" is back\n\"[Returning] Bit scary?! Cave Exploration\" is back\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n\"Avatar Party (Summer)\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nThe Guild Room will be re-themed for a limited time for summer\n▼Fixed Issues\nFixed the issue with the \"Recoil Releaser\" icon\nFixed the issue where the stamp image for \"Memory Stamp 251\" (Eydis) was not being displayed\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n7/3, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"GGO Anime Rebroadcast Celebration Selfish Ossa Hunt\" begins\nAdded [Holiday Campaign] \"Successive Strike: Roaring Rocks\" Event rewards\n\"[Returning] Watermelon Panic!\" is back\n\"[Returning] Bit scary?! Cave Exploration\" is back\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 7/3 Maintenance\n\"Temperature of the Heart Order\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Multiple Rounds: 3x Experience Subquest Campaign\"\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Ring Production Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
