    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Full Burst Step-Up Order\" is here! One ★4 Full Burst Skill is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-06-26 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"Full Burst Skills\"!\nThe \"\nFull Burst Step-Up Order\n\" is here!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nAdditionally, on Step 3, one\n★4 Full Burst Skill is guaranteed!\nMore Full Burst Skill Details Here\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Winner's Privilege] Alice\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nAtmos Bump Burst\nSkill Name\nAtmos Bump\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→Slash→\nWind\n→(\nEarth\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nSwitch Gauge\n56\nBreak Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n114\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1520% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4260% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Wind element damage increases x 0.5% the number of bleed stacks when the player is inflicted with the bleed status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Raging North Wind] Asuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nIce Burdock Burst\nSkill Name\nIce Burdock\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Thrust→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n35\nBreak Gauge\n70\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1920% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4480% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Critical rate +1000%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Apprentice Sorceress] Silica\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Frostbite Blow\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Frostbite Blow 5] Attack against enemies with frostbite increases 30%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n- Duration\nAfter the June 26, 2024 (Wed) maintenance - July 5, 2024 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Full Burst Skill!\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Full Burst Skill!\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Full Burst Skill!\nOne ★4 Full Burst Skill guaranteed!!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
