    "news_date": 1718784000,
    "news_category": "Campaign",
    "snippet": "Avis destiné aux utilisateurs se connectant à \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\". La « Campagne Arcana Gem Super Boost » commence ! Ne laissez pas passer cette chance d'obtenir des tonnes de gemmes arcanes supplémentaires !   -Durée de la campagne Après la maintenance du 19 juin 2024 (mercredi) - 20 juin 2024 (jeu) 23h59 (JST/UTC+9) -Contenu de la campagne Pr...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" is here! Get up to 2,000 extra Arcana Gems!\nCampaign\n2024-06-19 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\n\"\nArcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\n\" begins!\nDon't pass up this chance to get tons of extra Arcana Gems!\n-Campaign Duration\nAfter the June 19, 2024 (Wed) maintenance - June 20, 2024 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n-Campaign Contents\nProduct Name\nArcana Gems\nArcana Gem A\nTotal: 60\nArcana Gem B\nTotal: 300\nArcana Gem C\nTotal: 680\nArcana Gem D\nTotal: 1,500\n(1,280\n+220 extra Gems\n)\nArcana Gem E\nTotal: 2,700\nArcana Gem F\nTotal: 5,000\n（4,200\n+800 extra Gems\n）\nArcana Gem G\nTotal: 10,800\n（8,800\n+2,000 extra Gems\n）\n-Important\nExtra Arcana Gems are only available once per bundle.\nGo to Notice List"
