    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Argo's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Argo!\nShop\n2024-06-05 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Argo's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Step Into the Unknown] Argo\n\" and \"\n[Bewitching Blade] Argo\n(Full Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nArgo's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Argo guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Argo\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Step Into the Unknown] Argo\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Veteran Sword Technique/Dark Invitation\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Spirit Unity 3] + 5 increase to Awakening rate./[Veteran Sword Technique 4] Attack power increase with own level×0.17%. (max 34%)/[Dark Invitation 4] Deals +20% Dark element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Bewitching Blade] Argo\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nShadow Hash Burst\nSkill Name\nShadow Hash\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→Slash→\nDark\n→(\nDark\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n52\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1470% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4090% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemy with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite).\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n- Duration\nJune 5, 2024 (Wed) 0:00 - June 14, 2024 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Argo\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Argo\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
