    "snippet": "La maintenance que nous avons mise en œuvre à partir du 31 mai 2024 à 15h00 a été achevée le 31 mai 2024 à 16h15 (JST/UTC+9).  - Contenu de maintenance Ajustement de l'équipement du serveur.   - Excuses pour les problèmes et détails de la compensation de maintenance 300 Arcana Gems - Période de ramassage 5 juin 2024 23h59 (JST/UTC+9) Une fois de plus, nous nous excusons...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[Edited]Notice for maintenance completed(5/31)\nMAINT.\n2024-05-31 16:15:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nMaintenance we have implemented from May 31, 2024 15:00, was completed on May 31, 2024 16:15(JST/UTC+9).\n- Maintenance Contents\nAdjusting server equipment.\n- Apology for Issues & Maintenance Compensation Details\n300 Arcana Gems\n- Pick up period\nJune 5, 2024 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nOnce again, we apologize for any inconvenience and trouble that this issue has caused.\nWe hope that you continue to enjoy Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\n--------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n- Scheduled maintenance dates\nMay 31, 2024 15:00 to 17:00 (JST/UTC+9)\n* There may be changes with the date.\n- Maintenance Contents\nAdjusting server equipment.\nPlease note that the game can not be played during maintenance.\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\nGo to Notice List"
