    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Silent Prayer Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-05-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Agil, Sachi, and Yuuki pray for peace in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nSilent Prayer Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sacred Blessing] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nHydro Gap\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n27\nBreak Gauge\n21\nSkill Effect\n1530% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Unfaltering Guidance] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nLight Smash\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1580% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Celebration4/Buff] Your HP recovers for 30 sec.(1.5%/3sec)Effect will be removed with damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMerchant's Support\n[When Rush Activates]Extends the effect of Rush by 5 sec.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Messenger of Prayer] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nHoly Shaft\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n27\nBreak Gauge\n27\nSkill Effect\n1860% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Armor Decay 4/Debuff] Enemy's defense -0.5% per stack (Stack 5) for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRecovers 4% → 8% → 12% of your own max HP when hitting with skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of  Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, increase in break gauge to enemy by +20% → 40% → 60%\n★4[Sister of Unpredictability] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nRaging Stallion/Hold the Front/Tailwind\nAttack\n64\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2275\nSkill Effect\n[Raging Stallion 4] Damage +25% on enemies with defense debuff./[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%./[Tailwind 1] Switch gauge amount +15%, when equipping no Yui Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the May 15, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 12, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
