    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(5/9)\nMAINT.\n2024-05-08 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance we have implemented from 5/9, 2024, 13:00, was completed on 5/9, 2024, 17:00(JST/UTC+9).\nThe following are new updates.\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 47 begins\n\"Heavy Samurai Lord Hunt\" begins\nAdded [SAO Games 10th Anniversary] \"Underworld Boss Rush\" Event rewards\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n\"Spirithrope Order\" begins\n\"Arcana Gem Super Boost Campaign\" begins\n▼Added Features & Feature Adjustments\nUnifying the weaknesses of monsters on each floor up to 27F\n* Some special monsters are excluded.\nFollowing adjustment, weaknesses will be as follows.\nFloor\nweapon elemental weaknesses\nnatural elemental weakness\n1F\nSlash\nFire\n2F\nSlash\nWater\n3F\nThrust\nFire / Wind\n4F\nThrust\nEarth\n5F\nSlash\nHoly\n6F\nBlunt\nWater\n7F\nBlunt\nHoly / Dark\n8F\nBlunt\nHoly\n9F\nThrust\nHoly / Dark\n10F\nThrust\nHoly / Dark\n11F\nThrust\nEarth\n12F\nBlunt\nHoly / Dark\n13F\nBlunt\nWater\n14F\nThrust\nHoly / Dark\n20F\nSlash\nFire\n25F\nThrust\nFire\n27F\nBlunt\nWind\n* Other minor improvements, adjustments, and issues are being handled.\n▼New Events\nThank you for your cooperation.\n-----------------------------\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n5/9, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 47 begins\n\"Heavy Samurai Lord Hunt\" begins\nAdded [SAO Games 10th Anniversary] \"Underworld Boss Rush\" Event rewards\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\nNew Order begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 5/9 Maintenance\n\"Shadow Master Order\"\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] \"Fatal Battle: Three Goddesses\"\n\"2024 Early Summer Fishing Competition\"\n\"Fluffy Bunny Panic!\"\n\"All Together! IF Kindergarten\"\n\"Heroine Destruction Rhapsody\"\n\"Jumping Kibaou\"\n\"Ring Production Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
