    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Boys' Festival Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2024-05-05 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne ★4 Skill Record of a male character is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nThe \"\nBoys' Festival Selection Order\n\" is here!\n- Duration\nMay 5, 2024 (Sun) 0:00 - May 14, 2024 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Confronting the Subspace] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nBurning Square\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Blaze 4/Buff] Attack +20 per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Blaze 4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Attack +20 per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Warming Sweetness] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nPenetrating Hurricane\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n68\nBreak Gauge\n19\nSkill Effect\n1800% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Skull Crush] Agil\nSkill Name\nShadow Indemnity/Encircle Break\nAttack\n37\nDefense\n60\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Shadow Indemnity 3] When you are cursed, dark element damage +40%./[Encircle Break 3] Increase in break gauge to enemy by +27.5%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Leader of Furinkazan] Klein\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nBlaze Swing\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n22.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n29\nSkill Effect\n940% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Swift Wind/Buff] Evasion rate +11% for 10 sec. (This will not activate with focus attack)/[Gentle Forest/Buff] Slowly recovering your own HP and the Party's HP for 30 sec.(1.5%/3 sec) (Does not activate when using switch)/▲[Fierce Fire(Bonus)] Deal 5000 additional damage while the buff that gradually recovers HP depending on the Skill Record is in effect./[Unshakable Mountain/Buff] Flinch resistance +100% for 10 sec when using switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Unsinkable Barrier] Heathcliff\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Flame Conversion/Firm Measures\nAttack\n42\nDefense\n76\nHP\n2125\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Flame Conversion 4]Water element's damage to enemies -10% and fire element's damage to enemies +25%./[Firm Measures 1] Adds an effect when no other Kirito Skill Records are equipped in the same set.・Max HP +10%.・Attack +20%.・Skill's power is added +200% when used in switch.・Critical rate +10%.・Critical damage +10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nProtection of the Holy Sword\n[When Rush Activates] Recover all status ailments.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Strong Will] Diavel\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nAqua Thrust\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n84\nBreak Gauge\n22\nSkill Effect\n1750% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 3/Buff] Defense +12% for 15 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Brilliant Combat] Eiji\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nWind Slash\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n17\nSkill Effect\n1080% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Element Weak 4/Debuff] Wind element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec./▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Yuna's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000./[Bonus] Deal 1000 x the number of Yuna Skill Records in the same set in additional damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
