    "news_date": 1713340800,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "L'événement scénario \"Jumping Kibaou\" est de retour !  Qu’est-ce que « Sauter Kibaou » ? Il y a une rumeur qui circule à propos d'un truc à la porte de téléportation. Mais que se passera-t-il lorsque vous apprendrez à l’activer ?  Récompenses Échangez les « plaques d'avril » que vous avez obtenues lors de l'événement chez le commerçant contre la récompense de compétence Kibaou...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nScenario Event \"Jumping Kibaou\" is back! Get your hands on a Kibaou Skill Record and Stamps!\nEVENT\n2024-04-17 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"Jumping Kibaou\" is back!\nWhat is \"Jumping Kibaou\"?\nThere's a rumor going around about some trick at the Teleport Gate.\nBut what will happen when you learn how to activate it?\nRewards\nExchange the \"April Plates\" you obtain from the event at the Trader to get the\nKibaou Skill Record and Memory Stamps\n!\nGet \"White April Plates\" and exchange them for up to 300\n\"Arcana Gems\"\nat the Trader.\nGet up to 1,000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 75\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, and up to 15\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\nfrom the entire event.\n\"Star Fragments\" may drop on certain difficulty levels!\nSkill Record\n★3[Pure Heart?] Kibaou\nSkill Name\nAttack Up/Enhance Bleed Res./Enhance Curse Res.\nAttack\n32\nDefense\n30\nHP\n1775\nSkill Effect\n●[Attack Up 3] Attack +56./●[Enhance Bleed Res. 1] Bleed resistance +9.1%./●[Enhance Curse Res. 1] Curse resistance +9.1%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nJump！\nPower UP\nTrade \"Black April Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n★3[Pure Heart?] Kibaou\n400\n1\nMemory Stamp 158\nUse to obtain the \"Power UP\" stamp.\n150\n1\nMedal of Combat Arts\n300\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n30\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTrade \"White April Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n★3[Pure Heart?] Kibaou\n400\n1\nArcana Gems×10\n20\n30\nMedal of Combat Arts\n300\n2\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n2\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n2\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n2\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n2\nTrader Period\nStarts after the April 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 15, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in  count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nThe score earned in \"Extreme\" difficulty is not added to the \"Total Score Reward\", but you will receive rewards based on your score.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score\nEntry\nBasic Clear Bonus:24P＋Survival Bonus: 1P per surviving player\n30\nInterior\nBasic Clear Bonus:74P＋Survival Bonus: 1P per surviving player\n80\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:170P＋Survival Bonus: 5P per surviving player\n200\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:420P＋Survival Bonus: 10P per surviving player\n480\nSpecial\nBasic Clear Bonus:2280P＋Survival Bonus: 20P per surviving player\n2400\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus:1000P＋Survival Bonus: 20P per surviving player\n1120\n\"\nSpecial\n\"\nYou can get a high score in the \"\nSpecial\n\" difficulty bonus dungeon in this event.\nYou can clear the \"\nSpecial\n\" 1 time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nHigh difficulty \"\nExtreme\n\"\nYou can clear the \"\nExtreme\n\" 1 time per day.\nIn addition, item use is restricted while inside the dungeon and \"Revive Crystals\" can only be used up to 1 time.\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join Special and Extreme difficulty Quick Parties.\nSpecial: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nExtreme: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\n★3[Pure Heart?] Kibaou×9\nArcana Gems×600\nMedal of Combat Arts×10\nAwakening Star×25\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\n\"Extreme\" Score Rewards\nGreat Red Jewel×3\nGreat Green Jewel×3\nGreat Yellow Jewel×3\nGreat Blue Jewel×3\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nI Gotcha\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Black April Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nI've Got This\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Black April Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nMad Respect\nLet's collect a total of 2000 White April Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"April Fool 2021\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 4 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the April 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the May 9, 2024 (Thu) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nBrutal Kobold Lord\nDetails\nSkill Break with Bow skill.\nOn \"Special\" and \"Extreme\" difficulty levels, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nThrust Element\nWind Element\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Paralysis\" and \"Bleed\"\n* Skill Break: By completely lowering the Skill Break Gauge, the boss will be temporarily immobilized and all of its buff effects will be removed.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nIf you have previously played the \"Jumping Kibaou\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAchievements and achievement progress\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\n\"Black April Plates\" and \"White April Plates\" will be deleted on May 15, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nOnce you clear the dungeon on \"Special\" and \"Extreme\" difficulty, you cannot play again until it resets at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\n\"Black April Plate\" do not drop in \"Extreme\" difficulty.\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nScenario quests cannot be attempted with an Assist Party.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2024-04-16T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2024-05-08T19:00:00+00:00"
