    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Rabbit Scramble Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-04-01 00:00:01\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Sinon, Sanya, and Koharu love spending time with Ragout Rabbits in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nRabbit Scramble Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Chase the Hare] Kirito\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nPollution Burst\nSkill Name\nPollution\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Slash→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nBreak Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n114\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1920% damage (7x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Defense 4/Buff] Defense +15% for 15 sec./[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4500% damage (7x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2./[Bonus] Water element damage increases by number of frostbite stacks x 0.5% when the player is inflicted with the frostbite status ailment.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Sunlight Through the Trees] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nGeyser Shock\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n76\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1670% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Risk Taker 4/Buff] The lower your own HP, attack increases for 20 sec. (Stack 3) /[Risk Taker 4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, The lower your own HP, attack increases for 20 sec. (Stack 9)\n*More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[A Wonderful Encounter] Sanya\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Halo\nAttack\n47\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Halo 3] Defense -30% and during the buff effect for increased max HP the hit rate -30%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Warm Embrace] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nAqua Brandish\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n99\nSkill Effect\n1680% damage (4x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/[Stigma/Debuff] Increases damage taken by enemies for 18 sec (Stack 5) +0.5% for every Stack 1.\n*Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n\"[Chase the Hare] Kirito\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nApril 1, 2024 (Mon) 0:00 - April 30, 2024 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
