    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\" live stream on 3/29 (Fri) at 20:00 (JST/UTC+9)!\nNOTICES\n2024-03-29 19:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nWe'll be bringing you information on the latest updates, ongoing events, and more!\nCome check it out!\nTime and Date：\n3/29 (Fri) at 20:00 (JST/UTC+9) - scheduled\nLive Stream URL：\n◆YouTube Live\nhttps://youtube.com/live/isNZxsxaXH4\nDon't forget to subscribe to our YouTube channel and set a reminder!\n※Please note that the live stream is subject to cancellation or change without prior notice.\n※The live stream will be presented in Japanese.\nGo to Notice List"
