    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Exotic Guard Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-03-21 17:00:01\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKoharu, Argo, Agil, and Sinon wear stylish outfits in the great outdoors in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nExotic Guard Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Perfect Heat Protection] Koharu\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nChaos Fissure Burst\nSkill Name\nChaos Fissure\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Blunt→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n30.0\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n90\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1500% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Small Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4120% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark)./[Bonus] Critical damage +100% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Light As Silk] Argo\nSkill Name\nEnhance Paralysis Res./Power Rise/High Battle Healing\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Paralysis Res. 4] Paralysis Res. increase 70%./[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[High Battle Healing 3] Recovers a max of 1.2% HP per 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Dangerous Wind] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHell Buster\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n2140% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +2500 → 5000 → 7500 to enemies when using break.\nDark element damage +50% → 100% → 150% when using break.\n★4[Cool All Over] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nHoly Plasma\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1500% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 4 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n\"[Dangerous Wind] Agil\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the March 21, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends on April 15, 2024 (Mon) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
