    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] The \"Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary Stage Takeover Order\" is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2024-03-13 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary!\nKirito, Asuna, and Alice are dressed as artists, and are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nWorldwide 6 Year Anniversary Stage Takeover Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[To the Stage Together] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nAbandonment\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n63\nBreak Gauge\n57\nSkill Effect\n1540% damage (7x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during 20 sec./[Knight's Shield 4/Buff] When equipping 3 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set, Own DEF increases (Stack 3) +1% per Stack for 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using earth skills.\nRecovers 1500 → 3000 → 4500 HP when hitting with skills.\n★4[Scarlet Star Singer] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWhite Pulsar\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1410% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Critical damage +120%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Jacket Girl] Alice\nSkill Name\nGround Dance/Light Dance/Encircle Break\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Ground Dance 4] Deals +20% Earth element's damage to enemy./[Light Dance 4] Deals +20% Holy element's damage to enemy./[Encircle Break 3] Increase in break gauge to enemy by +27.5%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the March 13, 2024 (Wed) maintenance - April 8, 2024 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
