    "full_details": "Notices\n[Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary] Two ★4 Skill Records guaranteed! 24% ★4 Skill Record Rate! The \"Early Spring Grab Bag Order\" is here!\nShop\n2024-03-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 6 Year Anniversary!\nThe \"Early Spring Grab Bag Order\" containing a selection of characters progressing through the floors of Aincrad features an incredible\n2 guaranteed ★4 Skill Records\n!\nThe\n24% total drop rate\ndoes not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record!\nAvailable up to 10 times per player!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[On a Street at Night...] Kirito\nSkill Name\nVital Assention/Icy Blade\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Vital Assention 3] Defense +400./[Icy Blade 4] Deals +20% Water element's damage to enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Inherited Technique] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSP Cost\n14\nElement\nThrust\nSkill Cool Time\n26.0\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n56\nSkill Effect\n1980% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Toukou 5/Buff] -50% damage taken for 4 sec.(Invalid when equipped by Partner)/▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 200 x the number of Yuuki Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Damage +30% to enemies when using a non-elemental skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[The Spirit to Destroy] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nRock Smash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n95\nBreak Gauge\n45\nSkill Effect\n1500% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff (PT)] Own and Party's attack + 1% per stack (Stack2) during 20 sec./[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff (PT)] When the target is hit using the Switch, Own and Party's attack + 1% per stack (Stack6) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Grasping for Gains] Agil\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nDark Split Burst\nSkill Name\nDark Split\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Blunt→\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n28.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n37\nBreak Gauge\n74\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n2020% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./[Dark Element Enhance4/Buff] Dark element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4760% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack increases in proportion with your remaining HP x 200%./[Bonus] Critical rate +400% towards enemies on break.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP28)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nMarch 1, 2024 (Fri) 0:00 - March 10, 2024 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 5,000 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nThis can only be purchased 10 times per account.\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
