    "snippet": "Événement spécial de célébration de l'anniversaire de Koharu !En récompense, vous pouvez obtenir un avatar du poignard « Frimaire » que Koharu est souvent vu tenant dans les illustrations des records de compétences et des visuels clés !L'événement « Explorez Aincrad avec Koharu ! est en cours. Dans \"Explorez Aincrad avec Koharu !\", utilisez les astuces à l'écran...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nKoharu's birthday celebration special event \"Explore Aincrad with Koharu!\" is on now!\nEVENT\n2024-02-23 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKoharu's birthday celebration special event!\nAs a reward, you can get an avatar of the \"Frimaire\" dagger that Koharu is often seen holding in the illustrations of Skill Records and key visuals!\nThe \"Explore Aincrad with Koharu!\" is on now.\nIn the \"Explore Aincrad with Koharu!\", use the on-screen hints to get to your destination.\nOnce you've arrived, new hints will appear to help you get to the next one.\nComplete the quest by reaching the final destination and finding the treasure box.\nIf you lose track of the hints along the way, you can check them at any time by tapping \"Show hint\" on the quest details screen.\nQuest Reward\nFrimaire\nArcana Gems×100\n1,000,000Col\nEXP 3,000,000\nReward Avatar\nItem Name\nAvatar Images\nFrimaire\nAchievement Rewards\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nThe World I Wander With You\nClear the [Riddle] Explore Aincrad with Koharu\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Male Minstrel\" NPC at the Teleport Gate Plaza to accept the quest.\nEvent Period\nFebruary 23, 2024 (Fri) 17:00 - Before the February 28, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete 1F (Main Quest \"Labyrinth Strategy\")\n* We recommend progressing through the main quest so that you have access to each floor.\nImportant\nThe \"[Riddle] Explore Aincrad with Koharu\" is a 1x Only quest.\nYou can proceed through the quest without Koharu accompanying you, but since it's her birthday, bring her along if you can!\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2024-02-23T08:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2024-02-27T19:00:00+00:00"
