    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Accele Step-Up Order\" is here! One ★4 Accele Skill is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-02-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"Accele Skills\"!\nThe \"\nAccele Step-Up Order\n\" is here!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nAdditionally, on Step 3, one\n★4 Accele Skill is guaranteed!\nMore Accele Skill Details Here\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Split-Second Hit] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHydro Spike\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n74\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1880% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[A Little Trial and Error] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nEnhance Petrify Res./The Legendary Sword's Rule/Encircle Break\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Petrify Res. 5] Petrify resistance +70%./[The Legendary Sword's Rule] Attack +20% when not equipping any Kirito's Skill Records in the same set./[Encircle Break 3] Increase in break gauge to enemy by +27.5%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Safety First] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nSurging Shadow\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n168\nBreak Gauge\n72\nSkill Effect\n2150% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Duration\nStarts after the February 15, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends on February 24, 2024 (Sat) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Accele Skill!\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Accele Skill!\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Accele Skill!\nOne ★4 Accele Skill guaranteed!!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
