    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Sachi's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Sachi!\nShop\n2024-02-11 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Sachi's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Naughty Cat's Great Game] Sachi\n(Full Burst Skill)\" and \"\n[Taking the Advantage] Sachi\n(Burst Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nSachi's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Sachi guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Sachi\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Naughty Cat's Great Game] Sachi\nSkill Name\nEnhance Thrust/Enhance Attack/Tailwind\nAttack\n57\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2275\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Thrust 3] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +15%./[Enhance Attack 3] Attack +12%./[Tailwind 4] Switch gauge amount +15%, when equipping no Yui Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Taking the Advantage] Sachi\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nTerrible Shadow Burst\nSkill Name\nTerrible Shadow\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→\nDark\n→Thrust→\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n78\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1850% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Dark Element Weak 4/Debuff] Dark element damage to enemies +25% for 10 sec./[Dark Force 4/Buff] Dark element damage +15% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n5120% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Dark Shadow Demon 5/Buff] Dark element damage +65% for 8 sec./[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with debuff status.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nFebruary 11, 2024 (Sun) 0:00 - February 20, 2024 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Sachi\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Sachi\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
