"\nfrom the event.\nThis time you can get\nSuperior Ingots\n, which can be used for Equipment Refinement, and Rare Metal Scraps and Superior Metal Scraps, which can be used to produce ingots.\nMore Equipment Refinement Details Here\n\"Star Fragments\" may drop on certain difficulty levels!\nTrader Rewards\nExchange the \"Red Meiolania Plates\" you obtain from the event at the exclusive Trader to get items.\n\"Blue Meiolania Plates\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the February 7, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on February 15, 2024 (Thu).\nTrade \"Red Meiolania Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n30\nSuperior Ingot\n75\n15\nRare Metal Scrap\n75\n10\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n25\n50\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n3\nAwakening Star\n20\n30\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTrade \"Blue Meiolania Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n10\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n25\nSuperior Ingot\n75\n15\nRare Metal Scrap\n75\n10\nSuperior Metal Scrap\n25\n50\nMedal of Combat Arts\n200\n2\nAwakening Star\n20\n20\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTrader Period\nRed Meiolania Plate: Starts after the January 31, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the February 28, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nBlue Meiolania Plate: Starts after the February 7, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the February 28, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in \"Entry\", \"Depth\", \"DANGER\", \"Gaining Ground\", \"Special\", and \"Extreme\" difficulties all count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n.\nYour rewards will be based on your score.\nDungeon\nScore calculation\nMax Score₍This does not include the Special Bonus₎\nEntry\nBasic Clear Bonus:99P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n105\nDepth\nBasic Clear Bonus:299P＋Survival Bonus:1P per surviving player\n305\nDANGER\nBasic Clear Bonus:1185P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n1215\nGaining Ground\nBasic Clear Bonus:3585P＋Survival Bonus:5P per surviving player\n3615\nSpecial\nBasic Clear Bonus:2940P＋Survival Bonus:10P per surviving player\n3000\nExtreme\nBasic Clear Bonus:4880P＋Survival Bonus:20P per surviving player\n5000\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Gaining Ground\", \"Special\" and \"Extreme\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nGaining Ground: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nSpecial: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\nExtreme: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 80,000 or higher\n\"\nGaining Ground\n\"\nYou can get a high score in the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" difficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the \"\nGaining Ground\n\" one time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\n\"\nExtreme\n\"\nItem use inside the \"\nExtreme\n\" difficulty dungeon is restricted, and Revive Crystals can only be used once.\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×700\nMedal of Combat Arts×13\nMemoria Niter S×120\nSuperior Ingot×10\nSuperior Metal Scrap×120\nRare Metal Scrap×60\nAwakening Star×50\nGreat Red Jewel×10\nGreat Green Jewel×10\nGreat Yellow Jewel×10\nGreat Blue Jewel×10\nSpecial Bonus\nA Special Bonus will be in effect for the dungeon in this event.\nIf you clear the dungeon with compatible Skill Records equipped, you'll receive a large additional score bonus!\nList of Special Bonus Compatible Skill Records\nSkill Name\nEquipment Type\nSpecial Bonus\nEntry\nDepth\nDANGER\nGaining Ground\nSpecial\nExtreme\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\nMinimum\nMaximum\n★4[Powerful Puppet Master] Klein\n2H Axe\n10\n20\n30\n60\n120\n240\n300\n600\n300\n600\n500\n1000\n★4[Beware of Spikes] Argo\n1H Club\n10\n20\n30\n60\n120\n240\n300\n600\n300\n600\n500\n1000\n★4[Happy New Year with a Smile] Sinon\nAbility\n7\n14\n21\n42\n84\n168\n210\n420\n210\n420\n350\n700\n★4[Eloquent Storyteller] Lueur\n1H Club\n7\n14\n21\n42\n84\n168\n210\n420\n210\n420\n350\n700\n★3[A Sophisticated New Year] Agil\nAbility\n3\n6\n9\n18\n36\n72\n90\n180\n90\n180\n150\n300\n★3[Daily Training] Asuna\nAbility\n3\n6\n9\n18\n36\n72\n90\n180\n90\n180\n150\n300\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nBittersweet\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Red Meiolania Plate in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nUnparalleled Chocoholic\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Red Meiolania Plate in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Event Dungeon\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the January 31, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the February 21, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Abyss will be implemented after the February 7, 2024 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nChocolate Meiolania\nDetails\nBreak with Slash Element\nOn Abyss difficulty, the Break Gauge can be broken with Blunt Element attacks.\nOn Special, Extreme, and Abyss difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nOn DANGER, Gaining Ground, Special, Extreme, and Abyss difficulty levels, it will use the Chaos Recollection buff.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nWater Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Abyss\"difficulty\nBlunt Element\nWater Element\nResistance\n* Only \"Abyss\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nThrust Element\nFire Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nHoly Element\nDark Element\nBuffs used\nBuff \"Chaos Recollection\"\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Fatal Poison\", \"Petrify\"\nDebuff \"Seal item\", \"Decrease defense\"\n* Break: Filling the entire Break Gauge will temporarily immobilize the boss and remove all of its buff effects.\n* Chaos Recollection: A powerful aura that surrounds the body and reduces damage. (Awakening is effective.)\n* Status ailment \"Petrify\": Lose the ability to use actions or items, and take double the damage.\nThis will be removed after a certain amount of time or by taking damage.\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nAfter you clear a \"Gaining Ground\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nItem use inside the \"Extreme\" difficulty dungeon is restricted, and Revive Crystals can only be used once.\nPlates will be deleted on February 28, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThere are no first or last attack bonuses on any difficulty.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
