    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Progressive Collection Order\" is here! One SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive movie ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-01-20 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAll ★4 Skill Records are from the SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive: Aria of a Starless Night movie or SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive: Scherzo of Deep Night movie!\nThe \"\nProgressive Collection Order\n\" is on now!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nPlus, one ★4 Skill Record from a SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive movie is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Split-Second Hit] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHydro Spike\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n74\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1880% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Aqua Pile/Buff] Water element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Aqua Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, water element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Decisive Blow] Argo\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nWater Hash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n26\nSkill Effect\n1340% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Flashing Sword at Twilight] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nFlame Pain\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1360% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Flash 4/Buff] Your own critical rate and critical damage increases 25% for 30sec.Effect will be removed with damage./[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 5) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Superior Battle Skills] Mito\nSkill Name\nSteel Fang/Enhance Stun Res./Enhance Bleed Res.\nAttack\n42\nDefense\n58\nHP\n2800\nSkill Effect\n[Steel Fang 4] Attack +500 when attacking with thrust element./●[Enhance Stun Res. 3] Stun resistance +30%./●[Enhance Bleed Res. 4] Bleed resistance +60%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Sound of Liberation] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nValiant Wind\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n21\nSkill Effect\n1350% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Leafa's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Sharp Aiming] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nEarth Riposte\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1420% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces all skill's cool times by 3 → 6 → 9 sec when hitting with skills.\n★4[Rebel Scythe User] Mito\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Enhance Curse Res./Hold the Front\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 4] Attack +400./●[Enhance Curse Res. 4] Curse resistance +70%/[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Command Knight] Diavel\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Devil's Orders\nAttack\n36\nDefense\n68\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Spirit Unity 4] + 8 increase to Awakening rate./[Devil's Orders] (Invalid when equipped by Partner) When the target is hit using the Switch, adds a buff that recovers your HP (3%/3 sec) for 30 sec.Also, it adds additional effects depending on Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 2 or more of Diavel's Skill Records: attack, critical rate, and critical damage +15% to you and your party for 15 sec.When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records: activates a debuff where elemental damage -80% for elements other than \"\"non-elemental\"\" to you and your party for 15 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nJanuary 20, 2024 (Sat) 0:00 - January 31, 2024 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n★4 Skill Records are all SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive!\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n★4 Skill Records are all SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive!\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n★4 Skill Records are all SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive!\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
