    "full_details": "Notices\nJanuary 24, 2024 (Wed) Changes to Requirements for the Underground Labyrinth main quest \"Underground Labyrinth: B1 Trial\"\nNOTICES\n2024-01-19 22:10:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nFollowing maintenance on 1/24/2024 (Wed), the requirements for the Underground Labyrinth main quest \"Underground Labyrinth: B1 Trial\" will be changed.\nBefore change：Defeat 100 monsters in 《Underground Labyrinth B1》\n↓\nAfter change：Collect 25 Skill Releasers.\nDue to these changes, any progress made on the \"Underground Labyrinth: B1 Trial\" quest will be reset at maintenance on 1/24/2024 (Wed).\nWe apologize for the inconvenience, but we ask that any players currently paused on this quest please complete the quest before the changes are made if necessary.\n* This will have no effect on those who have already cleared this quest.\nWe hope you continue to enjoy \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor\".\nGo to Notice List"
