    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Braving the Rowdy Sea Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-01-17 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Asuna, Agil, and Sachi command the seas as brave warriors in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nBraving the Rowdy Sea Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Hero of the North Sea] Kirito\nSkill Name\nGround Dance/Black Panther/Encircle Break\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Ground Dance 4] Deals +20% Earth element's damage to enemy./[Black Panther 4] When equipping 1 or more of Sachi's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%./[Encircle Break 3] Increase in break gauge to enemy by +27.5%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Raging North Wind] Asuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nIce Burdock Burst\nSkill Name\nIce Burdock\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Thrust→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n35\nBreak Gauge\n70\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1920% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Water Element Enhance4/Buff] Water element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 3/Buff] Critical damage +10% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4480% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Critical rate +1000%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Roaring Man in the Sea] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nSand Buster\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n44\nSkill Effect\n2240% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Earth Pile/Buff] Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Poison/Status Ailments] When equipping 4 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records in the same set, Poison (Stack 10) will affect the player for 30 sec./[Earth Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Earth element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Between Stormy Skies] Sachi\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nConverging Frost Burst\nSkill Name\nConverging Frost\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nActivation Requirements\nWater\n→\nWater\n→Thrust→(\nWater\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nSwitch Gauge\n54\nBreak Gauge\n53\nBreak Gauge\n106\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1680% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Water Element Weak 4/Debuff] Water element damage to monster +25% for 10 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Attack increase effect will be removed from enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4620% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Wide]/[Splashing Water Demon 5/Buff] Water element damage +65% for 8 sec./[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with debuff status.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n\"[Raging North Wind] Asuna\", \"[Roaring Man in the Sea] Agil\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the January 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the February 15, 2024 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
