    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(1/17)\nMAINT.\n2024-01-16 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n1/17, 2024 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 43 begins\n\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\" begins\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Wonder Animal Assault 2024\"\nAdded \"Intense Dragon Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 1/17 Maintenance\n\"MOD Step-Up Order\"\n\"Ordinal Scale Selection Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
