    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Troubling Letter Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2024-01-11 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Silica, Yuna, and Lisbeth traverse mountains and valleys to deliver an important letter in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nTroubling Letter Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[ASAP Delivery] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nRaged Lightning\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1520% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using holy skills.\nWhen equipping 2 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Holy element damage +50% → 100% → 150%.\n★4[To Those Waiting For News] Silica\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nPhoton Slice Burst\nSkill Name\nPhoton Slice\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nActivation Requirements\nHoly\n→Slash→\nHoly\n→(\nHoly\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n39\nSwitch Gauge\n39\nBreak Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n68\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1860% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Weak Slash 4/Debuff] Slash element's weakness damage +25% for 8 sec./[Holy Element Enhance4/Buff] Holy element damage +9% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4390% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the blunt element./[Bonus] Attack +100% against enemy with status ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite).\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Messenger of Peace] Yuna\nSkill Name\nEnhance Slash/Enhance Attack/Tailwind\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n42\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Slash 3] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +15%./[Enhance Attack 3] Attack +12%./[Tailwind 4] Switch gauge amount +15%, when equipping no Yui Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Ability\nFor each piece of equipment in the same set, the number of activations in additional Full Burst state increases by 1 (1 activation per skill)\nStock Type: Resets remaining time for Full Burst skill activation, and extends duration of Full Burst state (+10 sec per 1 equipment)\nChain Type: Increases burst skill damage used in Full Burst state (+5% per 1 equipment)\n*Burst activated Sword Skills during Full Burst state will activate normally until Full Burst State ends.\n★4[Vague Signs] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nRock Asterisk\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n57\nBreak Gauge\n48\nSkill Effect\n1430% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Motion Range]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Damage +100% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n\"[To Those Waiting For News] Silica\" is\na Sword Skill with a higher damage multiplier increase after limit break!\nAmount of increase per limit break:\n+50%\nFor the specified Skill Records, the limit break level box of the skill icon will turn yellow and the limit break gauge will change as follows.\n- Duration\nStarts after the January 11, 2024 (Thu) maintenance and ends on February 10, 2024 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
