    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"End of the Year Grab Bag Order\" is here! Two ★4 Skill Records guaranteed! 24% ★4 Skill Record Rate!\nShop\n2023-12-30 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAvailable up to 10 times per player!\nThe \"End of the Year Grab Bag Order\" containing a selection of heroes journeying through Aincrad features an incredible\n2 guaranteed ★4 Skill Records\n!\nThe\n24% total drop rate\ndoes not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Evangelical Cantata] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFlame Blast\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n17\nSkill Effect\n1310% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[A Moment with Family] Asuna\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nFire Riot Burst\nSkill Name\nFire Riot\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nActivation Requirements\nFire\n→\nFire\n→Thrust→\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n60\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n1430% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] Fire element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 4/Buff] When equipping 1 or more of Yui's Skill Records in the same set, critical damage +20% for 15 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4000% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus] Switch gauge rises by 5 x the number of Kirito Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Critical rate +1000%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP28)\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Escape in the Nick of Time] Silica\nSkill Name\nSuper Enhance Heal/Peak/Hold the Front\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2875\nSkill Effect\n[Super Enhance Heal] Effect of healing items and field objects +100%./[Peak 3] Attack +40% when HP is above 80%./[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Unsinkable Barrier] Heathcliff\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Flame Conversion/Firm Measures\nAttack\n42\nDefense\n76\nHP\n2125\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Flame Conversion 4]Water element's damage to enemies -10% and fire element's damage to enemies +25%./[Firm Measures 1] Adds an effect when no other Kirito Skill Records are equipped in the same set.・Max HP +10%.・Attack +20%.・Skill's power is added +200% when used in switch.・Critical rate +10%.・Critical damage +10%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nProtection of the Holy Sword\n[When Rush Activates] Recover all status ailments.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nDecember 30, 2023 (Sat) 17:00 - January 15, 2024 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 5,000 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nThis can only be purchased 10 times per account.\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
