    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] The Unleash Blading Illustration Order is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2023-12-27 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nNew ★4 Skill Records of Kirito, Asuna, Leafa, and Sinon from Sword Art Online: Unleash Blading are here!\nThe\nSAO Games 10th Anniversary Unleash Blading Illustration Order\nis here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for the featured new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[A New Beginning] Kirito\nSkill Name\nEnhance HP/Earth Boost/Tailwind\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance HP 3] Max HP +10%./[Earth Boost 4] Elemental damage other than earth dealt to enemies -50%, and earth element's damage to enemies +40%./[Tailwind 3] Switch gauge amount +15%, when equipping no Yui Skill Records in the same set.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nExtra effect time7.5sec.\nLimit Break extends Accele Skill effect time.\n* Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[A Thousand Years With You] Asuna\nNormally\nFull Burst Skill\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nCycron Burst\nSkill Name\nCycron\nSP Cost\n0\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nActivation Requirements\nWind\n→Thrust→\nWind\n→(\nWind\n)\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSkill Cool Time\n15.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n54\nBreak Gauge\n108\nSkill Effect\nFull Burst Skill Effect\n1510% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Wind Element Enhance4/Buff] Wind element damage +9% for 15 sec./[Weakness Attack 4/Buff] Critical damage +20% for 15 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n4150% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] While debuff to raise your own damage taken is effective, attack power will increase 100%.\n*Can activate without using SP.(Able to activate when above SP30)\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nFull Burst Skill\n★4[Aim for the Sky] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHoly Slant\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n60\nBreak Gauge\n27\nSkill Effect\n1600% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Shine Pile/Buff] Holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Shine Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, holy element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[The Silent Sniper] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nEarth Plasma\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1460% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the December 27, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 24, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
