    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice regarding Inquires Received during Winter Holidays\nIMPORTANT\n2023-12-22 15:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThank you for using the services and products of Bandai Namco.\r\n\r\nThis is to inform our users about inquiries received during the holidays from: \r\n November 29,2023(Friday)--January 4,2024(Thursday)JST\r\n\r\n■ Please be informed that during the holidy period above, the number of inquiries are expected to increase, so it will take us longer than usual to respond to you.\r\n■  For some inquiries that needed to be escalated to developers, will be attended from January 5,2024 (Friday),and will be answered in order of receipt after the investigation from developers are done properly.\r\n\r\nWe deeply apologize for any inconvenience it will cause you.\r\n\r\nYour understanding and patients are highly appreciated.\nGo to Notice List"
