    "full_details": "Notices\n[Holiday Campaign] \"Chaos Showdown: All Open\" is here! Get your hands on the powerful Dark Black Series armor!\nEVENT\n2023-12-20 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nChallenge each of the boss monsters on every difficulty in \"Chaos Showdown: All Open\", on now!\nCollect production material from boss drops and get your hands on the powerful \"Dark Black Series\" equipment!\nThe following difficulty levels are open to parties!\nTake on Chaos Showdown 90 difficulty to get \"Dark Black Series\", which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 90.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 95 difficulty to get \"Dark Black Series\", which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 95.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 110 difficulty to get \"Dark Black Series\", which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 110.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 135 difficulty to get \"Dark Black Series\", which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 135.\nTake on Chaos Showdown 155 difficulty to get \"Dark Black Series\", which can be equipped from Equipment Lv. 155.\nDungeon Duration\nDecember 20, 2023 (Wed) 14:00 - January 10, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nBoss Appearing\nDifficulty\nBoss Name\nWeakness\nChaos Showdown 90\nDark Black King\nDark Black Thunder Bull\nDark Black Spirit Tree\nBlunt Element\nSlash Element\n・\nWind Element\nSlash Element\n・\nFire Element\nChaos Showdown 95\nDark Black Sea Horse\nDark Black False Statue\nDark Black Beast\nThrust Element\n・\nEarth Element\nThrust Element\n・\nFire Element\nSlash Element\n・\nWater Element\nChaos Showdown 110\nDark Black Colossal\nDark Black Frozen Evil\nDark Black Evil Spirit\nThrust Element\n・\nHoly Element\nBlunt Element\n・\nDark Element\nBlunt Element\n・\nEarth Element\nChaos Showdown 135\nDark Black Snake Samurai\nDark Black Griffin\nDark Black Sturdy Crab\nSlash Element\n・\nWind Element\nThrust Element\n・\nWater Element\nBlunt Element\n・\nHoly Element\n→\nThrust Element\n・\nHoly Element\n→\nBlunt Element\n・\nHoly Element\nChaos Showdown 155\nDark Black Blazing\nDark Black Half Beast\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast\nSlash Element\n・\nDark Element\nThrust Element\n・\nEarth Element\nBlunt Element\n・\nFire Element\nChaos Showdown 175\nDark Black Asura\nDark Black Crossgigas\nDark Black Sticky Thing\nBlunt Element\n・\nWater Element\nSlash Element\n・\nHoly Element\nThrust Element\n・\nWind Element\nChaos Showdown 195\nDark Black Warden\nDark Black Butterfly\nDark Black Last Number\nThrust Element\n・\nDark Element\nBlunt Element\n・\nWind Element\nSlash Element\n・\nEarth Element\nChaos Showdown 215\nDark Black White Wyrm\nDark Black Sea Snake\nDark Black Gleam Eyes\nSlash Element\n・\nWater Element\nBlunt Element\n・\nHoly Element\nThrust Element\n・\nFire Element\n\"Dark Black Series\" equipment can be produced at the Workshop using production materials dropped from the boss.\nDark Black Series List\nCan be made with material that drops from Chaos Showdown 90.\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black King Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black King Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nDark Black Thunder Bull Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black Thunder Bull Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nDark Black Spirit Tree Armor\n816\n12210\nLv.90\nDark Black Spirit Tree Greaves\n670\n8547\nLv.90\nCan be made with material that drops from Chaos Showdown 95.\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Sea Horse Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black Sea Horse Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nDark Black False Statue Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black False Statue Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nDark Black Beast Armor\n866\n12810\nLv.95\nDark Black Beast Greaves\n710\n8967\nLv.95\nCan be made with material that drops from Chaos Showdown 110.\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Colossal Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Colossal Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nDark Black Frozen Evil Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Frozen Evil Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nDark Black Evil Spirit Armor\n917\n14010\nLv.110\nDark Black Evil Spirit Greaves\n752\n9807\nLv.110\nCan be made with material that drops from Chaos Showdown 135.\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Snake Samurai Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Snake Samurai Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nDark Black Griffin Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Griffin Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nDark Black Sturdy Crab Armor\n1257\n20190\nLv.135\nDark Black Sturdy Crab Greaves\n1031\n14133\nLv.135\nCan be made with material that drops from Chaos Showdown 155.\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Blazing Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black Blazing Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nDark Black Half Beast Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black Half Beast Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast Armor\n1358\n21990\nLv.155\nDark Black One-Eyed Beast Greaves\n1114\n15393\nLv.155\nCan be made with material that drops from Chaos Showdown 175.\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Asura Armor\n1460\n24400\nLv.175\nDark Black Asura Greaves\n1197\n16303\nLv.175\nDark Black Crossgigas Armor\n1460\n24400\nLv.175\nDark Black Crossgigas Greaves\n1197\n16303\nLv.175\nDark Black Sticky Thing Armor\n1460\n24400\nLv.175\nDark Black Sticky Thing Greaves\n1197\n16303\nLv.175\nCan be made with material that drops from Chaos Showdown 195.\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black Warden Armor\n1563\n26850\nLv.195\nDark Black Warden Greaves\n1282\n17253\nLv.195\nDark Black Butterfly Armor\n1563\n26850\nLv.195\nDark Black Butterfly Greaves\n1282\n17253\nLv.195\nDark Black Last Number Armor\n1563\n26850\nLv.195\nDark Black Last Number Greaves\n1282\n17253\nLv.195\nCan be made with material that drops from Chaos Showdown 215.\nIcon\nItem Name\nDefense ₍Max₎\nHP Bonus ₍Max₎\nRequired Level\nDark Black White Wyrm Armor\n1667\n29350\nLv.215\nDark Black White Wyrm Greaves\n1367\n18253\nLv.215\nDark Black Sea Snake Armor\n1667\n29350\nLv.215\nDark Black Sea Snake Greaves\n1367\n18253\nLv.215\nDark Black Gleam Eyes Armor\n1667\n29350\nLv.215\nDark Black Gleam Eyes Greaves\n1367\n18253\nLv.215\nRandom Bonus\nThe value and type of the Dark Black Series bonus are random.\nStatus\nDark Black Gleam Eyes Armor\nDark Black Gleam Eyes Greaves\nAttack\n30\n30\nDefense\n80\n50\nHP\n2500\n4000\nExample: If three types of defenses are given to Dark Black Gleam Eyes Armor, defense will increase by 240 total.\n* Succession cannot be used for the Dark Black Series.\nParticipation Requirements\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end\nAccept it from the \"Chaos Showdown\" NPC at the \"Blackiron Palace\".\nRewards\nThe following items can be obtained from score rewards, challenge rewards, and achievement rewards.\nDungeon\nRewards\nChaos Showdown 90\nCrimson Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 95\nAmber Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 110\nTopaz Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 135\nEmerald Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 155\nSapphire Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 175\nIndigo Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 195\nAmethyst Crystal Shard\nChaos Showdown 215\nQuartz Crystal Shard\nCheck in-game for more details on the rewards.\nImportant\n\"Chaos Showdown\" 175, 195, and 215 difficulties are solo only.\nChaos Showdown is a permanent dungeon where the boss changes approximately every two weeks. The rotation will start over again after six weeks.\nDark Black Thunder Bull, Dark Black False Statue, Dark Black Frozen Evil, Dark Black Griffin, Dark Black Half Beast, Dark Black Crossgigas, Dark Black Butterfly and Dark Black Sea Snake will be appearing as bosses in the Chaos Showdown opening on January 10, 2024 (Wed).\nYour score reward and challenge reward information will not reset when each dungeon returns.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
