    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "L'événement de scénario \"Lapin des neiges de verre et le dernier Noël\" est de retour !L'événement de scénario \"Lapin des neiges de verre et le dernier Noël\" Vous avez trouvé 《Mater》 blessé et elle vous a demandé de l'aide. Mais quelque chose ne semble pas bien... Récompenses Collectez des petites cloches et échangez-les chez le commerçant contre des objets. Le record de compétence \"★4 [Charmante dame]...",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Glass Snow Rabbit & the Last Xmas\" is back! Get the ★4 Asuna Skill Record!\nEVENT\n2023-12-06 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe Scenario Event \"Glass Snow Rabbit & the Last Xmas\" is back!\nThe Scenario Event \"Glass Snow Rabbit & the Last Xmas\"\nYou found 《Mater》 wounded and she asked you for help.\nBut something seems off…\nRewards\nCollect Small Bells and exchange them at the Trader for items.\nThe Skill Record \"\n★4 [Charming Lady] Asuna\n\" is featured alongside awakening materials and reissued Christmas Avatars at the Trader.\nSkill Record\n★4[Charming Lady] Asuna\nSkill Name\nEnhance Frostbite Res/Full of Asuna\nAttack\n45\nDefense\n46\nHP\n1900\nSkill Effect\n●[Enhance Frostbite Res. 4] Frostbite resistance +100%./[Full of Asuna] When equipping 3 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +10%. When equipping 6 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Critical rate +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAvatar\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nHoly Suit Top\nTop Avatar/Male Only\nHoly Suit Bottoms\nBottom Avatar/Male Only\nHoly Costume\nFull Body Avatar/Female Only\nHoly Red Nose\nAccessory Avatar\nTrade \"Small Bell\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n★4[Charming Lady] Asuna\n400\n5\nAwakening Star\n25\n25\nGreat Red Jewel\n50\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n50\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n50\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n50\n5\nHoly Suit Top\n350\n1\nHoly Suit Bottoms\n250\n1\nHoly Costume\n600\n2\nHoly Red Nose\n200\n2\nTrader\nSee each Trader NPC for more info, or go to Menu > Items > Enhance:Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the \"Trade Small Bell\" banner.\nScore Rewards\nEntry\nInterior\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n150\nSmall Bell\n5\n200\nSmall Bell\n10\n300\nHealing Potion\n10\n400\nHealing Potion\n20\n600\nRecord Frame M\n10\n800\nRecord Frame M\n15\n1200\nSmall Bell\n10\n1600\nSmall Bell\n15\n2100\nHealing Potion\n20\n2800\nHealing Potion\n30\n3000\nRestorative Potion\n5\n4000\nRestorative Potion\n10\n4200\nHealing Potion\n30\n5600\nCleansing Potion\n10\n5400\nRecord Frame M\n20\n7200\nRecord Frame M\n30\n6600\nSmall Bell\n30\n8800\nSmall Bell\n35\n7800\nArcana Gems\n50\n10400\nArcana Gems\n50\n9000\nRevive Crystal\n1\n12000\nRevive Crystal\n2\n10500\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n14000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\nDepth\nDANGER\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n250\nSmall Bell\n15\n300\nSmall Bell\n20\n500\nRestorative Potion\n10\n600\nRestorative Potion\n30\n1000\nRecord Frame L\n10\n1200\nRecord Frame L\n15\n2000\nSmall Bell\n20\n2400\nSmall Bell\n30\n3500\nRestorative Potion\n20\n4200\nRestorative Potion\n50\n5000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n6000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n7000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n2\n8400\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n9000\nRecord Frame L\n20\n10800\nRecord Frame L\n30\n11000\nSmall Bell\n40\n13200\nSmall Bell\n50\n13000\nArcana Gems\n50\n15600\nArcana Gems\n50\n15000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n18000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n10\n17500\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n21000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\nTrader Period\nStarts after the December 6, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 17, 2024 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nFalling and Piling High\nLet's collect a total of 1000 Small Bells\nMedal of Combat Arts×1\nA Flake of Courage\nLet's collect a total of 2500 Small Bells\nMedal of Combat Arts×2\nGlass Snow Rabbit\nLet's collect a total of 10000 Small Bells\nMedal of Combat Arts×3\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Mater\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 4 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the December 6, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 11, 2024 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nGeorgius the Heretic\nDetails\nIt inflicts the player with Frostbite with a powerful blizzard.\nWatch out for its huge spinning axe attack and poison mist.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nHoly Element\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Poison\" and \"Frostbite\"\n\"Curse\"（* \"Interior\", \"Depth\" and \"DANGER\" difficulty）\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf the ★4 Skill Records you acquire have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Memoria Niter L\".\nIf you have previously played the \"Glass Snow Rabbit & the Last Xmas\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAchievements and achievement progress\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\nIn the replay of this event, Stuffed Stockings will not be a reward.\n\"Small Bell\" will be deleted on January 17, 2024 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
