    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Klein's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Klein!\nShop\n2023-11-28 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Klein's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Enchanting Samurai Spirit] Klein\n\" and \"\n[The Only Way is Forward!] Klein\n(Connect Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nKlein's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Klein guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Klein\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Enchanting Samurai Spirit] Klein\nSkill Name\nBurn Counter/Enhance Burn Immunity/Wild Fire\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Burn Counter 3] When the player is Status Ailments (Burn), Attack +1000./●[Enhance Burn Immunity 2] Burn damage -10%./[Wild Fire 1] Adds Scorch effect on yourself for 30 sec when you hit using Switch (Stack 30). 2.2%＋(number of stacks x 0.2%) damage and 4.4%＋(number of stacks x 0.4%) attack decrese.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[The Only Way is Forward!] Klein\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSharpened Rock\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n11.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1490% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Ever Present Battlefied 4/Buff] Attack +8% for 30 sec./▲[Bonus] Reduces status ailment stacks by 5 on yourself, when hitting with skills while inflicted with Burn (Will not be below 1).\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +1000 → 3000 → 5000 when using earth skills.\nReduces status ailment stacks by 5 → 10 → 15 on yourself, when hitting with skills while inflicted with Burn (Will not be below 1).\n- Duration\nNovember 28, 2023 (Tue) 0:00 - December 7, 2023 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Klein\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Klein\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
