    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Monster Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2023-11-23 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne yokai-themed ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nThe \"\nMonster Selection Order\n\" is on now!\n- Duration\nNovember 23, 2023 (Thu) 12:00 - December 8, 2023 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sweet Delight] Yui\nSkill Name\nVital Assention/Autosave/Wild Fire\nAttack\n63\nDefense\n24\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Vital Assention 3] Defense +400./[Autosave 2] Defense +15% when Status Ailments with Paralysis, Stun, Sleep, Curse, Debility, Petrify, Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite./[Wild Fire 3] Adds Scorch effect on yourself for 30 sec when you hit using Switch (Stack 50). 2.2%＋(number of stacks x 0.2%) damage and 4.4%＋(number of stacks x 0.4%) attack decrese.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Master Stewing Technique] Argo\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nPenetrating Shadow\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n18\nSkill Effect\n1560% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nRecovers 4% → 8% → 12% of your own max HP when hitting with skills.\n★4[Dazzling Divine Power] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWind Splash\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n46\nSkill Effect\n1420% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces all skill's cool times by 3 → 6 → 9 sec when hitting with skills.\n★4[Demon Rulekeeper] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nVolcano Blow\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n1230% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[PT Enhance Blunt 4/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +30% for your party for 20 sec./[Thrust Attack Down 3/Debuff] Enemy thrust attack -15% for 15 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Lady Fox] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nDark Blast-Shot\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1290% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Adversity 3/Buff] The lower your own HP, critical damage increases for 15 sec./▲[Bonus] All the Stack Buff effected to the enemy will -2 in numbers of Stacks (Will not be below 1).\n* Less likely to attract aggro from enemies.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Lady Demon] Alice\nSkill Name\nEnhance Berserk/Enhance Paralysis Res./Hostility: Poison\nAttack\n62\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Berserk 4] When the player is Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite, Curse, Debility), Attack +25%./●[Enhance Paralysis Res. 4] Paralysis Res. increase 70%./[Hostility: Poison] When equipping 1 of Kirito's Skill Records in a set, adds poison effect on yourself for 30 sec when you hit using Switch (Stack 1).\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Undead Sister] Leafa\nSkill Name\nFlame Indemnity/Enhance Burn Immunity/Enhance Berserk\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n38\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Flame Indemnity 3] When you are burnt, fire element damage + 40%./●[Enhance Burn Immunity 3] Burn damage -30%./[Enhance Berserk 3] When the player is Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite, Curse, Debility), Attack +20%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Undead Prince] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSavage God Bless\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n45\nBreak Gauge\n37\nSkill Effect\n1360% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Weak Attack 3/Debuff] Chance to decrease enemy's Attack for 15% for 10 sec./[Enhance Defense 3/Buff] Defense +12% for 15 sec.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
