    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(11/8)\nMAINT.\n2023-11-07 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n11/8, 2023 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Preseason 41 begins\n\"Boss Rush VS Evil Treant\" begins\nAdded [SAO Games 10th Anniversary] \"Colossus Hunt\" Event rewards\n\"Guild Support Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" UPDATE\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 11/8 Maintenance\n\"Halloween Assault 2023\"\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] \"Intensive Training Event VS Mito\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
