    "snippet": "Vous pouvez gagner des tonnes d'EXP dans la quête spéciale dès maintenant ! Acceptez la quête, déplacez-vous vers la carte désignée et éliminez-la en battant les monstres pour réclamer vos récompenses. De plus, la difficulté augmente à mesure que vous progressez dans la quête. Récompenses Obtenez un total de 20 millions d'EXP grâce aux récompenses de quête !",
    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Heapin' 20M EXP Event\" on now!\nEVENT\n2023-10-11 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYou can earn tons of EXP in the special quest on now!\nAccept the quest, move to the designated map, and clear it by defeating the monsters to claim your rewards.\nPlus, the difficulty increases as you progress through the quest.\nRewards\nGet a total of 20 million EXP from quest rewards!\nAim to clear all the quests!\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Silica\" in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to accept the quest.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the October 11, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the October 25, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nQuest Rewards\nRelease Dates\nRelease Quest\nRewards\nAmount\nRelease condition\nStarts after the  October 11, 2023 Maintenance\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 1\nEXP\n100,000\nー\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nOctober 12, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 2\nEXP\n200,000\nClear the 2F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nOctober 13, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 3\nEXP\n500,000\nClear the 3F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nOctober 14, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 4\nEXP\n800,000\nClear the 4F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nOctober 15, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 5\nEXP\n1,200,000\nClear the 5F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nOctober 16, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 6\nEXP\n1,800,000\nClear the 6F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nOctober 17, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 7\nEXP\n2,400,000\nClear the 7F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nOctober 18, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 8\nEXP\n3,000,000\nClear the 8F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nOctober 19, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 9\nEXP\n4,000,000\nClear the 9F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nOctober 20, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 10\nEXP\n6,000,000\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
