    "id": "3294",
    "name": "Les avatars populaires d'Halloween sont de retour ! Le \"Halloween Assault 2023\" est là ! Obtenez beaucoup d'EXP grâce aux hordes de monstres !",
    "image": "https://saoif-com.akamaized.net/web/shop_login/en/img/other/20231011aslt.png",
    "news_url": "https://saoif.nayu.fun/shop_information/detail/3294.html",
    "news_date": 1697011200,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "Des hordes de monstres attaquent dans \"Halloween Assault 2023\" !Après un certain temps, le monstre boss apparaîtra.Chassez des hordes de monstres et gagnez des tonnes d'EXP !RécompensesLes avatars populaires d'Halloween sont de retour !En plus des tonnes d'EXP et des \"Cristaux d'Exp\" que vous pouvez utiliser pour gagner de l'EXP, vous pouvez...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nPopular Halloween avatars are back! The \"Halloween Assault 2023\" is here! Get lots of EXP from the hordes of monsters!\nEVENT\n2023-10-11 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHordes of monsters attack in the \"Halloween Assault 2023\"!\nAfter a certain amount of time passes, the boss monster will appear.\nDrive off hordes of monsters and earn\ntons of EXP\n!\nRewards\nPopular Halloween avatars are back!\nIn addition to tons of EXP and the \"Exp Crystals\" you can use to gain EXP, you can get \"Arcana Gems\", \"Medals of Combat Arts\", \"Awakening Stars\" to awaken Skill Records, \"Memoria Niter S\" to Limit Break Skill Records, and much more!\nGet various rewards from Total Score Rewards and by trading the Black Halloween Plates from the event at the Trader.\n\"White Halloween Plates\" will be added as drops, and rewards will be added to the Trader, after the October 18, 2023 (Wed) maintenance.\nTrader rewards will also be added during maintenance on October 25, 2023 (Wed).\nGet up to 1000\n\"Arcana Gems\"\n, up to 100\n\"Awakening Stars\"\n, up to 20\n\"Medals of Combat Arts\"\n, and up to 200\n\"Memoria Niter S\"\nfrom the event.\nOn certain difficulties, there's a chance that the boss monster \"La Spiritual Pump\" will drop Star Fragments.\nGet rare items and lots of EXP by using Boost Mode to increase the Drop Rate and EXP obtained!\nSee here for more details on \"Boost Mode\".\nAvatar\nAvatar Images\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nWitch Pump Mask A\nAccessory Avatar\nWitch Pump Mask B\nAccessory Avatar\nWitch Pump Mask C\nAccessory Avatar\nTrick-or-Pump A\nAccessory Avatar\nTrick-or-Pump B\nAccessory Avatar\nTrick-or-Pump C\nAccessory Avatar\nTrade \"Black Halloween Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nTrick-or-Dress Top\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Dress Bottoms\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Hat\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Vest Top\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Pants Bottoms\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Cape\n250\n1\nWitch Pump Mask A\n150\n2\nWitch Pump Mask B\n150\n2\nWitch Pump Mask C\n150\n2\nTrick-or-Pump A\n150\n2\nTrick-or-Pump B\n150\n2\nTrick-or-Pump C\n150\n2\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n25\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nExp Crystal L\n150\n5\nExp Crystal M\n100\n30\nExp Crystal S\n50\n25\nAwakening Star\n20\n15\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n6\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n6\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n6\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n6\nTrade \"White Halloween Plate\" for special items.\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n10\n30\nTrick-or-Dress Top\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Dress Bottoms\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Hat\n250\n1\nTrick-or-Cape\n250\n1\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n50\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nExp Crystal L\n150\n10\nExp Crystal M\n100\n30\nExp Crystal S\n50\n25\nAwakening Star\n20\n15\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nTrader Period\nBlack Halloween Plate: Starts after the October 11, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the November 15, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nWhite Halloween Plate: Starts after the October 18, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the November 15, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nTotal Score Reward\nYou'll earn a certain score by clearing the dungeon.\nScores earned in count toward the\n\"Total Score Reward\"\n. Your rewards will be based on your score.\nClear bonus\nBeginner\nNormal\nAdvanced\nPremium\nManiac\nBasic Clear Bonus\n25P\n25P\n25P\n25P\n25P\nSurvival Bonus\n1 person 25P\n1 person 50P\n1 person 100P\n1 person 100P\n1 person 100P\nFirst Attack, Last Attack Bonus\n1P\n2P\n6P\n21P\n21P\nThere will be Total Power restrictions for players who join \"Premium\" and \"Maniac\" difficulty Quick Parties.\nPremium: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 40,000 or higher\nManiac: Quick Party participation requirement - Total Power 60,000 or higher\n\"Premium\"\nYou can get a high score in the\n\"Premium\"\ndifficulty bonus dungeon.\nYou can clear the\n\"Premium\"\n1 time per day.\nTake it on every day to get more total rewards!\nSpecial items that can be received from Total Score Rewards\nArcana Gems×700\nMedal of Combat Arts×8\nAwakening Star×50\nGreat Red Jewel×5\nGreat Green Jewel×5\nGreat Yellow Jewel×5\nGreat Blue Jewel×5\nExp Crystal L×99\nExp Crystal M×30\nExp Crystal S×50\nMemoria Niter S×100\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nCosplay Monster\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Black Halloween Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nPumpkin Hunt\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Black Halloween Plates in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Assault Event\" NPC at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge it.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the October 11, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the November 8, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n* The high-difficulty dungeon Expert will be implemented after the October 18, 2023 (Wed) maintenance.\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete the 1F Main Quest\nBoss Monster\nLa Spiritual Pump\nDetails\nIts attacks can inflict you with Stun and Frostbite.\nOn \"Maniac\" and \"Expert\" difficulties, the enemy uses a Seal Items debuff.\nWeakness\nBlunt Element\nWater Element\nWeakness\n* Only \"Expert\"difficulty\nThrust Element\nHoly Element\nResistance\n* Only \"Expert\"difficulty\nSlash Element\nBlunt Element\nFire Element\nWater Element\nWind Element\nEarth Element\nDark Element\nCritical\nStatus Ailments and Debuffs used\nStatus ailments \"Stun\", \"Frostbite\"\nDebuff \"Seal Item\"\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nAfter you clear a \"Premium\" difficulty dungeon once, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\n\"La Spiritual Pump\" will keep appearing until time is up, even after it has been defeated.\nAfter entering the dungeon for the Assault Event, you'll have 3 minutes to clear it.\nAfter time runs out, you can skip the monster hunt log wait time by tapping the screen.\nPlates will be deleted on November 15, 2023 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2023-10-10T19:00:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2023-11-07T19:00:00+00:00"
