    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Asuna's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Asuna!\nShop\n2023-09-30 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Asuna's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Vice-Commander's Break] Asuna\n\" and \"\n[Inherited Technique] Asuna\n(MOD Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nAsuna's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Asuna guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Asuna\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Vice-Commander's Break] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nCutting Reap\nSP Cost\n36\nElement\nThrust\nSkill Cool Time\n24.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n480% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Increase critical activation for 600% when using a non-elemental skill./[Bonus] Critical damage rises by 30% x the number of Asuna Skill Records in the same set.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Inherited Technique] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSP Cost\n14\nElement\nThrust\nSkill Cool Time\n26.0\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n56\nSkill Effect\n1980% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Toukou 5/Buff] -50% damage taken for 4 sec.(Invalid when equipped by Partner)/▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 200 x the number of Yuuki Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Damage +30% to enemies when using a non-elemental skill.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nSeptember 30, 2023 (Sat) 0:00 - October 9, 2023 (Mon) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Asuna\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Asuna\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
