    "full_details": "Notices\n[Present Giveaway] Starting 9/8 (Fri) 20:00 (JST/UTC+9)! Teria's Steam® Version Gameplay\nNOTICES\n2023-09-08 18:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe manager of the SAO game club \"βeater's cafe\", Teria, will play the recently released Steam® version of SAOIF!\nIf Teria can clear the special challenge missions we have prepared, then we will even send out presents on SAOIF!\n▼Live Stream Summary\nProgram:\n[SAOIF] Teria's Steam® Version Gameplay\nDate & Time:\nScheduled for 9/8 (Fri) at 20:00 (JST/UTC+9)\nLive Stream URL:\n◆YouTube Live\nhttps://youtube.com/live/0wU5Jv5WaDw\nTapping the URL after logging in will open the YouTube or browser app.\nDon't forget to subscribe to the SAO Game Official Channel βeater's cafe YouTube channel and tap the bell mark to receive notifications!\n*Please note that the livestream may be canceled, or the content of the livestream, is subject to change without notice.\nGo to Notice List"
