    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Eydis's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Eydis!\nShop\n2023-09-04 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Eydis's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Darkness Following Sunset] Eydis\n(Accele Skill)\" and \"\n[Autumn Leaf Hot Spring] Eydis\n\" are now available!\n\"\nEydis's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Eydis guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Eydis\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Darkness Following Sunset] Eydis\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nStorm Raid\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n78\nBreak Gauge\n42\nSkill Effect\n1690% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Wind Pile/Buff] Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Wind Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Wind element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Autumn Leaf Hot Spring] Eydis\nSkill Name\nAggravated Slash/Full Bloom/Persistence\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Aggravated Slash 3] Damage to slash element weakness rises by the number of Eydis Skill Records in the same set x 20%./[Full Bloom 3] When equipping 4 or more of Eydis's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +800./[Persistence 4]Attack +20% at below 50% of your own HP.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nSeptember 4, 2023 (Mon) 0:00 - September 13, 2023 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Eydis\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Eydis\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThere is no voice production when the Accele Skill \"[Darkness Following Sunset] Eydis\" is drawn.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
