    "news_date": 1693382400,
    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "Sword Art Online Integral Factor fête ses 5,5 ans dans le monde entier ! Vous pouvez gagner des tonnes d'EXP dans la quête spéciale dès maintenant ! Acceptez la quête, déplacez-vous vers la carte désignée et effacez-la en battant les monstres pour réclamer vos récompenses. De plus, la difficulté augmente à mesure que vous progressez dans la quête.",
    "full_details": "Notices\n[5.5 Year Anniversary] \"Heapin' 20M EXP Event\" on now!\nEVENT\n2023-08-30 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 5.5 Year Anniversary!\nYou can earn tons of EXP in the special quest on now!\nAccept the quest, move to the designated map, and clear it by defeating the monsters to claim your rewards.\nPlus, the difficulty increases as you progress through the quest.\nRewards\nGet a total of 20 million EXP from quest rewards!\nAim to clear all the quests!\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Silica\" in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to accept the quest.\nEvent Period\nStarts after the August 30, 2023 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the September 13, 2023 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nQuest Rewards\nRelease Dates\nRelease Quest\nRewards\nAmount\nRelease condition\nStarts after the  August 30, 2023 Maintenance\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 1\nEXP\n100,000\nー\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nAugust 31, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 2\nEXP\n200,000\nClear the 2F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 1, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 3\nEXP\n500,000\nClear the 3F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 2, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 4\nEXP\n800,000\nClear the 4F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 3, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 5\nEXP\n1,200,000\nClear the 5F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 4, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 6\nEXP\n1,800,000\nClear the 6F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 5, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 7\nEXP\n2,400,000\nClear the 7F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 6, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 8\nEXP\n3,000,000\nClear the 8F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 7, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 9\nEXP\n4,000,000\nClear the 9F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nSeptember 8, 2023 14:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 20M EXP Event 10\nEXP\n6,000,000\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nImportant\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
