    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAOIF Game Strategy Meeting 2023] The Evening Fireworks Display is here!\nEVENT\n2023-08-27 09:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nSAOIF Game Strategy Meeting 2023 on now!\nEnjoy the Evening Fireworks Display!\nWe're also sending out 300 fireworks for you to enjoy at the Night Beach!\n▼ Event Period\nAugust 27, 2023 (Sun) 20:00 - 22:00 (JST/UTC+9)\n* Regardless of the event period, you can see fireworks at the Night Beach every day from 19:00 to 23:59 .\n▼ Fireworks Distribution Period\nAugust 27, 2023 (Sun) 18:00 - 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n▼ Limited-Edition T-Shirt Distribution Period\nAugust 27, 2023 (Sun) 20:00 - 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nItem Name\nAvatar Images\nSAOIF Strategy Mtg T-Shirt F\n▼Important\nIf you have not received your fireworks or limited-edition T-shirt during the distribution period, please try logging in again.\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
