    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] In celebration of the SAO Game Strategy Meeting 2023, we're offering a free once daily 11x Order!\nShop\n2023-08-26 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSAO Game Strategy Meeting 2023 Opening Celebration!\nGet a free 11x Order each day with the \"\nSAO Game Strategy Meeting 2023 Free Once Daily 11x Order\n\"!\nThe lineup only includes Silica, Lisbeth, and Yui Skill Records that have appeared in an Order up until 2020!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sparkling Easter] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nRapid Ray\nSP Cost\n14\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n8.0\nSwitch Gauge\n88\nBreak Gauge\n88\nSkill Effect\n950% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Oak's Guardian 4/Buff] Every Status Ailments Res. will +100% for 6 sec./▲[Bonus] Attack +20% to enemies when using break.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Wishful Prayer Block] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nBattle with Ease, Precise Attack Boost\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n50\nHP\n1525\nSkill Effect\n[Battle with Ease 4] Attack +25% while the buff that gradually recovers HP depending on the Skill Record is in effect./●[Precise Attack Boost 3] Critical rate +15% while the buff to raise critical rate is in effect.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Unbreaking Will] Yui\nSkill Name\nFirst Aid/Devotion\nAttack\n65\nDefense\n42\nHP\n1675\nSkill Effect\n●[First Aid 4]Recovers a max of 1% HP per 3 sec, when HP falls below 75%./[Devotion 4] Attack +20% when HP is >75%.\n* Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nCheers from Yui\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 30% recovers.\n* Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Period\nAugust 26, 2023 (Sat) 12:00 - September 1, 2023 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nThere is no single Order.\nDuring the event, players can try the 11x Order once a day.\nNew days begin at 4:00am every day (JST/UTC+9).\nIncludes ★2–★4 Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
