    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3! Get ★4 Skill Records with backgrounds! The \"SAO Game Strategy Meeting 2023 Celebration Order\" is here!\nShop\n2023-08-23 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSAO Game Strategy Meeting 2023 Opening Celebration!\nThe \"\nSAO Game Strategy Meeting 2023 Celebration Order\n\" is here, featuring ★4 Skill Records with seasonal backgrounds, ★4 birthday Skill Records, and more!\nOn Steps 1 and 2, the\ndrop rate for ★4 Skill Records is 8%\n!\nOn Step 3, the\ndrop rate for ★4 Skill Records is increased to 15%\nand\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Evangelical Cantata] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFlame Blast\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n26\nBreak Gauge\n17\nSkill Effect\n1310% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Bride of Passion] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nPiercing Spark\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n27\nSkill Effect\n1310% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] Critical damage +100%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Rulid's Protector] Alice\nSkill Name\nAqua Boost/Icy Shield\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Aqua Boost 4] Elemental damage other than water dealt to enemies -50%, and water element's damage to enemies +40%./[Icy Shield 4] Adds a buff when you hit using Switch. Your defense increases for 40 sec. (STACK 10)+0.3% per 1 STACK. (Invalid when equipped by Partner)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[A Knight's Journey] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nBlue Rose Swipe\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n11.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n22\nSkill Effect\n1250% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during 20 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 200 x the number of Eugeo Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Secret Present] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nChristmas Impulse\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n59\nBreak Gauge\n60\nSkill Effect\n1270% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Holy Force 5/Buff (PT)] Holy element damage +20% for you and your party for 5 sec./[PT Weakness Attack 4/Buff] When equipping 8 of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, critical damage +20% for you and your party for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[My Feelings] Silica\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Earth Boost/More Deban\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Earth Boost 4] Elemental damage other than earth dealt to enemies -50%, and earth element's damage to enemies +40%./[More Deban 1] When equipping 1 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Wishing Upon A Daruma] Yui\nSkill Name\nSpirit Unity/Power Rise/Flame Conversion/Rebel Against the System\nAttack\n46\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Spirit Unity 3] + 5 increase to Awakening rate./[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Flame Conversion 4]Water element's damage to enemies -10% and fire element's damage to enemies +25%./[Rebel Against the System 4] When equipping 1 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Just the Right Temperature] Agil\nSkill Name\nPurifying Flame/Gale Blade/Break Attack\nAttack\n51\nDefense\n48\nHP\n2875\nSkill Effect\n[Purifying Flame 4] Deals +20% Fire element's damage to enemy./[Gale Blade 4] Deals +20% Wind element's damage to enemy./[Break Attack 4] Attack +35% to enemies when using break.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nAfter the Ausust 23, 2023 (Wed) maintenance - September 3, 2023 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n2,000 Arcana Gems\n8% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP2\n2,000 Arcana Gems\n8% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP3\n4,000 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed! 15% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
