    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(8/23)\nMAINT.\n2023-08-22 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n8/23, 2023 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 83F\"\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] \"Intensive Training Event VS Kirito\" begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to \"Kada Hunt\"\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 8/23 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 38\n\"Lizard Warrior Attack! [Returning]\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
