    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(7/27)\nMAINT.\n2023-07-27 12:20:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\n-Scheduled maintenance dates\nJuly 27, 2023 13:00 to 17:00 (JST/UTC+9)\n* There may be changes with the date.\n-Maintenance Contents\n- Fixing an issue where the number of items dropped by monsters in some areas, excluding the Underground Labyrinth, was different from what was intended\n- Fixing an issue where the return point was not set to Blackiron Palace when defeated in Underground Labyrinth B2\n- Making changes so that you can enter the Log Cabin with an Assist Party\n- Adjusting server equipment.\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\nGo to Notice List"
