    "full_details": "Notices\n[SAO Games 10th Anniversary] One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3! Get ★4 Skill Records with backgrounds! The SAO Games 10th Anniversary Special Order is here!\nShop\n2023-07-26 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Game Series 10th Anniversary!\nThe \"\nSAO Games 10th Anniversary Special Order\n\" is here, featuring ★4 Skill Records with seasonal backgrounds, ★4 birthday Skill Records, and more!\nOn Steps 1 and 2, the\ndrop rate for ★4 Skill Records is 8%\n!\nOn Step 3, the\ndrop rate for ★4 Skill Records is increased to 15%\nand\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[A Plan for the New Year] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nBurning Wave\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n84\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Flame Pile/Buff] Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Flame Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Fire element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Shining Heart] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nClod of Earth Hit\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n28\nBreak Gauge\n18\nSkill Effect\n1380% damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Earth Force 4/Buff] Earth element damage +15% for 15 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] It will Frostbite (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] Turn the enemy with slash Element into Frostbite (Stack 5) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Gunner's Song] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nGround Shot\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n43\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1270% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Carefully Down the Chimney] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nNight Invasion\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1600% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Dark Pile/Buff] Dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Dark Pile/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, dark element damage +1% per stack (Stack9) during 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Duration\nAfter the July 26, 2023 (Wed) maintenance - August 3, 2023 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n2,000 Arcana Gems\n8% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP2\n2,000 Arcana Gems\n8% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP3\n4,000 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed! 15% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
