    "full_details": "Notices\n\"The Call of Summer Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed per 11 Orders!\nShop\n2023-07-04 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne ★4 Skill Record of a summertime character is guaranteed per 11 Orders!\n\"\nThe Call of Summer Selection Order\n\" is on!\n- Duration\nJuly 4, 2023 (Tue) 17:00 - July 16, 2023 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 250 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Sunlight on the Beach] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nCross Splash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n43\nSkill Effect\n1330% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Summer Shot by the Shore] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nSplash Fall\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n22.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1240% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Hands down 4/Buff] 30 sec, the critical rate will increase a little, the higher the Max HP is.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Vega in the Starry Sky] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nRising Pillar\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1270% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to thrusting +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Starry Sky Eagle Eye] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nFire Shoot\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n36\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Blaze 4/Buff] Attack +20 per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./▲[Bonus] The lower your own HP, damage increases against monsters not targeting you. (max 100%)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
