    "full_details": "Notices\n[6/28 13:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] \"Event rewards\" Added!  [Holiday Campaign] The \"Golem Assault\" is here! Get lots of EXP from the hordes of monsters!\nEVENT\n2023-06-28 13:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[6/28 13:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nItems have been added to the Trader.\nExchange \"Yellow Golem Plates\" for the added items.\nAdded Items\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n25\nExp Crystal L\n200\n5\nRestorative Potion\n3\n60\nLife Potion\n9\n10\nEmergency Crystal\n9\n15\nCleansing Potion\n9\n10\nRevive Crystal\n18\n20\nRecord Frame L\n5\n20\nGlare Dragon Stone\n5\n20\n* \"Yellow Golem Plates\" will be deleted on July 12, 2023 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nTrader Period\nUntil maintenance begins on July 12, 2023 (Wed)\n-----------------------------\n[6/21 13:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nThe high-difficulty dungeon\n\"Expert\"\nand items were added during the June 21, 2023 (Wed) maintenance.\nHigh-difficulty dungeon,\n\"Expert\"\nadded\nItem use is restricted while inside the dungeon, and Revive Crystals can only be used once.\nThe Recommended Total Power is 150,000. The monster has weaknesses that are different from those on other difficulty levels.\nThe score earned is not added to the Total Score Reward, but you will receive rewards based on your score.\nClear bonus\nExpert\nBasic Clear Bonus\n25P\nSurvival Bonus\n1 person 100P\nFirst Attack, Last Attack Bonus\n36P\n\"Expert\" Score Rewards\nScore\nRewards\nAmount\n5000\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n10000\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n15000\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n20000\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n25000\nAwakening Star\n10\n30000\nExp Crystal L\n8\n35000\nLife Potion\n5\n40000\nRelease Crystal (M)\n10\n50000\nMartial Arts Text\n5\n60000\nRestorative Crystal\n2\n70000\nGreat Red Jewel\n2\n80000\nGreat Green Jewel\n2\n90000\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n2\n100000\nGreat Blue Jewel\n2\n125000\nAwakening Star\n10\n150000\nExp Crystal L\n10\n175000\nLife Potion\n10\n200000\nRelease Crystal (L)\n1\n225000\nMartial Arts Text\n10\n250000\nRestorative Crystal\n3\nChallenge Rewards\nChallenge Name\nPrimary Reward\nAmount\nFight to the End\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\nCompleted without any tumble\nExp Crystal L\n10\nCompleted with party\nRestorative Crystal\n5\nItems Added\n\"Green Golem Plate\" were added as drops.\nAchievement rewards and Trader reward items were also added.\nExchange \"Green Golem Plate\" for the added items.\nAdded Items\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nArcana Gems×10\n10\n30\nMemoria Niter S\n100\n50\nMedal of Combat Arts\n350\n5\nExp Crystal L\n200\n10\nExp Crystal M\n100\n30\nExp Crystal S\n50\n25\nAwakening Star\n20\n15\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n5\nRelease Crystal (M)\n100\n4\nRelease Crystal (S)\n30\n30\nMartial Arts Text\n30\n6\nRestorative Potion\n1\n100\nLife Potion\n6\n20\nEmergency Crystal\n6\n15\nCleansing Potion\n6\n10\nRevive Crystal\n6\n20\nRecord Frame L\n3\n25\nGlare Dragon Stone\n3\n25\n* \"Green Golem Plate\" will be deleted on July 12, 2023 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nTrader Period\nUntil maintenance begins on July 12, 2023 (Wed)\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nSolid Body\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Green Golem Plate in the time period\nRevive Crystal×1\n-----------------------------\nGo to Notice List"
