    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Yuuki's Birthday Order\" is here! Featuring new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3! All ★4 Skill Records are Yuuki!\nShop\n2023-05-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Yuuki's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Putting Off the Hard Part] Yuuki\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Starting With a Warm-Up] Yuuki\n(Awakening Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nYuuki's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Yuuki guaranteed on Step 3!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3, one ★4 \"Yuuki\" is guaranteed!\nFeaturing new ★4 Skill Records on Step 2 and Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Putting Off the Hard Part] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Fortitude\nAttack\n49\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 4] Attack +400./[Fortitude 4] Defense +50% at below 25% of your own HP.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSecret of the Legendary Sword\n[When Rush Activates]Extends the effect of Rush by 5 sec.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Starting With a Warm-Up] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSP Cost\n14\nElement\nSlash\nSkill Cool Time\n26.0\nSwitch Gauge\n66\nBreak Gauge\n98\nSkill Effect\n1850% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dynamics 3/Buff] Non-elemental damage +40% for 8 sec./[Friendship's Combination/Buff] When equipping 1 or more of Asuna's Skill Records in the same set, Switch damage multiples +300% for 10 sec./▲[Bonus] Attack rises 150 x the number of Yuuki Skill Records in the same set.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSecret of the Legendary Sword\n[When Rush Activates]Extends the effect of Rush by 5 sec.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nMay 23, 2023 (Tue) 0:00 - June 1, 2023 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1,250 Arcana Gems (50% Off)\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nOne ★4 \"Yuuki\" guaranteed!\nOn every Step, all ★4 Skill Records are \"Yuuki\"!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
