    "full_details": "Notices\n【5 Year Anniversary】One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3! Get ★4 Skill Records with backgrounds! The \"Worldwide 5 Year Anniversary! Brilliant Order\" is here!\nShop\n2023-03-26 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 5 Year Anniversary!\nThe \"\nWorldwide 5 Year Anniversary! Brilliant Order\n\" is here, featuring ★4 Skill Records with seasonal backgrounds!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn all Steps, the\ntotal drop rate for ★4 Skill Records is 8.0%\n!\nAdditionally, on Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Daily Colors] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nHydro Slash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n42\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1290% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using water skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Shrine Carrier Supporter] Yui\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nSpreading Wind\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n72\nBreak Gauge\n31\nSkill Effect\n1560% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nIncrease in break gauge to enemy by +20% → 40% → 60%\n★4[The Taste of an Autumn Night] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nBlaze Gong\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n750% damage (Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +75% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark)./[Bonus] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Dashing Over Town] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nNight Thorn\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n96\nBreak Gauge\n50\nSkill Effect\n1650% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 5) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage./[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 15) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n- Duration\nMarch 26, 2023 (Sun) 17:00 - April 8, 2023 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n11 Order for 1,250 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP2\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP3\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed! 8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
