    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice of Schedule Changes\nNOTICES\n2023-03-24 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\n▼Notice of Schedule Changes\nThe maintenance that was scheduled for 3/29 (Wed) has been changed to 3/30 (Thu).\nDue to this change, upcoming planned events will proceed as follows.\n\"Increased Boost Mode Multiplier Campaign\"\nThe period will be extended until maintenance on 3/30/2023 (Thu).\n【5 Year Anniversary】\"Daily Dungeon +2\"\nThe event period as been changed from \"until maintenance on 3/29/2023 (Wed)\" to \"until 13:59 (JST/UTC+9) on 3/29/2023 (Wed)\".\n【5 Year Anniversary】\"White Day Assault\"\nThe event period as been changed from \"until maintenance on 3/29/2023 (Wed)\" to \"until 13:59 (JST/UTC+9) on 3/29/2023 (Wed)\".\n【5 Year Anniversary】\"Guild Strategy Event  Millennium Woods\"\nThe event period as been changed from \"until maintenance on 3/29/2023 (Wed)\" to \"until 13:59 (JST/UTC+9) on 3/29/2023 (Wed)\".\nHunting Event \"Greedy Kobold Lord Hunt\"\nThe new high difficulty and rewards planned to be added at maintenance on 3/29/2023 (Wed) have been rescheduled to be added at maintenance on 3/30/2023 (Thu).\n【5 Year Anniversary】Scenario event \"The Way of the Swordsmen\"\nThe new high difficulty and rewards planned to be added at maintenance on 3/29/2023 (Wed) have been rescheduled to be added at maintenance on 3/30/2023 (Thu).\n33rd \"Guild of Guilds\"\nThe time for the \"Wander Gear K\" and \"Wander Cape K\" avatars to be removed from the production list has been changed from maintenance on 3/29/2023 (Wed) to maintenance on 3/30/2023 (Thu).\nPlease note that the production materials \"Shinigami Cloth\" and \"Shinigami Blade\" will be removed the day before on 3/29/2023 (Wed) at 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\"\nThe \"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" announced on the official \"Weekend IF!\" live stream has been adjusted to begin after maintenace on 3/30/2023 (Thu).\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\nGo to Notice List"
