    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Lovely Spring Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nShop\n2023-03-19 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne ★4 Spring-Themed Skill Record Guaranteed!\nThe \"\nLovely Spring Selection Order\n\" is on!\n- Duration\nMarch 19, 2023 (Sun) 0:00 - April 9, 2023 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Loyal Hammer] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nWatering Fall\nSP Cost\n36\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n21\nSkill Effect\n750% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Mark/Debuff] The next attack the enemy receives will induce double damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Sparkling Easter] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nRapid Ray\nSP Cost\n14\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n8.0\nSwitch Gauge\n88\nBreak Gauge\n88\nSkill Effect\n950% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Oak's Guardian 4/Buff] Every Status Ailments Res. will +100% for 6 sec./▲[Bonus] Attack +20% to enemies when using break.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Shy Lapin] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nLightning Stitch\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n70\nSkill Effect\n700% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Bonus Attack 4/Buff] Additional damage according to own Attack for 10 sec./▲[Bonus] Attack +20% to enemies when using break.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Pretty Holmes] Asuna\nSkill Name\nThere's a case!/There's only one truth!\nAttack\n49\nDefense\n40\nHP\n1550\nSkill Effect\n[There's a case!] Critical damage +15%./[There's only one truth!] ATK +20% to enemy that has their weakness found.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Master Detective] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nDisclose Impact\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n10.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n17\nSkill Effect\n800% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Find Weakness 4/Debuff] Finds the enemy's weakeness for 15 sec at a specific rate.　The critical rate +20% to enemy that has their weakness found./▲▲[Bonus] Additional damage to enemy of 10% own current HP.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Spring Lilac Dress] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Earth Conversion/Surging Sword Spirit\nAttack\n60\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Earth Conversion 4] Wind element's damage to enemies -10% and earth element's damage to enemies +25%./[Surging Sword Spirit 4] Attack rises by 3.5% x the number of Yuuki Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Cherry Blossom Dress] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nAqua Impulse\nSP Cost\n33\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n47\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n1100% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Small Mark/Debuff] When the target is hit using the Switch, The next attack the enemy receives will induce 1.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)/▲[Bonus] Recovers your SP by 10 when critical is activated with this skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Flower Maiden in Bloom] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nExtreme Fever\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n80\nBreak Gauge\n19\nSkill Effect\n1350% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
