    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Pastel Maid Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2023-03-15 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Alice, Sachi, and Silica are maids in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nPastel Maid Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Time to Show My Skills] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nAqua Riposte\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n33\nSkill Effect\n1470% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Ultimate Light 4/Buff] Own critical rate raises, and reduces the next damage taken (Stack 5) during 20 sec.Critical rate +1% per stack, and reduces the next damage taken by -1% per stack.Each effects will be removed by taking damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces all skill's cool times by 3 → 6 → 9 sec when hitting with skills.\n★4[Spick and Span] Alice\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Auto Learning\nAttack\n63\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 5] Attack +500./[Auto Learning 5] Adds additional effects based on the number of Alice's Skill Records equipped in the same set.2 or more: Critical rate +20%.3 or more: Defense +5%.4 or more: Max HP +10%.5 or more: Critical damage +20%.6 or more: Attack +35%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Mop Race] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nWater Shaft\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n54\nBreak Gauge\n27\nSkill Effect\n1800% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Stigma/Debuff] Increases damage taken by enemies for 18 sec (Stack 3) +0.5% for every Stack 1./[Stigma/Debuff] When the target is hit using the Switch, increases damage taken by enemies for 18 sec (Stack 9) +0.5% for every Stack 1.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAccele Skill\nIn effect30sec.\nUse Switch with the Switch gauge at the 2nd level or more to activate Accele Skills!\nDuring the effect time, Swords Skills that meet the conditions will have increased power, and reduced skill CT and SP consumption.\n★4[Artistic Cooking Challenge] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nDead Flash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n36\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Blaze 4/Buff] Attack +20 per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./[Muscle Atrophy 4/Debuff] Enemy's attack -0.3% per stack (Stack 3) for 20.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nAfter the March 15, 2023 (Wed) maintenance - April 14, 2023 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
