    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Youkai Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nShop\n2023-01-28 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nGet one\nyoukai-themed\n★4 Skill Record guaranteed\n!\nThe \"\nYoukai Selection Order\n\" is on!\n- Duration\nJanuary 28, 2023 (Sat) 17:00 - Before the February 4, 2023 (Sat) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Lady Demon] Alice\nSkill Name\nEnhance Berserk/Enhance Paralysis Res./Hostility: Poison\nAttack\n62\nDefense\n28\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Enhance Berserk 4] When the player is Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite, Curse, Debility), Attack +25%./●[Enhance Paralysis Res. 4] Paralysis Res. increase 70%./[Hostility: Poison] When equipping 1 of Kirito's Skill Records in a set, adds poison effect on yourself for 30 sec when you hit using Switch (Stack 1).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Lucky Ninetails] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nStrong Curtain\nSP Cost\n12\nElement\n-\nSkill Cool Time\n7.0\nSwitch Gauge\n0\nBreak Gauge\n0\nSkill Effect\n[Flourish 4/Buff] Debility resistance +28% for 60 sec./[Hands down 4/Buff] 60 sec, the critical rate will increase a little, the higher the Max HP is.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Black Ogre Beater] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nRock Tempest\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n90\nBreak Gauge\n82\nSkill Effect\n1220% damage (10x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Lisbeth's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500./[Bonus] Restore 8000 HP when hitting with this skill while using switch.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Maiden's Metal Club] Sachi\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nSpreading Shade\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n104\nBreak Gauge\n25\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (8x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n* More than regular increase in switch gauge.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Demon Rulekeeper] Lisbeth\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nVolcano Blow\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n30\nBreak Gauge\n30\nSkill Effect\n1230% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[PT Enhance Blunt 4/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +30% for your party for 20 sec./[Thrust Attack Down 3/Debuff] Enemy thrust attack -15% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Black-Winged Sniper] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nShine Blast Shot\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n16.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n670% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] The lower your own HP, damage increases against monsters not targeting you. (max 250%)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Snow Singer] Yuna\nWeapon Type\nShield\nSkill Name\nWater Slap\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Cool Time\n10.0\nSwitch Gauge\n20\nBreak Gauge\n20\nSkill Effect\n430% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Streaming Pattern 4/Buff] Petrify resistance +80% for 10 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] It will Frostbite (Stack 3) at specific rate for 30 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] When the target is hit using the Switch, make it Frostbite (Stack 5) for 30 sec./▲[Bonus] Raises 2 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Inseparable Bond] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nStardust Rain\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n11.0\nSwitch Gauge\n65\nBreak Gauge\n28\nSkill Effect\n- Charging -\n1330% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/▲[Bonus] All the Stack Buff effected to the enemy will -2 in numbers of Stacks (Will not be below 1)./[Bonus] Damage +50% towards the monsters not targetted to the player.\n- Uncharged -\n810% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] All the Stack Buff effected to the enemy will -2 in numbers of Stacks (Will not be below 1).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
