    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"MOD Step-Up Order\" is here! One ★4 MOD Skill is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2023-01-21 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe \"\nMOD Step-Up Order\n\" is here!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nAdditionally, on Step 3, one\n★4 MOD Skill is guaranteed!\nMore MOD Skill Details Here\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Put Your Heart Into It] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSP Cost\n14\nElement\nSlash\nSkill Cool Time\n26.0\nSwitch Gauge\n44\nBreak Gauge\n56\nSkill Effect\n1800% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Toukou 5/Buff] -50% damage taken for 4 sec.(Invalid when equipped by Partner)/▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 150 x the number of Yuuki Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Damage +30% to enemies when using a non-elemental skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Strict Butler] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nShade Shot\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n34\nBreak Gauge\n22\nSkill Effect\n1210% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] The lower your own HP, damage increases against monsters not targeting you. (max 100%)/[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Brimming With Wisdom] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nRumbling Blaze\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n46\nBreak Gauge\n47\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using fire skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Step Offers/Details\nJanuary 21, 2023 (Sat) 17:00 - February 4, 2023 (Sat) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are MOD Skill!\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are MOD Skill!\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nAll ★4 Skill Records are MOD Skill!\nOne ★4 MOD Skill guaranteed!!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
