    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(1/18)\nMAINT.\n2023-01-17 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n1/18, 2023 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nChapter 2 \"Aincrad 63F\"\n\"63F Start Dash Event\" begins\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 31 begins\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to the Tons of EXP Event \"Wonder Animal Assault\"\n\"Multiple Rounds: 2x Experience Subquest Campaign\" begins\n\"Daily Dungeon +1\" begins\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 1/18 Maintenance\nHunting Event \"Rabbit Lord Hunt\"\n\"Animal Selection Order\"\n【Holiday Campaign】\"Labyrinth Strategy Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
