    "full_details": "Notices\n【Holiday Campaign】The \"Holiday Campaign! Grand Order\" is here! ★4 birthday Skill Records are part of this lineup!\nShop\n2022-12-29 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nThe \"\nHoliday Campaign! Grand Order\n\" is here, and ★4 Skill Records are part of this lineup, including birthday Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn all Steps, the\ntotal drop rate for ★4 Skill Records is 8.0%\n!\nAdditionally, on Step 3,\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Relaxing at the Campsite] Sinon\nSkill Name\nOpposing Heart/Resonance of Flame\nAttack\n62\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2575\nSkill Effect\n[Opposing Heart 3] Attack +18% to the enemies that have a buff effect/[Resonance of Flame 4] Fire element damage +30% to the enemies that have a buff effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Little Monster] Yui\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nRising Tornado\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1320% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Singer Under the Trees] Yuna\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Thin Ice\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Thin Ice 4] Defense -30% and during the buff effect for increased max HP the HP -99% every 3 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nDodge\n[During Rush] Evasion rate +4%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nDecember 29, 2022 (Thu) 17:00 - January 7, 2023 (Sat) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n11 Order for 1,250 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP2\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP3\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed! 8.0% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
