    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"New Year's Eve Selection Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-12-26 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nOne ★4 Skill Record\nfrom the New Year's Orders up until 2022 is\nguaranteed\n!\nThe \"\nNew Year's Eve Selection Order\n\" is on!\n- Duration\nDecember 26, 2022 (Mon) 0:00 - January 3, 2023 (Tue) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Roll for Victory] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nFeint Shadow\nSP Cost\n35\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Cool Time\n26.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n35\nSkill Effect\n1230% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[PT Weakness Attack 4/Buff] Critical damage +20% for you and your party for 15 sec./[PT Precise Attack 4/Buff] When equipping 8 of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, party critical rate +30% for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Gorgeous Osechi] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nVertical Wind\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n52\nBreak Gauge\n40\nSkill Effect\n1290% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Scent of a New Year] Argo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nSurging Frame\nSP Cost\n22\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Cool Time\n10.0\nSwitch Gauge\n48\nBreak Gauge\n99\nSkill Effect\n1340% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Wide]/▲▲[Bonus] Critical rate +300% towards enemies on break.［Bonus］Critical damage +100% towards enemies on break.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Blue Lion God] Eugeo\nSkill Name\nPurifying Flame/Gale Blade/Outmatch\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n46\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Purifying Flame 4] Deals +20% Fire element's damage to enemy./[Gale Blade 4] Deals +20% Wind element's damage to enemy./●[Outmatch 5] 500 of additional damage to enemy when attack.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nLightning Flash\n[During Rush] Critical rate +20%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Wishful Prayer Block] Lisbeth\nSkill Name\nBattle with Ease, Precise Attack Boost\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n50\nHP\n1525\nSkill Effect\n[Battle with Ease 4] Attack +25% while the buff that gradually recovers HP depending on the Skill Record is in effect./●[Precise Attack Boost 3] Critical rate +15% while the buff to raise critical rate is in effect.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Powerful Pound] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWind Reap\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n14.0\nSwitch Gauge\n33\nBreak Gauge\n68\nSkill Effect\n1170% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500.\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Light of Hope] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFortune Square\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Cool Time\n12.0\nSwitch Gauge\n40\nBreak Gauge\n19\nSkill Effect\n850% damage (4x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Super Lucky!/Debuff] A 10% chance that the next attack the enemy receives will induce 2.5x damage.(Applies to other party member's attacks. Effect will disappear after 10 sec if not activated.)/[Lucky!/Buff] A 25% chance of critical rate +50% for 10 sec./[Kind of Lucky!/Buff] A 75% chance of +1000 additional damage when attacking for 20 sec./[Uh oh!/Status Ailments]A 5% chance of inflicting Curse on yourself for 20 sec.\n* Chance of activating all effects of this skill is tripled when hitting with switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Great Ambition] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nCleansing Arrow\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nHoly\nSkill Cool Time\n10.0\nSwitch Gauge\n38\nBreak Gauge\n22\nSkill Effect\n700% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Critical rate +30% when your own HP is above 75%./[Bonus] Critical damage +25%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
