    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(11/24)\nMAINT.\n2022-11-22 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n11/24, 2022 14:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\nThe Scenario Event \"An Oath from Long Ago\" is back\nYour progression will be carried over from the last time this event was held.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAchievements and achievement progress\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\nAdded rewards and high difficulty to the Tons of EXP Event \"Gibbon Assault [Returning]\"\n【Holiday Campaign】\"Daily Anniversary Dungeon\" begins\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 11/24 Maintenance\n\"Theatrical Release Celebration Hippocampus Hunt\"\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 29\n\"School Festival Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
