    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Theatrical Release Celebration Scherzo of Deep Night Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-10-22 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe SWORD ART ONLINE Progressive: Scherzo of Deep Night movie is here!\nKirito, Asuna, Mito, and Argo are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nTheatrical Release Celebration Scherzo of Deep Night Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Master Key of Strategy] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nAir Slant\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1370% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec./▲[Bonus] Restore 8000 HP when hitting with this skill while using switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Sharp Aiming] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nEarth Riposte\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1420% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces all skill's cool times by 3 → 6 → 9 sec when hitting with skills.\n★4[Sharp Shredding Claws] Argo\nSkill Name\nCoordinated Assault/Enhance Clotting\nAttack\n64\nDefense\n34\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Coordinated Assault 4] While switch damage mulitiplier+ buff is effective, defense will decrease by 500 and attack will increase by 20%./●[Enhance Clotting 4] Bleed damage -50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Rebel Scythe User] Mito\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Enhance Curse Res./Hold the Front\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2725\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 4] Attack +400./●[Enhance Curse Res. 4] Curse resistance +70%/[Hold the Front 4] Recovers a max of 5%+200 HP per 3 sec when HP is under 50%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nOctober 22, 2022 (Sat) 0:00 - Before the November 16, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
