    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Silica's Birthday Order\" is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Silica\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-10-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Silica's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Happy Days] Silica\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Breathe Together] Silica\n(Awakening Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nSilica's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Silica Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Silica is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Silica and are at an increased 6.0% Drop Rate!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Happy Days] Silica\nSkill Name\nPoisonous Blow/Enhance Slash\nAttack\n54\nDefense\n52\nHP\n2125\nSkill Effect\n[Poisonous Blow 4] Attack +24% against poisoned enemies./[Enhance Slash 3] Damage done to enemies weak to slashing +15%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Breathe Together] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nStone Cutter\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1280% damage (Single Foe)[Motion Range]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec./▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 1% per 1 Stack of enemy's Status Ailment (Poison).\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nStack Boost\n[When Rush Activates] Raises 10 stacks for all Stack buffs that are on yourself.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nOctober 4, 2022 (Tue) 0:00 - October 13, 2022 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n6.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Silica!　One ★4 Silica guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
