    "full_details": "Notices\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3! Get ★4 Skill Records with backgrounds! The Brilliant Order is here!\nShop\n2022-09-25 00:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nThe \"\nBrilliant Order\n\" is here, featuring ★4 Skill Records with seasonal backgrounds!\nOn Steps 1 and 2, the\ndrop rate for ★4 Skill Records is 8%\n!\nOn Step 3, the\ndrop rate for ★4 Skill Records is increased to 15%\nand\none ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Flower Arrangement] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWater Thrust\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n630% damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Attack +2000 against enemies with the slash element./[Bonus] 90% increase with critical damage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Dragon God's Leap] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHatchet Ground\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, the damage you receive decreases at 50%.(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated)./[Celebration4/Buff] Your HP recovers for 30 sec.(1.5%/3sec)Effect will be removed with damage.\n* Collecting aggro from enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Trick Cookie] Argo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nAqua Split\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n740% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲[Bonus] Attack + 50% in proportion with your remaining HP (the more remaining HP, the higher)./[Bonus] Critical damage +15% against enemies with the thrust element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the September 25, 2022 0:30 - October 2, 2022 0:29 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n2,000 Arcana Gems\n8% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP2\n2,000 Arcana Gems\n8% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\nSTEP3\n4,000 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed! 15% total Drop Rate for ★4 Skill Records!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
