    "snippet": "Avis destiné aux utilisateurs se connectant à « Sword Art Online Integral Factor ».  La maintenance que nous avons mise en œuvre à partir du 21/09/2022 à 13h00 a été terminée le 21/09/2022 à 17h00 (JST/UTC+9). Voici les nouvelles mises à jour.  ▼Événements nouvellement implémentés et nouveaux \"94F\" installés \"94F Start Dash Event\" commence Ajout de \"Tales o...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(9/21)\nMAINT.\n2022-09-20 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n9/21, 2022 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n\"94F\" installed\n\"94F Start Dash Event\" begins\nAdded \"Tales of Series Battle Rush\" Event rewards\nThe Scenario Event \"Search for the Phantom Mushroom ['20 Returning]\" is back\nYour progression will be carried over from the last time this event was held.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAchievements and achievement progress\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\nWorldwide 4.5 Year Anniversary! \"Multiple Rounds: 4x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n\"Chaos Showdown\" UPDATE\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 9/21 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 27\nWorldwide 4.5 Year Anniversary! The Sweep Battle: Raging Heard of Boars\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
