    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"A Taste of Autumn Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-09-14 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Leafa, Silica, and Argo are enjoying the harvest season in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nA Taste of Autumn Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[The Richness of Autumn] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Shine Boost/The Legendary Sword's Rule\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Shine Boost 4] Elemental damage other than holy dealt to enemies -50%, and holy element's damage to enemies +40%./[The Legendary Sword's Rule] Attack +20% when not equipping any Kirito's Skill Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Fresh Fruit] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWhirl Destruction\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n660% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/▲▲[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 175%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Beware of Spikes] Argo\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nLightning Fall\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1260% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +50% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark, Thrust Erosion Mark)./[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Harvest of Nature's Mountain] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nSpinning Earth Dive\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1290% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Silica's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the September 14, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends October 6, 2022 (Thu) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
