    "news_category": "EVENT",
    "snippet": "SWORD ART ONLINE 10e anniversaire ! L'événement scénario \"Le Rosaire de la Mère\" est de retour !  Le scénario d'événement « Le Rosaire de la Mère » La rumeur dit que « Yuuki » continue de gagner contre quiconque est prêt à la défier dans un « Duel de rue » sous le Grand Arbre. Intéressé de voir comment \"Yuuki\" se bat, \"Lisbeth\" et...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nMother's Rosary is back! Get your hands on the limited-edition ★3 Yuuki Skill Record, stamps, and more!\nEVENT\n2022-09-11 00:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSWORD ART ONLINE 10th Anniversary!\nThe Scenario Event \"Mother's Rosary\" is back!\nThe Scenario Event \"Mother's Rosary\"\nWord has it that \"Yuuki\" keeps winning against anyone who is willing to challenge her to a \"Street Duels\" beneath the Great Tree.\nInterested in seeing how \"Yuuki\" fights,\"Lisbeth\" asks the player to escort her to the Great Tree.\nRewards\nGather \"Wolf Beast Chain\", tradable items acquired as event rewards and drop items, and exchange them at the Trader for a\n\"Yuuki Skill Record\"\n, a Limited-edition Stamp, and the \"Life Potion\" item that recovers more HP than the \"Restorative Potion\".\nYou can also get up to 15 \"Medals of Combat Arts\", up to 50 \"Awakening Stars\", up to 10 each of all kinds of \"Great Jewels\", and up to 300\n\"Arcana Gems\"\nfrom all the events.\nSkill Record\n★3[Girl on the Run] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nQuintuple Pierce\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash\nSkill Effect\n590% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Yuuki's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +150./[Bonus] Damage +15% to enemies when using a non-elemental skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMemory Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nLet's go!\n* These stamps that have been added are entries received from the offline SAOIF avatar and stamp design contest in 2019.\nTrade \"Wolf Beast Chain\" for special items\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\n★3[Girl on the Run] Yuuki\n100\n1\n★3[Girl on the Run] Yuuki\n200\n5\nMemory Stamp 148\nUse to obtain the \"Let's go!\" stamp.\n50\n1\nAwakening Star\n20\n50\nLife Potion\n5\n20\nGreat Red Jewel\n40\n10\nGreat Green Jewel\n40\n10\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n40\n10\nGreat Blue Jewel\n40\n10\nTrader\nSee each Trader NPC for more info, or go to Menu > Items > Enhance/Trade > Trade Limited Items and tap the \"Trade Wolf Beast Chain\" banner.\nTrader Period\nSeptember 11, 2022 (Sun) 0:30 - Before the October 12, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nHigh difficulty\n\"Special\"\nYou can clear the\n\"Special\"\n3 times per day.\nIn addition, item use is restricted while inside the dungeon and \"Revive Crystals\" can only be used up to 3 times.\nScore Rewards\nEntry\nInterior\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n200\nWolf Beast Chain\n5\n200\nWolf Beast Chain\n10\n400\nHealing Potion\n30\n400\nHealing Potion\n50\n600\nArcana Gems\n10\n700\nArcana Gems\n10\n800\nRecord Frame Ｍ\n10\n1000\nRecord Frame Ｍ\n15\n1000\nWolf Beast Chain\n10\n1400\nWolf Beast Chain\n15\n1200\nRestorative Potion\n30\n1800\nRestorative Potion\n50\n1400\nArcana Gems\n10\n2200\nArcana Gems\n15\n1600\nWolf Beast Chain\n20\n2600\nWolf Beast Chain\n25\n1800\nCleansing Potion\n5\n3000\nCleansing Potion\n10\n2000\nRecord Frame Ｍ\n20\n3500\nRecord Frame Ｍ\n30\n2200\nWolf Beast Chain\n30\n4000\nWolf Beast Chain\n35\n2400\nArcana Gems\n10\n4500\nArcana Gems\n15\n2600\nEmergency Crystal\n10\n5000\nEmergency Crystal\n20\n2800\nRevive Crystal\n1\n5500\nRevive Crystal\n2\n3000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\n6000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n1\nDepth\nDANGER\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n250\nWolf Beast Chain\n15\n300\nWolf Beast Chain\n20\n500\nRestorative Potion\n30\n600\nRestorative Potion\n50\n1000\nArcana Gems\n20\n1200\nArcana Gems\n20\n1500\nRecord Frame Ｌ\n10\n1800\nRecord Frame Ｌ\n15\n2000\nWolf Beast Chain\n20\n3000\nWolf Beast Chain\n30\n3000\nEmergency Crystal\n30\n4200\nEmergency Crystal\n50\n4000\nArcana Gems\n20\n5400\nArcana Gems\n25\n5000\nWolf Beast Chain\n30\n6600\nWolf Beast Chain\n40\n6000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n1\n7800\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n7000\nRecord Frame Ｌ\n20\n9000\nRecord Frame Ｌ\n30\n8000\nWolf Beast Chain\n40\n10800\nWolf Beast Chain\n50\n9000\nArcana Gems\n20\n13200\nArcana Gems\n25\n10000\nHealing Crystal\n20\n15600\nHealing Crystal\n30\n11000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n5\n18000\nRelease Crystal (S)\n10\n12500\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\n21000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n3\nSpecial\nTotal scores\nScore Rewards\nAmount\n1000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n3000\nSmall Gift\n1\n5000\nMemoria Niter S\n5\n7000\nMemoria Niter S\n10\n11000\nMedal of Combat Arts\n2\nAchievement Rewards\nComplete the conditions and receive event-limited records and items from achievement rewards.\nRecord\nAchievement Requirements\nAchievement Rewards\nRetry Hell\nLet's collect a total of 2000 Wolf Beast Chains\nMedal of Combat Arts×1\nA Name for a Great Tree\nLet's collect a total of 5000 Wolf Beast Chains\nMedal of Combat Arts×2\nGot a Memory\nLet's collect a total of 10000 Wolf Beast Chains\nMedal of Combat Arts×3\nHow to Participate\nOpen the List of Events from the Menu in the upper left corner of the screen, and tap the \"Mother's Rosary\" banner to go to the \"Forest of the Great Tree\".\nOnce you're at the \"Forest of the Great Tree\", talk to \"Lisbeth\" to start the scenario quest.\nThere are 5 scenario quests. Clear them all to unlock the dungeon.\nOnce you've cleared all the scenario quests, take a look at the \"Great Tree\" on the Event Map!\n(Tapping the in-game banner will take you to the \"Forest of the Great Tree\" Event Map.)\nEvent Period\nSeptember 11, 2022 (Sun) 0:30 - Before the October 5, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nBoss Monster\nEbony Blood Fenrir\nDetails\nIt uses a wide-range piercing attack.\nWeakness\nSlash Element\nFire Element\nStatus Ailments used\nStatus ailments \"Burn\" and \"Bleed\"\nImportant\nPlease check all Rewards in the game.\nIf you receive a stamp you already own, it will not have any effect when used.\nIf the ★3 Skill Records you acquire have already reached their Limit Break max, they will be exchanged for \"Memoria Niter M\".\nIf you have previously played the \"Mother's Rosary\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAchievements and achievement progress\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\nIn this returning event, recovery items will not drop.\n\"Wolf Beast Chain\" will be deleted on October 12, 2022 (Wed) 13:59 (JST/UTC+9).\nAfter you clear a Special difficulty dungeon three times, you can't play it again until the limit resets at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nThe schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
    "startTime": "2022-09-10T15:30:00+00:00",
    "endTime": "2022-10-04T19:00:00+00:00"
