    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Tales of Series Collab Avatar Order is here! One new ★4 avatar is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-08-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nLaw's, Rinwell's, Milla's, Lloyd's, and Yuri's outfits from the Tales of series are here as avatars!\nGet one new ★4 avatar guaranteed\nin the\nTales of Series Collab Avatar Order\non now!\n【New ★4 avatar】\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nLaw's Clothes\nFull Body Avatar/Male Only\nRinwell's Clothes\nFull Body Avatar/Female Only\nMilla's Clothes\nFull Body Avatar/Female Only\nLloyd's Clothes\nFull Body Avatar/Male Only\nYuri's Clothes\nFull Body Avatar/Male Only\n- Duration\nStarts after the August 22, 2022 (Mon) maintenance and ends on September 9, 2022 (Fri) 17:59 (JST/UTC+9).\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,000 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nThere is no single Order.\nKoharu can also equip female avatars and accessories.\nSome of the avatars available in this Order have equip conditions that depend on the equipped character's gender.\nAll avatars, both female and male, are available in the Order regardless of your own character's gender.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
