    "full_details": "Notices\n[8/22 17:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE] Weekly! \"★4 Guaranteed Free 11x Order\"! One ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-08-22 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\n[8/22 17:00 (JST/UTC+9) UPDATE]\nOne ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\nThe \"\n★4 Guaranteed Free 11x Order\n\" is here!\nTake advantage of the \"\n★4 Guaranteed Free 11x Order\n\" once per event period!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Archer of Dawn] Sinon\nWeapon Type\nBow\nSkill Name\nWind Shoot\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1220% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack +25% to the enemies that have a buff effect./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Sinon's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Summer Flash] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWater Reap\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nThrust/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1200% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Water Element Weak 3/Debuff] Water element damage to monster +15% for 10 sec./▲[Bonus] Critical damage +20% against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Event Periods\n①Starts after the May 31, 2022 (Tue) maintenance and ends before the June 8, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n②Starts after the June 8, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 15, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n③Starts after the June 15, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 22, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n④Starts after the June 22, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the June 29, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑤Starts after the June 29, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 6, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑥Starts after the July 6, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 13, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑦Starts after the July 13, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the July 21, 2022 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑧Starts after the July 21, 2022 (Thu) maintenance and ends before the July 27, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑨Starts after the July 27, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 3, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑩Starts after the August 3, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 10, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑪Starts after the August 10, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 17, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑫Starts after the August 17, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 22, 2022 (Mon) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n⑬Starts after the August 22, 2022 (Mon) maintenance and ends before the August 31, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Important\nThere is no single Order.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
