    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Underworld  Grab Bag Order\" is here! Two ★4 Skill Records guaranteed! 20% ★4 Skill Record Rate!\nShop\n2022-08-07 00:30:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTen times per player!\nThe \"Underworld  Grab Bag Order\", featuring characters from the SWORD ART ONLINE –Alicization–  WoU anime, is now available!\nGet\ntwo ★4 Skill Records guaranteed\nat the \"Underworld  Grab Bag Order\"!\nThe\n20% total drop rate\ndoes not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Blue Rose in the Night Sky] Kirito\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Dark Conversion/Spirit Color\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n50\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Dark Conversion 4] Holy element's damage to enemies -10% and dark element's damage to enemies +25%./[Spirit Color] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 1 or more of Asuna's Skill Records: Max HP +10%.When equipping 1 or more of Sinon's Skill Records: Attack +20%.When equipping 1 or more of Leafa's Skill Records: Additional damage +500.When equipping 1 or more of Alice's Skill Records: Critical rate +10%.When equipping 1 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records: Critical damage +10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSwordman's Awakening\n[When Rush Activates] Recover all status ailments.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Invincible Sword] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nValiant Mist\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1420% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Jar of Ice 4/Buff] Defense +10 per stack (Stack 3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nReduces status ailment stacks by 5 → 10 → 15 on yourself, when hitting with skills while inflicted with Burn (Will not be below 1).\n★4[Golden Flower Protection] Alice\nSkill Name\nFlash Blade/ Break Attack\nAttack\n45\nDefense\n54\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Flash Blade 4] Critical rate for normal attack's +35%./[Break Attack 4] Attack +35% to enemies when using break.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nAugust 7, 2022 (Sun) 0:30 - August 14, 2022 (Sun) 0:29 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 5,000 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nThis can only be purchased ten times per account.\nThere is no single Order.\nCheck the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
