    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Sleepover Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-08-03 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAsuna, Alice, Silica, and Koharu are dressed in their pajamas in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nSleepover Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Time to Relax] Alice\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Aqua Conversion/Incarnation: Force\nAttack\n59\nDefense\n26\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Aqua Conversion 4] Fire element's damage to enemies -10% and water element's damage to enemies +25%./[Incarnation: Force 4] When equipping 3 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +20%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Night Routine] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nWind Thrust\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n760% damage (All Foes)[Front/Cone/Wide]/▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] Attack +800 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Peak Sleepiness] Silica\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nRapid Star\nSP Cost\n45\nElement\nSlash/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1380% damage (8x hit/Single Foe)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Poison/Status Ailments] Inflict Poison (Stack 1) for 30 sec. Also, the following effects will be added when equipping 3 or more Silica Skill Records in the same set./[Bleed/Status Ailments] Inflict Bleed (Stack 1) for 30 sec./[Burn/Status Ailments] Inflict burn (Stack 1) for 30 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] Inflict Frostbite (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nIncrease status ailment stacks by 5 → 10 → 15 on enemies.\n★4[Awake in the Night] Koharu\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nNight Smash\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nDark\nSkill Effect\n1570% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using dark skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Koharu's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the August 3, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the August 22, 2022 (Mon) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
