    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Yui's Birthday Order\" is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Yui\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-08-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Yui's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Wandering the Cardinal] Yui\n(MOD Skill)\" and \"\n[Little Monster] Yui\n(MOD Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nYui's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Yui Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Yui is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Yui!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Wandering the Cardinal] Yui\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nVertical Light\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1340% damage (4x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +25% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 3 or more of Yui's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1200\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Little Monster] Yui\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nRising Tornado\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nWind\nSkill Effect\n1320% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using wind skills./[Bonus] Attack +1500 against enemies with the slash element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nAugust 1, 2022 (Mon) 0:00 - August 10, 2022 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n4.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Yui!　One ★4 Yui guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
