    "snippet": "Avis destiné aux utilisateurs se connectant à « Sword Art Online Integral Factor ». La limite d'échange disponible pour la Médaille du commerçant d'arts de combat sera réinitialisée le 1/8 2022 à 16h00 (JST/UTC+9).  Collectionnez les « Médailles des arts de combat » et obtenez une variété d'objets chez le commerçant ! Nous avons préparé \"Core Metals\", \"Armament Stone...",
    "full_details": "Notices\nAvailable trade limit for \"Medal of Combat Arts Trader\" resets on 8/1, 2022!\nNOTICES\n2022-07-31 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nThe available trade limit for the Medal of Combat Arts Trader will reset on 8/1, 2022 at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nCollect \"Medals of Combat Arts\" and get a variety of items at the Trader!\nWe've prepared \"Core Metals\", \"Armament Stones\", and \"Release Crystals\" that are needed to acquire proficiency skills!\nAbout Medal of Combat Arts.\nParticipate in the events and gather Medal of Combat Arts!\nYou can get some Medals of Combat Arts from different in-game events.\n\"Medal of Combat Arts\" Trader\nFind the Trader by going to Menu → Items → Enhance/Trade → Trade Limited Items and tapping the Trade Medal of Combat Arts banner.\nYou can also check by going to NPC Trader → Trade Limited Items and tapping the Trade Medal of Combat Arts banner.\nMerchant District/NPC\"Trader\"\nMedal of Combat Arts Trader Lineup\n* The trade limit will reset on the 1st of every month at 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nTradable Item List\nAmount Needed\nTrade Limit\nPermanent Lineup\nCore Metal\n100\n2\nOne-Eyed Beast Armament Stone\n50\n1\nHalf Beast Armament Stone\n47\n1\nBlazing Armament Stone\n44\n1\nRelease Crystal (L)\n5\n5\nRelease Crystal (M)×2\n1\n10\nMartial Arts Text×5\n1\n5\nAwakening Star×5\n3\n10\nGreat Red Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Green Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Yellow Jewel\n3\n5\nGreat Blue Jewel\n3\n5\nExp Crystal L\n3\n1\nExp Crystal M×5\n2\n1\nMemoria Niter L\n50\n1\nMemoria Niter M×10\n50\n1\nMemoria Niter S×20\n50\n1\nRevive Crystal×3\n1\n20\nLimited-Time Only Lineup\n★3[Shadow Fairy Warrior] Kirito\n32\n1\nOS Battle Coat Top\n32\n1\nOS Battle Dress Top\n32\n1\nOS Battle Coat Bottoms\n21\n1\nOS Battle Dress Bottoms\n21\n1\nAugma\n9\n1\nCelebration 2020 Glasses\n2\n1\nDigital 2020 Glasses\n2\n1\n★4[Charming Lady] Asuna\n47\n1\nLucky Rapier\n27\n1\nFortune Mallet\n27\n1\nBlessed Battledore\n27\n1\nHoly Suit Top\n20\n1\nHoly Suit Bottoms\n9\n1\nHoly Costume\n35\n1\nHoly Red Nose\n1\n1\nFluffy Boar Hat\n4\n1\n★4[Chef in Love] Asuna\n44\n1\n★4[Sweet Affection] Yuuki\n44\n1\nNoel Reindeer Top A\n20\n1\nNoel Santa Top A\n20\n1\nNoel Reindeer Bottoms A\n9\n1\nNoel Santa Bottoms A\n9\n1\nNoel Reindeer Hood A\n1\n1\nNoel Santa Hat A\n1\n1\nNoel Cowbell A\n1\n1\nNoel Long Scarf A\n1\n1\nManly Formal Wear\n38\n1\nFine Kimono Set\n38\n1\nZodiac Dog Hat\n4\n1\nFlower Hair Pin\n4\n1\nFluffy Shawl\n1\n1\nModern Chocolate Top B\n26\n1\nLovely Chocolate Top B\n26\n1\nModern Chocolate Bottoms B\n15\n1\nLovely Chocolate Bottoms B\n15\n1\nModern Chocolate Hat B\n7\n1\nLovely Chocolate Hat B\n7\n1\nModern Chocolate Corsage B\n3\n1\nLovely Chocolate Ribbon B\n3\n1\n★4[Gentle Chocola]Kirito\n44\n1\n★4[Coffee Break] Lisbeth\n44\n1\nAvatar\nAvatars from the SAO Movie Ordinal Scale, such as \"OS Battle Coat\", \"OS Battle Dress\", and \"Augma\", have arrived!\nAvatar Images\nLucky Rapier\nFortune Mallet\nBlessed Battledore\n1H Rapier Avatar\n1H Club Avatar\nDagger Avatar\nCelebration 2020 Glasses\nDigital 2020 Glasses\nImportant\nThere are some limited-time items in the Medal of Combat Arts Trader that will update once every 3 months.\nThe next lineup update is planned for 10/1, 2022 (Sat) 4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nDepending on the event, \"Medals of Combat Arts\" may not be available as a reward.\nThe schedule and lineup may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
