    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Yuna's Birthday Order\" is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Yuna\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-07-29 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Yuna's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Singer Under the Trees] Yuna\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Rising Highest Tide] Yuna\n(Connect Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nYuna's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Yuna Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Yuna is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Yuna!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Singer Under the Trees] Yuna\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Enhance Attack/Thin Ice\nAttack\n53\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 4] Attack +900./[Enhance Attack 4] Attack +15%./[Thin Ice 4] Defense -30%, and HP -99% every 3 sec during the buff effect for increased max HP.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nDodge\n[During Rush] Evasion rate +4%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Rising Highest Tide] Yuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nFeint Fire\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1300% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When this skill direct hits, the damage you receive decreases at 50%(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nBoost 10 → 20 → 30 to your own switch guage when hitting with skills.\n- Duration\nJuly 29, 2022 (Fri) 0:00 - August 7, 2022 (Sun) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n4.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Yuna!　One ★4 Yuna guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
