    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance completed(7/22)\nMAINT.\n2022-07-22 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\nWe will be implementing maintenance to correspond to defects in effect within the scheduled dates down below.\n-Scheduled maintenance dates\nJuly 22, 2022 19:00 to 20:00 (JST/UTC+9)\n※There may be changes with the date.\n-Maintenance content\nFixing an issue where some monsters were not displayed in the new content \"LafCof Phantoms & the Ring Gem Temple\"\nFixing an issue where the wrong BGM played in the new content \"LafCof Phantoms & the Ring Gem Temple\"\nFixing the issue where Item icons for categories “Ring” and “Ring Gemstone” are not displayed\nFixing the issue where the text did not display correctly in the new widgets \"LafCof Phantoms & the Ring Gem Temple\" and \"About Rings\"\nFixing the issue where All Out Battle Event NPC names were not displayed correctly\nPlease note that the game can not be played during maintenance.\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\nGo to Notice List"
