    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(7/21)\nMAINT.\n2022-07-20 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n7/21, 2022 12:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\nScheduled Maintenance dates\nAll Out Battle \"Starry Kobold Lord\" begins\n\"New Order\" begins\nWeekly! \"★4 Guaranteed Free 11x Order\" UPDATE\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 7/21 Maintenance\n\"Guild of Guilds\" Season 25\nTons of EXP Event \"Undead Assault 2022\"\nSummer Dress Order\nWeekly! Week 7 of \"★4 Guaranteed Free 11x Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
