    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Checkmate Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-06-25 12:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nYuuki, Leafa, Agil, and Yui are dressed in chess-themed outfits in these new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nCheckmate Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Leaping All About] Yuuki\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Flame Boost/The Legendary Sword's Rule\nAttack\n48\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Flame Boost 4] Elemental damage other than fire dealt to enemies -50%, and fire element's damage to enemies +40%./[The Legendary Sword's Rule] Attack +20% when not equipping any Kirito's Records in the same set.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Inspector of the Board] Leafa\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nFlame Shaft\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n980% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Fire Element Enhance4/Buff] fire element damage +9% for 30 sec./[Fire Element Weak 3/Debuff] Fire element damage to monster +15% for 10 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Tight Line of Defense] Agil\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHoly Judgement\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1450% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Enhance Blunt 3/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +25% for 20 sec./[Mountain of Bodies 3/Buff] Additional damage based on current HP for 30 sec when hitting with switch./[Perish 3/Debuff] Receive 3x damage for 30 sec when hitting with switch.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Road to Promotion] Yui\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nRock Fang\nSP Cost\n45\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1380% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Poison/Status Ailments] Inflict Poison (Stack 1) for 30 sec.Also, the following effects will be added when equipping 3 or more Yui Skill Records in the same set./[Bleed/Status Ailments] Inflict Bleed (Stack 1) for 30 sec./[Burn/Status Ailments] Inflict burn (Stack 1) for 30 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] Inflict Frostbite (Stack 1) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nIncrease status ailment stacks by 5 → 10 → 15 on enemies.\n- Duration\nJune 25, 2022 (Sat) 12:00 - Before the July 13, 2022 (Wed) Maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
