    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Yuuki's Birthday Order\" is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Yuuki\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-05-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Yuuki's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Put Your Heart Into It] Yuuki\n(MOD Skill)\" and \"\n[Declaration of Victory] Yuuki\n\" are now available!\n\"\nYuuki's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Yuuki Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Yuuki is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Yuuki and are at an increased 6.0% Drop Rate!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Put Your Heart Into It] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nMother's Rosary\nSP Cost\n14\nElement\nSlash\nSkill Effect\n1800% damage (11x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Toukou 5/Buff] -50% damage taken for 4 sec.(Invalid when equipped by Partner)/▲▲[Bonus] Attack rises 150 x the number of Yuuki Skill Records in the same set./[Bonus] Damage +30% to enemies when using a non-elemental skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Declaration of Victory] Yuuki\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSplit Rush\nSP Cost\n40\nElement\nSlash\nSkill Effect\n450% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/▲▲▲[Bonus] Your own attack increases by defense x 2 when using a non-elemental skill./[Bonus] Damage +30% to enemies when using a non-elemental skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nMay 23, 2022 (Mon) 0:00 - June 1, 2022 (Wed) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n6.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Yuuki!　One ★4 Yuuki guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
