    "full_details": "Notices\nLineup Updated! One ★4 1H Sword Skill Record guaranteed in the \"★4 1H Sword Guaranteed Order\"!\nShop\n2022-05-21 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nAvailable four Per Player!\nA new lineup is here for the \"★4 1H Sword Guaranteed Order\" where you are\nguaranteed\none 1H Sword★4 Skill Record!\nAll ★4 Skill Records are \"1H Swords\"!\nIncludes\n\"MOD Skills\"\n,\n\"Awakening Skills\"\n, and\n\"Burst Skills\"\n!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Release of Power] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nBlaze Swipe\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1110% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Attack against burned enemies increases 30%./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Piercing Hero] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nFull-Flamed Savage\nSP Cost\n20\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n900% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Enhance Attack 4/Buff] Attack +15% for 20 sec.\n* More than regular increase in switch guage.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Vagabond's Slash] Kirito\nNormally\nBurst Skills\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSlash Assassinate Burst\nSkill Name\nSlash Assassinate\nSP Cost\n26\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nElement\nSlash/\nDark\nActivation Requirements\nDark\n→Slash→Slash\nSkill Effect\nBurst Skill Effect\n850% damage (All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dusk 4/Debuff] Enemy's hit rate -15% for 15 sec.(Evasion more likely to occur)\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n1700% damage (5x hit/All Foes)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Dusk 4/Debuff] Enemy's hit rate -15% for 15 sec.(Evasion more likely to occur)/[Bonus] When this skill direct hits, reduces all skill's cool times by 2 sec./[Bonus] Recovers 5 SP when the monster is defeated with this skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n- Duration\nStarts after the May 21, 2022 17:00 - May 28, 2022 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 2,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nThere is no single Order.\nThis 11 Order can only be used 4 times per player.\nThe previously bought \"★4 1H Sword Guaranteed Order\" is available for purchase again if you have already purchased it 4 times.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
