    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Blossoming Blue Roses Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-04-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNew ★4 Eugeo Skill Records are here with four different outfits!\nThe \"\nBlossoming Blue Roses Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Pure Love Letter] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nSharp Spark\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nThrust/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1310% damage (5x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Combination 4/Buff] Switch damage multiples +300% for 10 sec./[Slash Attack Down 4/Debuff] Enemy slash attack -20% for 15 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Blue-Eyed Lady] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nShining Swipe\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n1240% damage (2x hit/All Foes)[Front/Cone/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using holy skills./[Bonus] When equipping 2 or more of Alice's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +1000.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n★4[Fake Order] Eugeo\nSkill Name\nCrushing Impact/Mallet Blow/Evasion\nAttack\n63\nDefense\n30\nHP\n2650\nSkill Effect\n[Crushing Impact 4] Attack +800 when attacking with blunt element./[Mallet Blow 4] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +30% against enemies with debuff status (Mark, Small Mark, Death Mark)./[Evasion 4] Evasion rate +10%. *It will not be activated with focus attack.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Fake Lady] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHydro Smite\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nBlunt/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1670% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Muscle Build Up 4/Buff] Attack + 1% per stack (Stack3) during 20 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nAttack +2500 → 5000 → 7500 to enemies when using break.\n- Duration\nApril 1, 2022 (Fri) 0:00 - April 30, 2022 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
