    "full_details": "Notices\nThe \"Sparkling Station Order\" is here! One ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nShop\n2022-03-16 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nKirito, Alice, Eugeo, and Silica are dressed as station staff, and are here as new ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nSparkling Station Order\n\" is here! Get one ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 3!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[On Track to the Future] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n2H Spear\nSkill Name\nEarth Orbit\nSP Cost\n24\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1560% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, the damage you receive decreases at 50%.(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated).\n* Increase in break gauge amount.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nConnect Chain\nIncrease in break gauge to enemy by +20% → 40% → 60%\n★4[Train Conductor] Eugeo\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nWhirl Flash\nSP Cost\n30\nElement\nSlash/\nHoly\nSkill Effect\n660% damage (3x hit/All Foes)[Center/Arc/Wide]/▲▲▲[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 250%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Lovely Express] Silica\nSkill Name\nIce Indemnity/Enhance Frostbite\nAttack\n52\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2875\nSkill Effect\n[Ice Indemnity 3] When you are frostbitten, water element damage +40%./[Enhance Frostbite 3] Frostbite damage -30%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Eliminating Danger] Alice\nWeapon Type\n1H Sword\nSkill Name\nSplash Wave\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nSlash/\nWater\nSkill Effect\n1330% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Splashing Water Demon 3/Buff] Water element damage +45% for 8 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] When the target is hit using the Switch, make it Frostbite (Stack 5) for 30 sec.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n[During Rush] Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nStarts after the March 16, 2022 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the April 6, 2022 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
