    "full_details": "Notices\n【4 Year Anniversary】Half-Price Sale is here! You can get items for Equipment Refinement from Appraisal! Get ★4 Ingots guaranteed from Appraise 11! Dungeon Boss Ingots have been added!\nShop\n2022-03-09 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 4 Year Anniversary Campaign!\nThe\nAppraise 11 Half-Price Sale\nis on now! Go see Lisbeth and get the Hot Ore used in forging equipment, or Ingots used to refine equipment!\nOne ★4 Ingot is guaranteed\nin Appraise 11!\nIn addition, seven new Dungeon Boss Ingots have been added to the lineup from now on.\nWe hope you enjoy Equipment Refinement more than ever!\nMore \"Equipment Refinement\" Details Here\nCommission Fee\nAppraise 1: 200 Arcana Gems\nAppraise 11: 1000 Arcana Gems (Half-Price Sale!)\nAppraise 11 Half-Price Sale Duration\nStarts after the March 9, 2022 (Wed) maintenance - March 25, 2022 (Fri) 16:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n【★4 Ingot】\nItem Name\nItem effect\nFlashing Flame Ingot\nPositive Effect:Critical damage +32.5% for fire skill weakness *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than fire\nFlashing Aqua Ingot\nPositive Effect:Critical damage +32.5% for water skill weakness *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than water\nFlashing Wind Ingot\nPositive Effect:Critical damage +32.5% for wind skill weakness *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than wind\nFlashing Earth Ingot\nPositive Effect:Critical damage +32.5% for earth skill weakness *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than earth\nFlashing Shine Ingot\nPositive Effect:Critical damage +32.5% for holy skill weakness *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than holy\nFlashing Dark Ingot\nPositive Effect:Critical damage +32.5% for dark skill weakness *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than dark\nDemon God Flame Ingot\nPositive Effect:Fire skill weakness damage +30% *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than fire\nDemon God Aqua Ingot\nPositive Effect:Water skill weakness damage +30% *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than water\nDemon God Wind Ingot\nPositive Effect:Wind skill weakness damage +30% *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than wind\nDemon God Earth Ingot\nPositive Effect:Earth skill weakness damage +30% *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than earth\nDemon God Shine Ingot\nPositive Effect:Holy skill weakness damage +30% *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than holy\nDemon God Dark Ingot\nPositive Effect:Dark skill weakness damage +30% *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than dark\nFlashing Slash Ingot\nPositive Effect:Slash elemental skill weakness critical damage +30% *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than slash\nFlashing Blunt Ingot\nPositive Effect:Blunt elemental skill weakness critical damage +30% *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than blunt\nFlashing Thrust Ingot\nPositive Effect:Thrust elemental skill weakness critical damage +30% *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than thrust\nDemon God Slash Ingot\nPositive Effect:Slash elemental weakness damage +27.5% *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than slash\nDemon God Blunt Ingot\nPositive Effect:Blunt elemental weakness damage +27.5% *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than blunt\nDemon God Thrust Ingot\nPositive Effect:Thrust elemental weakness damage +27.5% *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than thrust\nAdded seven Dungeon Boss Ingots that can be obtained from dungeon bosses on 50F and higher.\n[New Dungeon Boss Ingots Added]\nItem Name\nItem effect\nBlueite Golem 00 Ingot\nPositive Effect:Proficiency Level Exp +100 for Shield *Cannot stack *Invalid with Partner　Negative Effect:Max HP -50%\nWhite Wyrm Ingot\nPositive Effect:Critical damage +15% for fire skills *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than fire\nMermaid Ingot\nPositive Effect:Proficiency Level Exp +100 for 1H Rapier *Cannot stack *Invalid with Partner　Negative Effect:Max HP -50%\nRelentless Ravager Ingot\nPositive Effect:Critical damage +15% for earth skills *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:\tDamage -50% for elements other than earth\nGrand Champ Ingot\nPositive Effect:Proficiency Level Exp +100 for Dagger *Cannot stack *Invalid with Partner　Negative Effect:Max HP -50%\nWreckingman Ingot\nPositive Effect:Critical damage +15% for dark skills *Cannot stack　Negative Effect:Damage -50% for elements other than dark\nMillennial Wolf Ingot\nPositive Effect:Proficiency Level Exp +100 for 1H Sword *Cannot stack *Invalid with Partner　Negative Effect:Max HP -50%\n- Important\nCheck the in-game details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\nNo limited-edition Ingots will be added.\nAn 《Ingot》's positive effect is registered when \"Composition\" reaches the max level.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
