    "full_details": "Notices\n【4 Year Anniversary】\"Worldwide 4 Year Anniversary! Up to 330 Free Orders\" is here!\nShop\n2022-03-01 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nSword Art Online Integral Factor's Worldwide 4 Year Anniversary Order!\n\"\nWorldwide 4 Year Anniversary! Up to 330 Free Orders\n\" is here! Get up to 330 Skill Records!\nDuring the \"\nWorldwide 4 Year Anniversary! Up to 330 Free Orders\n\", one free 11x Order will be available every day. Players can take advantage of this for up to 30 days!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Blue Rose in the Night Sky] Kirito\nSkill Name\nPower Rise/Dark Conversion/Spirit Color\nAttack\n55\nDefense\n50\nHP\n2500\nSkill Effect\n[Power Rise 3] Attack +800./[Dark Conversion 4] Holy element's damage to enemies -10% and dark element's damage to enemies +25%./[Spirit Color] Effect changes depending on the Skill Records in the same set.When equipping 1 or more of Asuna's Skill Records: Max HP +10%.When equipping 1 or more of Sinon's Skill Records: Attack +20%.When equipping 1 or more of Leafa's Skill Records: Additional damage +500.When equipping 1 or more of Alice's Skill Records: Critical rate +10%.When equipping 1 or more of Eugeo's Skill Records: Critical damage +10%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSwordman's Awakening\n[When Rush Activates] Recover all status ailments.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Elegant Butler] Asuna\nSkill Name\nThere's a case!/Frostbite Blow\nAttack\n58\nDefense\n36\nHP\n2425\nSkill Effect\n[There's a case!] Critical damage +15%./[Frostbite Blow 3] Attack against enemies with frostbite increases 18%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Period\nMarch 1, 2022 (Tue) 4:00 - June 1, 2022 (Wed) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Important\nDuring this event, players will receive one free 11x Order per day for up to 30 days total.\nThere is no single Order.\nNew days begin at 4:00 am every day (JST/UTC+9).\nIncludes ★2 to ★4 Skill Records.\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nPlease be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
