    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Koharu's Birthday Order\" is here! On Step 3, one ★4 \"Koharu\" is guaranteed!\nShop\n2022-02-23 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTo celebrate Koharu's birthday, the new ★4 Skill Records \"\n[Bonding with a Loyal Dog] Koharu\n(Awakening Skill)\" and \"\n[Attack Supporter] Koharu\n(Awakening Skill)\" are now available!\n\"\nKoharu's Birthday Order\n\" is here! Featuring ★4 Koharu Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOn Step 3,\none ★4 Koharu is guaranteed! Additionally, all ★4 characters are Koharu!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Bonding with a Loyal Dog] Koharu\nSkill Name\nAdvance Trooper/Enhance Berserk/Everyone Is Different\nAttack\n56\nDefense\n40\nHP\n2350\nSkill Effect\n[Advance Trooper 3] Attack +300./[Enhance Berserk 4] When the player is Status Ailments (Poison, Burn, Bleed, Frostbite, Curse, Debility), Attack +25%/[Everyone Is Different 3] Adds Fatal Poison effect on yourself for 30 sec when you hit using Switch (Stack 50).2.2%＋(number of stacks x 0.2%) damage\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n[When Rush Activates] Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Attack Supporter] Koharu\nWeapon Type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nFlame Invasion\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nSlash/\nFire\nSkill Effect\n1250% damage (3x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[Poison Boost 4/Debuff] Lowers enemy's poison resistance 50% for 30 sec (easier to inflict Poison) and poison damage +100%./▲▲[Bonus] Increase status ailment stacks by 8 on enemies when hitting poisoned enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nMind's Eye\n[During Rush] Critical damage +7.5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nFebruary 23, 2022 (Wed) 0:00 - March 4, 2022 (Fri) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n2.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n4.0% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nAll ★4 Skill Records are Koharu!　One ★4 Koharu guaranteed!\n- Important\nPlease see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\nAll Steps are 11 Orders.\nAfter Step 3, you will return to Step 1.\nPlease be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nThe Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\nGo to Notice List"
