    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(2/17)\nMAINT.\n2022-02-16 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n2/17, 2022 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\n▼Newly Implemented & New Events\n21st \"Guild of Guilds\" Ranking Event begins\nThe Scenario Event \"Ordinal Scale Immortal Fragments\" is back!\nIf you have previously played the \"Ordinal Scale Immortal Fragments\" event, your progress will continue from the following points.\nTotal Score and Score Rewards\nChallenge rewards\nAchievements and achievement progress\nAmount traded\nEven if you have completed the scenario quest previously, you will be able to accept the request from the beginning and receive rewards.\nAdded Defense Battle ver. 2: \"Lizard Warrior Attack!\" Event rewards\n\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 2/17 Maintenance\n\"Rabbit Hunt\"\n\"Firefighter Order\"\n\"Brilliant Order\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
