    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(1/13)\nMAINT.\n2022-01-12 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n1/13, 2022 14:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\nMaintenance content\n・20th \"Guild of Guilds\" Ranking Event begins\n・Hunting Event \"Warder Chief Hunt\" begins\n・Added Tons of EXP Event \"New Year's Assault\" Event rewards\n・\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 1/13 Maintenance\n・\nFishing Ranking Event, \"2021 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition\"\n・\nHoliday Campaign \"Armament Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign\"\n・\nHoliday Campaign \"Multiple Rounds: 4x Experience Character Quest Campaign\"\n・\nHoliday Campaign \"Daily Anniversary Dungeon\"\n・\n\"Aria of a Starless Night Order Part 4\"\n・\nHoliday Campaign \"Appraise 11\" Half-Price Sale\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
