    "full_details": "Notices\nThe New Year's Grab Bag 2022 Order is here! Two ★4 Skill Records guaranteed! 20% ★4 Skill Record Rate!\nShop\n2022-01-01 00:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nTen times per player!\nGet\ntwo ★4 Skill Records guaranteed\nat the \"New Year's Grab Bag 2022 Order\"!\nThe\n20% total drop rate\ndoes not include the guaranteed ★4 Skill Record!\n【Some ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Dragon God's Leap] Kirito\nWeapon Type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nHatchet Ground\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1550% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/[Parry4/Buff] When the target is hit using the Switch, the damage you receive decreases at 50%.(Effect will disappear after 20 sec if not activated)./[Celebration4/Buff] Your HP recovers for 30 sec.(1.5%/3sec)Effect will be removed with damage.\n* Collecting aggro from enemy.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Attention to Detail] Asuna\nWeapon Type\n1H Rapier\nSkill Name\nRock Torrent\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nThrust/\nEarth\nSkill Effect\n1230% damage (6x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Long/Mid]/▲▲[Bonus] Damage +50% to enemies when using earth skills./[Bonus] When equipping 1 or more of Kirito's Skill Records in the same set, Attack +500\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nMOD Skill\n- Duration\nJanuary 1, 2022 (Sat) 0:00 - January 15, 2022 (Sat) 23:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n11 Order for 5,000 Arcana Gems\n- Important\n·This can only be purchased ten times per account.\n·There is no single Order.\n·Check the in-game Order details for more information on the entire lineup and the drop rates.\n·Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
