    "full_details": "Notices\nColor the New Year with elegant outfit! The Divine New Year Dress Avatar Order is here!\nShop\n2021-12-30 16:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nColor the New Year with elegant outfit!\nThe \"\nDivine New Year Dress Avatar Order\n\" is here including the \"New Year Dress Avatar\", \"Priestess and Priest Avatar\", and \"New Year's Avatar '21\"!\n【New Year Dress Avatar Images】\n【Priestess and Priest Avatar Images】\n【New Year's Avatar '21 Avatar Images】\n- Duration\nStarts after the December 30, 2021 16:00 - January 15, 2022 15:59 (JST/UTC+9)\n- Offers\n1 Order for 150 Arcana Gems\n11 Order for 1,500 Arcana Gems\n- Important\n·Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n·Koharu can also equip female avatars and accessories.\n·Some of the avatars available in this Order have equip conditions that depend on the equipped character's gender.\n·Kirito's and Asuna's faces and hairstyles are not included.\n·All avatars, both female and male, are available in the Order regardless of your own character's gender.\n·Please be aware that the period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
