    "full_details": "Notices\nNotice for maintenance(12/22)\nMAINT.\n2021-12-21 18:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nNotice for those users logging on to \"Sword Art Online Integral Factor.\"\nMaintenance will be in effect during the dates below.\nScheduled Maintenance dates\n12/22, 2021 13:00 to 17:00 (Tentative)(JST/UTC+9)\nMaintenance content\n・Fishing Ranking Event, \"2021 New Year's Eve Fishing Competition\" begins\n・Added Christmas Scenario Event \"Holy Night Gourmet Banquet\" Event rewards\n・\"Chaos Boss Dungeon Part 19\" Legion Butterfly Chaos begins\n・Holiday Campaign \"Multiple Rounds: 4x Experience Character Quest Campaign\" begins\n・Holiday Campaign \"Great Enhancement Event  VS Yuuki +2\" begins\n・Holiday Campaign \"Daily Dungeon +2\" begins\n・Holiday Campaign \"Chaos Showdown: All Open\" begins\n・\"New Order\" begins\nEnding Soon! Available until the start of the 12/22 Maintenance\n・\nHoliday Campaign \"Daily Dungeon +1\"\n・\n\"Aria of a Starless Night Order Part 3\"\n・\n\"★4 1H Club Guaranteed Order\"\n・\nHoliday Campaign Search \"Unlock MOD III Double Drop Rate Campaign\"\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n* Maintenance duration and content are subject to change.\nGo to Notice List"
