    "full_details": "Notices\nHoliday Campaign! Daily Dungeon +1 is here! For a limited time, you can clear the dungeon twice!\nEVENT\n2021-12-17 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nDaily Dungeons that can usually only be cleared once per day can be cleared twice per day for the duration of the event!\n\"Daily Dungeons\" are a special type of solo dungeon that you can only clear once per day. There are ten varieties of \"Daily Dungeons\" to choose from, each with different rewards such as EXP and equipment enhancement items.\nOnce you clear a Daily Dungeon, you can't challenge a new one until the system resets at 4:00 AM (JST/UTC+9).\nEvent Start\nBlackiron Palace\nDaily Dungeon\nPeriod\nDecember 17, 2021 (Fri) 4:00 - Before the December 22, 2021 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nList of \"Daily Dungeons\"\nWeapon Proficiency Enhancement Version(Weapon Proficiency items attainable)\nAttainable Items:\nMartial Arts Text, Release Crystals (S), Release Crystals (M), Release Crystals (L),Revive Crystals\nEXP Version (Recovery items and EXP attainable)\nAttainable Items:\nEXP, Exp Crystals S, Restorative Potion, Revive Crystals\nCol Version (Col attainable)\nAttainable Items:\nCol,Revive Crystals\nSkill Enhancement Version(Skill Record enhancement materials attainable)\nAttainable Items:\nRecord Frame S, Record Frame M, Record Frame L, Col, Revive Crystals\nEquipment Enhancement Version (Equipment enhancement materials attainable)\nAttainable Items:\nGlare Stones, Glare Rigid Stones, Glare Dragon Stones, Col, Revive Crystals\nEquipment Transformation Version (Equipment transformation materials attainable)\nAttainable Items:\nSlicing Stones, Piercing Stones, Striking Stones, Blocking Stones, Refining Hammers\nSlicing Stones+, Piercing Stones+, Striking Stones+, Blocking Stones+, Refining Hammers+, Revive Crystals\nSkill Transform & Awaken Version.\n- Skill Transform & Awaken Ver./R (Get Skill Record awakening material and Red Jewel transformation material)\nAttainable Items:\nAwakening Stars, Star Fragments, Red Jewels, High Red Jewels, Great Red Jewels, Record Kit S, Record Kit M, Revive Crystals\n- Skill Transform & Awaken Ver./G (Get Skill Record awakening material and Green Jewel transformation material)\nAttainable Items:\nAwakening Stars, Star Fragments, Green Jewels, High Green Jewels, Great Green Jewels, Record Kit S, Record Kit M, Revive Crystals\n- Skill Transform & Awaken Ver./Y (Get Skill Record awakening material and Yellow Jewel transformation material)\nAttainable Items:\nAwakening Stars, Star Fragments, Yellow Jewels, High Yellow Jewels, Great Yellow Jewels, Record Kit S, Record Kit M, Revive Crystals\n- Skill Transform & Awaken Ver./B (Get Skill Record awakening material and Blue Jewel transformation material)\nAttainable Items:\nAwakening Stars, Star Fragments, Blue Jewels, High Blue Jewels, Great Blue Jewels, Record Kit S, Record Kit M, Revive Crystals\n* \"Daily Dungeons\" are updated daily at 4:00am. After this, the previous day's dungeons cannot be attempted.(JST/UTC+9).\n* Daily Dungeon +2 starts after the December 22 (Wed) maintenance. During this part of the event, you can clear the dungeon up to three times a day.\nDaily Dungeons that have been cleared twice prior to the December 22 (Wed) maintenance can be cleared one more time after maintenance is complete.\n* The schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List"
