    "full_details": "Notices\nHoliday Campaign! Armament Stone Increased Drop Rate Campaign! Increased drop rates for Integral Series & Nox Integral Series production materials!\nCampaign\n2021-12-08 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nHoliday Campaign!\nThe drop rates for Integral Series and Nox Integral Series production materials have been increased for a limited time in the Labyrinth!\nThis is a good opportunity to get any you haven't managed to obtain yet.\nPoints with increased drop rates\nProduction materials\n13F Labyrinth – Entry\nBlazing Armament Stone\nBlazing Flame Arms\n13F Labyrinth – Interior\n14F Labyrinth – Entry\nHalf Beast Armament Stone\nHalf Beast's Horn\n14F Labyrinth – Interior\n20F Labyrinth – Entry\nOne-Eyed Beast Armament Stone\nOne-Eyed Beast Fang\n20F Labyrinth – Interior\n25F Labyrinth – Entry\nAsura Armament Stone\nAsura Iron Ball\n25F Labyrinth – Interior\n27F Labyrinth – Entry\nCrossgigas Armament Stone\nCrossgigas Iron Chain\n27F Labyrinth – Interior\n35F Labyrinth – Entry\nSticky Thing Armament Stone\nSticky Thing Fluid\n35F Labyrinth – Interior\nLabyrinth - Interior has the highest drop rates of all the floors, so work together as a party to collect the production materials that drop from the bosses and get your hands on the Integral Series and Nox Integral Series!\nCampaign Duration\nStarts after the December 8, 2021 (Wed) maintenance and ends before the January 13, 2022 (Thu) maintenance (JST/UTC+9).\nIntegral Series and Nox Integral Series\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nCapabilities of ★5\nItem Icon\nItem Name\nType\nCapabilities of ★5\nGusion\n1H Sword\nAttack 1220\nNox Gusion\n1H Sword\nAttack 1434\nArc Angel\n1H Rapier\nAttack 1197\nNox Arc Angel\n1H Rapier\nAttack 1407\nStingray\n1H Club\nAttack 1220\nNox Stingray\n1H Club\nAttack 1434\nAfter Glow\n2H Axe\nAttack 1382\nNox After Glow\n2H Axe\nAttack 1644\nGluttony\n2H Spear\nAttack 1357\nNox Gluttony\n2H Spear\nAttack 1614\nRadgrid\nBow\nAttack 1331\nNox Radgrid\nBow\nAttack 1583\nNocturne\nDagger\nAttack 1197\nNox Nocturne\nDagger\nAttack 1407\n* Values are based on maximum enhancement at ★5 rarity, Lv. 100.\nDetails about the \"Integral series\" are available here\nDetails about the \"Nox Integral Series\" are available here\nImportant\n‧The quest schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
