    "full_details": "Notices\nKlein's Birthday Celebration is here! \"Get loads of EXPs! Klein's Training Regimen +2\" underway! Clear it up to 3 times a day!\nEVENT\n2021-11-26 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nA dungeon where you can receive tons of EXP and recovery items as rewards is now available!\nYou can challenge yourself with up to 4 difficulties of \"Get loads of EXPs! Klein's Training Regimen +2\" depending on your progress through the Main Quest.\nCelebrate Klein's birthday on November 28 with a limited-edition Stamp!\nPlus, you can clear each difficulty up to 3 times a day.\nRewards\nEarn \"Healing Potions\" from score rewards and items like \"Martial Arts Texts\", \"Revive Crystals\", and \"Release Crystals (S)\" from challenge rewards by clearing the dungeons daily.\nYou can also get a\nlimited-edition Stamp\nfrom the score rewards of Klein's Training Regimen: S this time.\nYou can get EXP from monsters appearing in dungeons, and \"Exp Crystal M\" is available as a Challenge Reward for difficulty levels \"L\" and \"XL\".\n* The dungeon will update every day at  4:00 (JST/UTC+9).\nDifficulty\nEXP amount\nKlein's Training Regimen : S\n20,000\nKlein's Training Regimen : M\n30,000\nKlein's Training Regimen : L\n50,000\nKlein's Training Regimen : XL\n100,000\nUse Boost Mode to greatly increase the amount of EXP gained!\nSee here for more details on Boost Mode.\nNormal\nDifficulty\nDaily EXP Earned (After Clearing 3 Times)\nEXP Earned (7 Days)\nLv Reached When Starting from Lv 1\nS\n60,000\n420,000\nLv1→Lv62\nM\n90,000\n630,000\nLv1→Lv65\nL\n450,000\n3,150,000\nLv1→Lv76\nXL\n1,800,000\n12,600,000\nLv1→Lv83\n* Includes \"Exp Crystal M\"\nUsing Boost Mode\nDifficulty\nDaily EXP Earned (After Clearing 3 Times)\nEXP Earned (7 Days)\nLv Reached When Starting from Lv 1\nS\n240,000\n1,680,000\nLv1→Lv72\nM\n360,000\n2,520,000\nLv1→Lv74\nL\n900,000\n6,300,000\nLv1→Lv80\nXL\n2,700,000\n18,900,000\nLv1→Lv86\n* Includes \"Exp Crystal M\"\nLimited-edition Stamp\nStamp Name\nStamp Displayed\nLeader of Furinkazan\nEvent Period\nNovember 26, 2021 (Fri) 4:00 - December 3, 2021 (Fri) 3:59 (JST/UTC+9)\nHow to Participate\nTalk to \"klein\" at the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to challenge the dungeon.\nParticipation Requirements\nKlein's Training Regimen : S  - Unlocked after clearing 1F Main Quest \"The Indomitable Fang\"\nKlein's Training Regimen : M  - Unlocked after clearing the 4F Main Quest.\nKlein's Training Regimen : L  - Unlocked after clearing the 7F Main Quest.\nKlein's Training Regimen : XL - Unlocked after clearing the 20F Main Quest.\nChallenge Rewards\nKlein's Training Regimen : S\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nMartial Arts Text\n1\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRestorative Potion\n10\nCompleted within 3 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRevive Crystal\n1\nKlein's Training Regimen : M\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nMartial Arts Text\n1\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRestorative Potion\n10\nCompleted within 3 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nCleansing Potion\n1\nKlein's Training Regimen : L\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nExp Crystal M\n1\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRestorative Potion\n10\nCompleted within 3 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRelease Crystal (S)\n1\nKlein's Training Regimen : XL\nChallenge Name\nReward\nAmount\nDefeat boss (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nExp Crystal M\n5\nCompleted without any tumble (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRestorative Potion\n10\nCompleted within 3 minutes (Able to achieve repeatedly)\nRelease Crystal (S)\n2\nImportant\n‧Check in-game for more information on score rewards.\n‧The quest schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
