    "full_details": "Notices\nThe Black Explorer Order is here! One new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\nShop\n2021-11-21 17:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nFrom SWORD ART ONLINE Arcade: Deep Explorer comes the new Kirito-colored Alice, Yuuki, Argo, and Lisbeth ★4 Skill Records!\nThe \"\nBlack Explorer Order\n\" is here! Get one new ★4 Skill Record guaranteed on Step 5!\nBoosted rates for new ★4 Skill Records!\nOn Step 1, you can get 11 Orders for 1,250 Arcana Gems!\nOne ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 3!\nOne new ★4 Skill Record is guaranteed on Step 5!\n【New ★4 Skill Records】\n★4[Black in the Breeze] Lisbeth\nweapon type\n1H Club\nSkill Name\nRefuge Light\nSP Cost\n28\nElement\nBlunt/\nHoly\nSkill effect\n1230% damage (2x hit/Single Foe)[Front/Arc/Mid]/[PT Enhance Blunt 4/Buff] Damage done to enemies weak to blunt +30% for your party for 20 sec./\n▲[Bonus] Recovers 5 SP when the monster is defeated with this skill.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nPincer Attack\n[During Rush] Damage +15% when using switch.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[Information Dealer in Black] Argo\nweapon type\n2H Axe\nSkill Name\nAir Smite\nSP Cost\n26\nElement\nBlunt/\nWind\nSkill effect\n1420% damage (All Foes)[Front/Arc/Mid]/\n▲[Bonus] When enemy's HP is 50% or up, attack will increase 100%.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\n★4[Playing in Black] Yuuki\nweapon type\nDagger\nSkill Name\nGaia Curve\nSP Cost\n18\nElement\nSlash/\nEarth\nSkill effect\n1250% damage (Single Foe)[Front/Cone/Small]/[Burn/Status Ailments] When the target is hit using the Switch, make it Burn (Stack 1) for 30 sec./[Bleed/Status Ailments] When the target is hit using the Switch, make it Bleed (Stack 1) for 30 sec./[Frostbite/Status Ailments] When the target is hit using the Switch, make it Frostbite (Stack 1) for 30 sec./\n▲[Bonus] Increase status ailment stacks by 5 on enemies when hitting poisoned enemies.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nFury\n［When Rush Activates］ Own max HP 20% recovers.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n★4[A Black Knight's Rest] Alice\nSkill Name\nEncircle Break/Iron-Fisted Punishment\nAttack\n62\nDefense\n32\nHP\n2275\nSkill effect\n[Encircle Break 3] Increase in break gauge to enemy by +27.5%/[Iron-Fisted Punishment 4] Attack +500 when attacking with blunt element.\n*Evolving & Maximum Breakthrough\nAwakening Skill\nSoaring Flash\n［During Rush］ Attack +5%.\n*Maximum Awakening Skill\n- Duration\nNovember 21, 2021 (Sun) 17:00 - Before the December 15, 2021 (Wed) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\n- Step Offers/Details\nStep Number\nOffers\nDetails\nSTEP1\n1,250 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP2\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP3\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne ★4 Skill Record guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP4\n2,500 Arcana Gems\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\nSTEP5\n2,500 Arcana Gems\nOne New ★4 Skill Record Guaranteed!\n1.3% total Drop Rate for featured Skill Records\n- Important\n‧Please see the in-game Order details for the entire lineup.\n‧All Steps are 11 Orders.\n‧The Drop Rates for each rarity may vary depending on the Step. For more information, tap Order Details/Drop Rate.\n‧After Step 5, you will return to Step 1.\n‧Please be aware that the event period may change without prior notice.\nGo to Notice List"
