    "full_details": "Notices\n\"Heapin' 10M EXP Event\" is here!\nEVENT\n2021-11-20 04:00:00\n（JST/GMT+9）\nA special quest to help you conquer Aincrad is here!\nAccept the quest, move to the designated map, and clear it by defeating the monsters to claim your rewards.\nPlus, the difficulty increases as you progress through the quest.\nGet a total of 10 million EXP from Quest Rewards!\nAim to clear all the quests!\nHow to Participate\nTalk to the \"Heapin' 10M EXP Event\" NPC in the \"Teleport Gate Plaza\" to accept the quest.\nEvent Period\nNovember 20, 2021 (Sat) 4:00 - Before the November 30, 2021 (Tue) maintenance (JST/UTC+9)\nParticipation Requirements\nComplete Main quest [The Indomitable Fang]\nQuest Rewards\nRelease Dates\nRelease Quest\nReward\nAmount\nRelease condition\nNovember 20, 2021 4:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 10M EXP Event 1\nEXP\n100,000\nー\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nNovember 21, 2021 4:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 10M EXP Event 2\nEXP\n200,000\nClear the 2F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nNovember 22, 2021 4:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 10M EXP Event 3\nEXP\n300,000\nClear the 3F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nNovember 23, 2021 4:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 10M EXP Event 4\nEXP\n400,000\nClear the 5F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nNovember 24, 2021 4:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 10M EXP Event 5\nEXP\n1,000,000\nClear the 7F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nNovember 25, 2021 4:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 10M EXP Event 6\nEXP\n3,000,000\nClear the 9F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nNovember 26, 2021 4:00 - (JST/UTC+9)\nHeapin' 10M EXP Event 7\nEXP\n5,000,000\nClear the 10F Main Quest through the end.\nRevive Crystal\n10\nRestorative Potion\n30\nCleansing Potion\n30\nImportant\n‧The quest schedule may be subject to change without notice. Thank you for your understanding.\nGo to Notice List",
